(67102, 1990, 587, '<td valign="top">WOW striking! Great catch of the rays. I like this alot. I wish only that the clouds had a touch more definition. A winner. good job.</td>', 'WOW striking! Great catch of the rays. I like this alot. I wish only that the clouds had a touch more definition. A winner. good job.', '2002-06-04 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
