(67128, 1995, 1031, '<td valign="top">Something bothers me a bit about the jawline/neck area: too dark/contrasty, too sharp, maybe both. I like the overall style/composition fine!</td>', 'Something bothers me a bit about the jawline/neck area: too dark/contrasty, too sharp, maybe both. I like the overall style/composition fine!', '2002-06-04 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67129, 1995, 1037, '<td valign="top">You''re good at this kind of photography, but it''s not something I like much. I''d rather be shown who she is than what she looks like with nice makeup and windswept hair.</td>', 'You''re good at this kind of photography, but it''s not something I like much. I''d rather be shown who she is than what she looks like with nice makeup and windswept hair.', '2002-06-04 06:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67130, 1995, 1882, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Striking girl and great lighting effects!  Love the fan blowing her hair back; very sexy!</td>', 'Wow!  Striking girl and great lighting effects!  Love the fan blowing her hair back; very sexy!', '2002-06-04 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67131, 1995, 554, '<td valign="top">you both get 10</td>', 'you both get 10', '2002-06-04 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67132, 1995, 258, '<td valign="top">Nice but does it need more sharpness.</td>', 'Nice but does it need more sharpness.', '2002-06-05 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67133, 1995, 543, '<td valign="top">Good ''tude on her, and I like the motion blur on her hair - gives her some motion.  The shadows on the bg are a little distracting, esp at R.  If you''d moved her a little closer to the camera, they might have landed out of frame.  The whites (except for the blowouts on the collar and sleeve) look a little dingy.</td>', 'Good ''tude on her, and I like the motion blur on her hair - gives her some motion.  The shadows on the bg are a little distracting, esp at R.  If you''d moved her a little closer to the camera, they might have landed out of frame.  The whites (except for the blowouts on the collar and sleeve) look a little dingy.', '2002-06-05 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67134, 1995, 208, '<td valign="top">Well done. I can''t decide if I like the soft focus on her face, but isn''t that the style?</td>', 'Well done. I can''t decide if I like the soft focus on her face, but isn''t that the style?', '2002-06-05 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67135, 1995, 2023, '<td valign="top">I like how the hair flow in the picture</td>', 'I like how the hair flow in the picture', '2002-06-05 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67136, 1995, 862, '<td valign="top">The wind-blown hair is a nice touch.  I like how my attention is drawn to her eyes.</td>', 'The wind-blown hair is a nice touch.  I like how my attention is drawn to her eyes.', '2002-06-05 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67137, 1995, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait photo!  good job!</td>', 'Very nice portrait photo!  good job!', '2002-06-05 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67138, 1995, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty good model shoot.  Nice use of lighting, good focus, nice contrasts all around.  Sorry, but I have no constructive remarks.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 6 B&amp;W 9 total 7</td>', 'Pretty good model shoot.  Nice use of lighting, good focus, nice contrasts all around.  Sorry, but I have no constructive remarks.Photo 9 Creativity 6 B&W 9 total 7', '2002-06-05 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67139, 1995, 1707, '<td valign="top">Well, she should be a model.  You should do the cards models give to agencies.  For a hint: color is for models and b&amp;w is for actors.</td>', 'Well, she should be a model.  You should do the cards models give to agencies.  For a hint: color is for models and b&w is for actors.', '2002-06-06 06:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67140, 1995, 472, '<td valign="top">sort of looks like mariah carey. are you using a wind-machine, aka fan?  looks good in black and white.</td>', 'sort of looks like mariah carey. are you using a wind-machine, aka fan?  looks good in black and white.', '2002-06-06 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67141, 1995, 1446, '<td valign="top">Pretty young lady, nice portrait.</td>', 'Pretty young lady, nice portrait.', '2002-06-06 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67142, 1995, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very good! I give this one a high score. I like the wind blown hair effect. Lighting is generally good, but there are some shadows that break up the back lighting a bit.</td>', 'Very good! I give this one a high score. I like the wind blown hair effect. Lighting is generally good, but there are some shadows that break up the back lighting a bit.', '2002-06-06 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67143, 1995, 878, '<td valign="top">I feel sorry for this girls dad.  He is going to have to threaten so many young boys. <br/><br/>Besides the young ladies looks this is a nice portrait, soft focus, and good tones.  I think the hair blowing is a bit much but nothing that would deter my rating of this shot.</td>', 'I feel sorry for this girls dad.  He is going to have to threaten so many young boys. Besides the young ladies looks this is a nice portrait, soft focus, and good tones.  I think the hair blowing is a bit much but nothing that would deter my rating of this shot.', '2002-06-07 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67144, 1995, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2002-06-08 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67145, 1995, 656, '<td valign="top">cute model, like the hair blowing around - good sho.  Could do with some fill light for the left side of her face under her chin to soften the shadows.</td>', 'cute model, like the hair blowing around - good sho.  Could do with some fill light for the left side of her face under her chin to soften the shadows.', '2002-06-09 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67146, 1995, 1859, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Thanks to everyone for voting on my first pic.  Was pleasantly surprised at how well it placed.  I appreciate all the great comments and hope to one day have a ribbon here as I learn tips from all you fabulous shooters on here.</td>', 'Wow!  Thanks to everyone for voting on my first pic.  Was pleasantly surprised at how well it placed.  I appreciate all the great comments and hope to one day have a ribbon here as I learn tips from all you fabulous shooters on here.', '2002-06-10 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(67147, 1996, 203, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a black and white.  (I hate grey and grey).</td>', 'Now that''s a black and white.  (I hate grey and grey).', '2002-06-03 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67148, 1996, 772, '<td valign="top">Good shot... I believe the fire pit is a little off center in this photo but it''s not a big problem :)  Good job!</td>', 'Good shot... I believe the fire pit is a little off center in this photo but it''s not a big problem :)  Good job!', '2002-06-03 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(67149, 1996, 1831, '<td valign="top">nice photo, would have liked to see it less cropped to the left. needed all the inner bolders in shot.</td>', 'nice photo, would have liked to see it less cropped to the left. needed all the inner bolders in shot.', '2002-06-03 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67150, 1996, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w. Good job.</td>', 'Neat b&w. Good job.', '2002-06-03 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67151, 1996, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very cool, er... hot?  :-)</td>', 'Very cool, er... hot?  :-)', '2002-06-03 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67152, 1996, 1211, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I like how it seems as though the flame is swirling around a bit.  Well cropped.</td>', 'Very cool.  I like how it seems as though the flame is swirling around a bit.  Well cropped.', '2002-06-03 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67153, 1996, 117, '<td valign="top">did your dog tell you? nice shot</td>', 'did your dog tell you? nice shot', '2002-06-03 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67154, 1996, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good biology knowledge! That''s about the safest fire ring I''ve seen.</td>', 'Good biology knowledge! That''s about the safest fire ring I''ve seen.', '2002-06-04 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67155, 1996, 1750, '<td valign="top">Weird titile, good composition. You''ve got the zones.</td>', 'Weird titile, good composition. You''ve got the zones.', '2002-06-04 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67156, 1996, 441, '<td valign="top">maybe later-darker would have had more effect</td>', 'maybe later-darker would have had more effect', '2002-06-05 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67157, 1996, 637, '<td valign="top">This image suffered by conversion to b&amp;w</td>', 'This image suffered by conversion to b&w', '2002-06-06 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67158, 1996, 139, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen fire in black and white before.  This is really neat.   I think the composition is possibly a bit cramped vertically.</td>', 'I''ve never seen fire in black and white before.  This is really neat.   I think the composition is possibly a bit cramped vertically.', '2002-06-06 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67159, 1996, 806, '<td valign="top">The embers look cool. Too bad you didn''t include figures with their faces lit by the fire''s glow. Wouldv''e given more interest.</td>', 'The embers look cool. Too bad you didn''t include figures with their faces lit by the fire''s glow. Wouldv''e given more interest.', '2002-06-06 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67160, 1996, 472, '<td valign="top">humorous premise and the flames look very cool.  i think i would have gone in closer, and blown off the whole surrounding area more</td>', 'humorous premise and the flames look very cool.  i think i would have gone in closer, and blown off the whole surrounding area more', '2002-06-07 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67161, 1996, 1446, '<td valign="top">I like this idea, I think I would have re-evaulated how this was framed and made it less centered in the frame.  Nice job leading the eye to the center of the fire with the logs as leading lines.</td>', 'I like this idea, I think I would have re-evaulated how this was framed and made it less centered in the frame.  Nice job leading the eye to the center of the fire with the logs as leading lines.', '2002-06-07 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67162, 1996, 2023, '<td valign="top">Very nice, white hot!!</td>', 'Very nice, white hot!!', '2002-06-07 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67163, 1996, 1, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s pretty cool -- I never thought turning fire black/white could produce such a nice effect.</td>', 'Wow that''s pretty cool -- I never thought turning fire black/white could produce such a nice effect.', '2002-06-09 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67164, 1996, 2103, '<td valign="top">10 best picture</td>', '10 best picture', '2002-06-09 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67229, 2002, 910, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a little more detail on the guy.</td>', 'I would have liked a little more detail on the guy.', '2002-06-03 03:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67230, 2002, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great cropping and lighting in this shot.</td>', 'Great cropping and lighting in this shot.', '2002-06-03 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67231, 2002, 1, '<td valign="top">I can''t relate to your title...  The shadow on the man?woman?''s face doesn''t work well for the image.  And what''s the bag about?</td>', 'I can''t relate to your title...  The shadow on the man?woman?''s face doesn''t work well for the image.  And what''s the bag about?', '2002-06-03 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67232, 2002, 203, '<td valign="top">Looking at this I am as bored as the subject seems to be.</td>', 'Looking at this I am as bored as the subject seems to be.', '2002-06-03 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67233, 2002, 1379, '<td valign="top">Just chillin.... I like how the face is obscured by the slanted shadow.  Very cool.</td>', 'Just chillin.... I like how the face is obscured by the slanted shadow.  Very cool.', '2002-06-03 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67234, 2002, 327, '<td valign="top">Kool abstract b&amp;w. Nice job, done well.</td>', 'Kool abstract b&w. Nice job, done well.', '2002-06-03 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67235, 2002, 1009, '<td valign="top">Tiny bit to much grey, unless thats what you were aiming for. Nice pic otherwise.</td>', 'Tiny bit to much grey, unless thats what you were aiming for. Nice pic otherwise.', '2002-06-03 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67236, 2002, 1313, '<td valign="top">Can''t see face, OK otherwise.</td>', 'Can''t see face, OK otherwise.', '2002-06-03 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67237, 2002, 671, '<td valign="top">The blank wall becomes the focus.  I would have cropped this with a vertical orientation rather than horizontal.  That way there would still be the blank wall, but not so much of it.</td>', 'The blank wall becomes the focus.  I would have cropped this with a vertical orientation rather than horizontal.  That way there would still be the blank wall, but not so much of it.', '2002-06-03 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67238, 2002, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, bold composition. I''m not entirely sure what the title means.</td>', 'Very interesting, bold composition. I''m not entirely sure what the title means.', '2002-06-04 06:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67239, 2002, 543, '<td valign="top">Needs more brightness.  The highlights on the bag are pure white, but the rest of the image is too dark.  The man''s hair blends into the shadows behind him, and the wall is very flat (tonally).</td>', 'Needs more brightness.  The highlights on the bag are pure white, but the rest of the image is too dark.  The man''s hair blends into the shadows behind him, and the wall is very flat (tonally).', '2002-06-04 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67240, 2002, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting photo... I wish the guy on the left was lit up just a little more... good job!</td>', 'interesting photo... I wish the guy on the left was lit up just a little more... good job!', '2002-06-04 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67241, 2002, 741, '<td valign="top">Love the comnposition but the face needs more light</td>', 'Love the comnposition but the face needs more light', '2002-06-05 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67242, 2002, 1658, '<td valign="top">Even though he''s a little blurred, the lines here are great.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Even though he''s a little blurred, the lines here are great.  Nicely done.', '2002-06-05 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67243, 2002, 1446, '<td valign="top">The vertical lines in this shot seems to cut it up. The contrast is over all okay, but I wish there was more light on the subjects face.  Still something eyecatching about this photograph though.</td>', 'The vertical lines in this shot seems to cut it up. The contrast is over all okay, but I wish there was more light on the subjects face.  Still something eyecatching about this photograph though.', '2002-06-07 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67244, 2002, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast but a bit dark for my liking</td>', 'nice contrast but a bit dark for my liking', '2002-06-08 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67271, 2008, 1829, '<td valign="top">Fantastic live motion shot. Ten out of ten for this pic.  Well deserved!!</td>', 'Fantastic live motion shot. Ten out of ten for this pic.  Well deserved!!', '2002-06-03 06:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67272, 2008, 1831, '<td valign="top">Great action shot</td>', 'Great action shot', '2002-06-03 07:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67273, 2008, 1455, '<td valign="top">Looks like so much fun, wish I were there</td>', 'Looks like so much fun, wish I were there', '2002-06-03 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67274, 2008, 1540, '<td valign="top">good action shot</td>', 'good action shot', '2002-06-03 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67275, 2008, 281, '<td valign="top">nice shot!</td>', 'nice shot!', '2002-06-03 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67276, 2008, 1, '<td valign="top">Such a nice catch, but I really don''t think this shot needs to be black and white.  The idea isn''t to just take your best picture and convert it to black and white.<br/><br/>Sports shots (especially with water and a jet ski) should be filled with vibrant color to draw users more than they already are drawn in by the amount of action going on.</td>', 'Such a nice catch, but I really don''t think this shot needs to be black and white.  The idea isn''t to just take your best picture and convert it to black and white.Sports shots (especially with water and a jet ski) should be filled with vibrant color to draw users more than they already are drawn in by the amount of action going on.', '2002-06-03 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67277, 2008, 1211, '<td valign="top">Nice air.  I think the B&amp;W detracts rather than adds, though.</td>', 'Nice air.  I think the B&W detracts rather than adds, though.', '2002-06-03 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67278, 2008, 570, '<td valign="top">good action shot</td>', 'good action shot', '2002-06-03 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67279, 2008, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun action shot. Totally cool in b&amp;w. Well done. Congrats to you~!!</td>', 'Fun action shot. Totally cool in b&w. Well done. Congrats to you~!!', '2002-06-03 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67280, 2008, 441, '<td valign="top">great capture, composition and exposure</td>', 'great capture, composition and exposure', '2002-06-03 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67281, 2008, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2002-06-03 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67282, 2008, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo.. however, i am beggin to see a vertical crop on this one.. I think that vertical cropping would increase the sense of height on the wave jump in this photo... good job!</td>', 'This is an excellent photo.. however, i am beggin to see a vertical crop on this one.. I think that vertical cropping would increase the sense of height on the wave jump in this photo... good job!', '2002-06-04 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67283, 2008, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice photo.  only improvement i can think of would be to crop out the horizon in the top right.  also, it would have been nice if that boat wasnt in the pic.</td>', 'nice photo.  only improvement i can think of would be to crop out the horizon in the top right.  also, it would have been nice if that boat wasnt in the pic.', '2002-06-04 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67284, 2008, 1882, '<td valign="top">Man, I wish that was ME!!!!</td>', 'Man, I wish that was ME!!!!', '2002-06-04 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67285, 2008, 811, '<td valign="top">Good shot -- very well composed and focused.</td>', 'Good shot -- very well composed and focused.', '2002-06-04 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67286, 2008, 1590, '<td valign="top">Right place , right time.</td>', 'Right place , right time.', '2002-06-05 05:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67287, 2008, 1454, '<td valign="top">The subject looks a bit static for me... I''d put it more to the right.</td>', 'The subject looks a bit static for me... I''d put it more to the right.', '2002-06-05 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67288, 2008, 641, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot. Good catch.</td>', 'Nice action shot. Good catch.', '2002-06-05 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67289, 2008, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a photograph that screams out for color.  I do not believe that it captures the motion and spirit as well when done in B&amp;W.</td>', 'This is a photograph that screams out for color.  I do not believe that it captures the motion and spirit as well when done in B&W.', '2002-06-05 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67290, 2008, 1446, '<td valign="top">I know its hard to time what other people are doing on the water, but this shot would have been much better without the pontoon boat in the background, with the splash leading into your jetskier, and cropped more closely to your subject.</td>', 'I know its hard to time what other people are doing on the water, but this shot would have been much better without the pontoon boat in the background, with the splash leading into your jetskier, and cropped more closely to your subject.', '2002-06-05 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67291, 2008, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice action stop.  Good range of whites/greys/black, very good focus and action stopage!!   Sorry, but I have no constructive remarks.  (Maybe w/o the other boat, but I understand that candid shots often have bonus extras that weren''t intended/wanted)<br/>Photo 10 ++ Creativity 9  B&amp;W 9 total 9<br/></td>', 'Very nice action stop.  Good range of whites/greys/black, very good focus and action stopage!!   Sorry, but I have no constructive remarks.  (Maybe w/o the other boat, but I understand that candid shots often have bonus extras that weren''t intended/wanted)Photo 10 ++ Creativity 9  B&W 9 total 9', '2002-06-05 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67292, 2008, 1037, '<td valign="top">It has been said in the forums that an action shot like this doesn''t work in black and white, but I think it leads the viewer to look at things like that big cloud of spray in a different way than colour would. I don''t know about the way the photo is framed though, it doesn''t seem to work that well to me.</td>', 'It has been said in the forums that an action shot like this doesn''t work in black and white, but I think it leads the viewer to look at things like that big cloud of spray in a different way than colour would. I don''t know about the way the photo is framed though, it doesn''t seem to work that well to me.', '2002-06-06 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67293, 2008, 472, '<td valign="top">awesome!  the spray looks especially choice.</td>', 'awesome!  the spray looks especially choice.', '2002-06-07 01:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67294, 2008, 543, '<td valign="top">Tack sharp (B/W helps a lot there), and a great catch of the action.  Slightly tilted (you could just crop out the horizon to take care of that, or, even better, crop to a vertical to emphasize the jump.  The spray at R is good, but you don''t need all of it.)  Pretty good tones, although I wouldn''t mind the whites just a touch brighter, but certainly raisies the question, ''why B/W?''.</td>', 'Tack sharp (B/W helps a lot there), and a great catch of the action.  Slightly tilted (you could just crop out the horizon to take care of that, or, even better, crop to a vertical to emphasize the jump.  The spray at R is good, but you don''t need all of it.)  Pretty good tones, although I wouldn''t mind the whites just a touch brighter, but certainly raisies the question, ''why B/W?''.', '2002-06-09 05:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67295, 2008, 1078, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W vs. Color issus aside, well timed shot.  My major suggestion would be to crop this vertically -- it would emphasize how high he is in the air and also give him less photo space to land in -- almost make it feel like he''s gonna soar completely out of the shot.  (I''d probably crop in such a way that the boat was still in the shot and way up in the right hand corner.)</td>', 'B&W vs. Color issus aside, well timed shot.  My major suggestion would be to crop this vertically -- it would emphasize how high he is in the air and also give him less photo space to land in -- almost make it feel like he''s gonna soar completely out of the shot.  (I''d probably crop in such a way that the boat was still in the shot and way up in the right hand corner.)', '2002-06-09 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67296, 2008, 1897, '<td valign="top">What a dynamic image?  cropping in on the ski may have worked a little better.  Great contrast,</td>', 'What a dynamic image?  cropping in on the ski may have worked a little better.  Great contrast,', '2002-06-09 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67297, 2009, 1829, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.  Great pose and cute baby!!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.  Great pose and cute baby!!', '2002-06-03 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67298, 2009, 1848, '<td valign="top">This is a great candid moment. And, the image has good dynamic range with a nice catch light in the eye. I also like the tight cropping. Just enough sharpness in the eyes, while the rest of the image has a "baby" softness. That is hard with a digital camera, well done.</td>', 'This is a great candid moment. And, the image has good dynamic range with a nice catch light in the eye. I also like the tight cropping. Just enough sharpness in the eyes, while the rest of the image has a "baby" softness. That is hard with a digital camera, well done.', '2002-06-03 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67299, 2009, 1, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot.  This would''ve worked just as well for last week too.  The hand on her face is a great touch.</td>', 'Adorable shot.  This would''ve worked just as well for last week too.  The hand on her face is a great touch.', '2002-06-03 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67300, 2009, 327, '<td valign="top">Perfect b&amp;w portait. Verrrrry well done my friend. Congrats on a winning shot!!!</td>', 'Perfect b&w portait. Verrrrry well done my friend. Congrats on a winning shot!!!', '2002-06-03 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67301, 2009, 1009, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2002-06-03 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67302, 2009, 772, '<td valign="top">Cute baby!</td>', 'Cute baby!', '2002-06-03 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67303, 2009, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great expression, really like the placement of the hand here.  Perhaps a bit closer crop on the top, but otherwise, nice shot.</td>', 'Great expression, really like the placement of the hand here.  Perhaps a bit closer crop on the top, but otherwise, nice shot.', '2002-06-03 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67304, 2009, 1313, '<td valign="top">OK pic, not very creative though.</td>', 'OK pic, not very creative though.', '2002-06-03 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
