(67372, 2013, 806, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Great B&amp;W. I can''t decide whether or not I like the halo effect. How was this achieved? I sort-of wish I could see the whole "globe".... still.. it does a great job at leading me into the river, which does a good job of leading me into the picture. I am between a 9 and a 10.... I think a 10....</td>', 'I really like this. Great B&W. I can''t decide whether or not I like the halo effect. How was this achieved? I sort-of wish I could see the whole "globe".... still.. it does a great job at leading me into the river, which does a good job of leading me into the picture. I am between a 9 and a 10.... I think a 10....', '2002-06-06 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
