(67386, 2017, 1, '<td valign="top">I can''t really relate... the child doesnt look necessarily sad... but more thoughtful.  Also it says the person died in 1969 and while he could be alive then (could be posing as an old shot), his atire is very very modern.  I dont know too many people who would go sit and think beside someone''s grave that they never knew.  Maybe I''m getting too technical with this.</td>', 'I can''t really relate... the child doesnt look necessarily sad... but more thoughtful.  Also it says the person died in 1969 and while he could be alive then (could be posing as an old shot), his atire is very very modern.  I dont know too many people who would go sit and think beside someone''s grave that they never knew.  Maybe I''m getting too technical with this.', '2002-06-05 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
