(67389, 2017, 811, '<td valign="top">Having the boy dressed in dark clothes helped set the "mood" and provided a good contrast.  I almost felt like he looked kinda stiff and formal, but then again, that goes with the mood, I guess.  His facial expression is very somber and solemn, as it is supposed to be.</td>', 'Having the boy dressed in dark clothes helped set the "mood" and provided a good contrast.  I almost felt like he looked kinda stiff and formal, but then again, that goes with the mood, I guess.  His facial expression is very somber and solemn, as it is supposed to be.', '2002-06-06 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
