(67398, 2018, 2, '<td valign="top">Awesome job acheiving such great detail and texture on the trees with just black and white.  You chose a great time of day for the shot, and your focus is impeccable.</td>', 'Awesome job acheiving such great detail and texture on the trees with just black and white.  You chose a great time of day for the shot, and your focus is impeccable.', '2002-06-04 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
