(67433, 2019, 139, '<td valign="top">Perfect title.  My only complaint is the partly visible bits of the hand near the top.  I think the photo might be more bold if the cutoff was more pronounced (though it is quite pronounced as it is!)</td>', 'Perfect title.  My only complaint is the partly visible bits of the hand near the top.  I think the photo might be more bold if the cutoff was more pronounced (though it is quite pronounced as it is!)', '2002-06-09 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
