(67439, 2020, 573, '<td valign="top">Nice full tonal range and focus.  The whole image is too dark for my tastes; maybe a lighter background would add some contrast.</td>', 'Nice full tonal range and focus.  The whole image is too dark for my tastes; maybe a lighter background would add some contrast.', '2002-06-03 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
