(67463, 2021, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow..... it must be cold where you live!  <br/>This looks like fun!</td>', 'Wow..... it must be cold where you live!  This looks like fun!', '2002-06-03 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67464, 2021, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w, looks like a lot of fun. Wish we could see the kids more. Nice work all in all.</td>', 'Neat b&w, looks like a lot of fun. Wish we could see the kids more. Nice work all in all.', '2002-06-03 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67465, 2021, 641, '<td valign="top">Now that looks like fun :)</td>', 'Now that looks like fun :)', '2002-06-05 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67466, 2021, 637, '<td valign="top">This image has a snapshot quality for me.  Ghe background distracts... both behind and in front of the fence.  The headless person in the center is also a distraction.  I like the idea.  I think you could''ve done more with the composition to make it a great shot.</td>', 'This image has a snapshot quality for me.  Ghe background distracts... both behind and in front of the fence.  The headless person in the center is also a distraction.  I like the idea.  I think you could''ve done more with the composition to make it a great shot.', '2002-06-05 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67467, 2021, 543, '<td valign="top">Grab that stool and shoot down on them to avoid the distracting bg.    Looks a little like the moment before the ''decisive moment''.</td>', 'Grab that stool and shoot down on them to avoid the distracting bg.    Looks a little like the moment before the ''decisive moment''.', '2002-06-05 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67468, 2021, 1031, '<td valign="top">Pretty good capturing of transparent objects. Great bubble-table!</td>', 'Pretty good capturing of transparent objects. Great bubble-table!', '2002-06-05 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67469, 2021, 1175, '<td valign="top">If bubble makers were your interesting you should have fill the screen a bit more with them.  I see a great photo within your photo.  Look at the girl on the left.  She looks perfect holding up this ring and looking at it with wonder.  If you would have just gotten down on one knee would have taken the picture across the table to that little girl you would have a great picture.  Also unless your subject is a shadow or you are taking things at sunset or sunrise with attractive shadows, try to avoid them.  You have bad shadow to the left of the boys face on the right.  That sort of thing detracts from your picture.</td>', 'If bubble makers were your interesting you should have fill the screen a bit more with them.  I see a great photo within your photo.  Look at the girl on the left.  She looks perfect holding up this ring and looking at it with wonder.  If you would have just gotten down on one knee would have taken the picture across the table to that little girl you would have a great picture.  Also unless your subject is a shadow or you are taking things at sunset or sunrise with attractive shadows, try to avoid them.  You have bad shadow to the left of the boys face on the right.  That sort of thing detracts from your picture.', '2002-06-05 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67470, 2021, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool!  Very good focus, nice contrasts, good flash level.  You''ve left me nothing to "pick on".   Nice "interest" shot, it pulls you in well.<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 8 B&amp;W 10 total 9</td>', 'Cool!  Very good focus, nice contrasts, good flash level.  You''ve left me nothing to "pick on".   Nice "interest" shot, it pulls you in well.Photo 10 Creativity 8 B&W 10 total 9', '2002-06-07 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67471, 2021, 1054, '<td valign="top">This is a cute picture, but it feels like a snapshot to me.  I can''t help feeling that not much attention was paid to composition and framing.</td>', 'This is a cute picture, but it feels like a snapshot to me.  I can''t help feeling that not much attention was paid to composition and framing.', '2002-06-08 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67472, 2021, 2, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos I don''t think used black and white very effectively -- it only seems to detract from the effect of the photo, rather than adding to it.</td>', 'This is one of those photos I don''t think used black and white very effectively -- it only seems to detract from the effect of the photo, rather than adding to it.', '2002-06-08 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67473, 2021, 656, '<td valign="top">looks like fun....</td>', 'looks like fun....', '2002-06-09 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67474, 2023, 1829, '<td valign="top">Very creative work.  Love the closeness of the shot.</td>', 'Very creative work.  Love the closeness of the shot.', '2002-06-03 06:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67475, 2023, 1897, '<td valign="top">The writing on the hand ruined this for me.</td>', 'The writing on the hand ruined this for me.', '2002-06-03 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67476, 2023, 1, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to get, but the writing on the hand is a nice touch.  The composure over all is very good -- I didn''t like the shot at first but I''ve been staring at it for 3 minutes and it''s growing on me.  It''s very engaging.</td>', 'It took me a while to get, but the writing on the hand is a nice touch.  The composure over all is very good -- I didn''t like the shot at first but I''ve been staring at it for 3 minutes and it''s growing on me.  It''s very engaging.', '2002-06-03 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67477, 2023, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative, and well done on top of that. Interesting, clear, clean shot!! Bravo my friend.</td>', 'Creative, and well done on top of that. Interesting, clear, clean shot!! Bravo my friend.', '2002-06-03 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67478, 2023, 616, '<td valign="top">writing on the hand  is very distracting</td>', 'writing on the hand  is very distracting', '2002-06-03 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67479, 2023, 368, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection and shinyness of the cherries - awesome</td>', 'I really like the reflection and shinyness of the cherries - awesome', '2002-06-03 20:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67480, 2023, 1547, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the hand and fruit.  B/W really emphasizes the difference.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the hand and fruit.  B/W really emphasizes the difference.', '2002-06-03 20:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67481, 2023, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great contrast.  Nice focus.  The writing on the hand really works with the title.  Excellent reflections in the cherry''s.  I like this shot quite a bit.</td>', 'Great contrast.  Nice focus.  The writing on the hand really works with the title.  Excellent reflections in the cherry''s.  I like this shot quite a bit.', '2002-06-03 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
