(67513, 2024, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great contrast.  Not a really interesting shot IMO, The focus is a little wierd on the front leaf.  Overall I give this a 5.</td>', 'Great contrast.  Not a really interesting shot IMO, The focus is a little wierd on the front leaf.  Overall I give this a 5.', '2002-06-05 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67514, 2024, 1658, '<td valign="top">I really like the strong contrasts here, as well as the decreasing sizes of the leaves from the center outward.</td>', 'I really like the strong contrasts here, as well as the decreasing sizes of the leaves from the center outward.', '2002-06-05 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67515, 2024, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nice tonal range.  A few compression/sharpening problems, but I didn''t notice them until I''d been looking at the picture for a while.  The single biggest thing I would prefer to see in this picture is a single focal point.  Maybe one big leaf surrounded by lots of small ones?  Or a flower surrounded by all the leaves?  I don''t quite know what to suggest.</td>', 'Nice tonal range.  A few compression/sharpening problems, but I didn''t notice them until I''d been looking at the picture for a while.  The single biggest thing I would prefer to see in this picture is a single focal point.  Maybe one big leaf surrounded by lots of small ones?  Or a flower surrounded by all the leaves?  I don''t quite know what to suggest.', '2002-06-05 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67516, 2024, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The focus seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The focus seems a bit soft.', '2002-06-05 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67517, 2024, 139, '<td valign="top">The structure is nicely emphasized by the B&amp;W and inversion.  My only complaint is that I think it could have been better with a strong focal point.</td>', 'The structure is nicely emphasized by the B&W and inversion.  My only complaint is that I think it could have been better with a strong focal point.', '2002-06-06 01:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67518, 2024, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures and patterns, nice range of tones, but it seems like the leaves in the foreground are out of focus compared to some that are further from the camera.</td>', 'Very nice textures and patterns, nice range of tones, but it seems like the leaves in the foreground are out of focus compared to some that are further from the camera.', '2002-06-06 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67519, 2024, 543, '<td valign="top">Good choice of an organic pattern for B/W - has a nice, eerie feel.  Backfocused a little (the leaves in fg are just oof).</td>', 'Good choice of an organic pattern for B/W - has a nice, eerie feel.  Backfocused a little (the leaves in fg are just oof).', '2002-06-09 05:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
