(67532, 2027, 1175, '<td valign="top">Its an interesting photo.  I''m not sure where the subject is as you have three different points that I look at, the face, the light in the mirror and the "Cave in" on the t-shirt.  The glasses have some spots that reflect the light and you''ve got a shiny nose.  I think you have a decent idea of photography, but the whole thing just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'Its an interesting photo.  I''m not sure where the subject is as you have three different points that I look at, the face, the light in the mirror and the "Cave in" on the t-shirt.  The glasses have some spots that reflect the light and you''ve got a shiny nose.  I think you have a decent idea of photography, but the whole thing just doesn''t work for me.', '2002-06-06 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67533, 2027, 1, '<td valign="top">Just can''t relate, it seems like no thought went into this...just a random self portrait snap shot.</td>', 'Just can''t relate, it seems like no thought went into this...just a random self portrait snap shot.', '2002-06-08 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
