(67540, 2030, 1041, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this shot is a little too mysterious for my liking.  Just a little lighter or a little more focus would''ve helped.  Also, if you could''ve cropped out the light gray bar over the girl''s head.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this shot is a little too mysterious for my liking.  Just a little lighter or a little more focus would''ve helped.  Also, if you could''ve cropped out the light gray bar over the girl''s head.', '2002-06-03 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
