(67545, 2030, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good title for this one. I really like the sense of mood you''ve been able to convey, very artsy and expressionistic. Good use of lighting also. The one thing I might suggest is to crop the distractive beam from the top (and thus the right side also to keep the aspect ratio).</td>', 'Good title for this one. I really like the sense of mood you''ve been able to convey, very artsy and expressionistic. Good use of lighting also. The one thing I might suggest is to crop the distractive beam from the top (and thus the right side also to keep the aspect ratio).', '2002-06-03 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
