(67550, 2030, 811, '<td valign="top">Based on the title, I think the blurriness/graininess works well.  However, it seems a little dark to me, which does add to teh mystery, but makes it difficult to see.  Very artistic.</td>', 'Based on the title, I think the blurriness/graininess works well.  However, it seems a little dark to me, which does add to teh mystery, but makes it difficult to see.  Very artistic.', '2002-06-04 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
