(67561, 2030, 1005, '<td valign="top">If you were going for a sense of erie, you got it, your title implies it.  Even so, the elements of this shot are not depicted clearly enough for me to do anything but assume you knew what you were doing and the effect you were after.  Me, I can''t see much, so I can''t really tell what you were going for.   The title should be Mystery to you.  Photo 7 (sorry, but that''s how I feel) Creativity 10 (I am hoping you were "reaching" for something) B&amp;W 6 (sorry, too much mystery for me) <br/>total 7 (in dire hopes this is really better than I think it is)</td>', 'If you were going for a sense of erie, you got it, your title implies it.  Even so, the elements of this shot are not depicted clearly enough for me to do anything but assume you knew what you were doing and the effect you were after.  Me, I can''t see much, so I can''t really tell what you were going for.   The title should be Mystery to you.  Photo 7 (sorry, but that''s how I feel) Creativity 10 (I am hoping you were "reaching" for something) B&W 6 (sorry, too much mystery for me) total 7 (in dire hopes this is really better than I think it is)', '2002-06-07 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67562, 2030, 1, '<td valign="top">Very blurry and too dark.</td>', 'Very blurry and too dark.', '2002-06-09 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67563, 2030, 387, '<td valign="top">not a bad idea; pan a little left; use tripod for sharper focus</td>', 'not a bad idea; pan a little left; use tripod for sharper focus', '2002-06-09 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67564, 2030, 656, '<td valign="top">a bit too dark, but fits with the title</td>', 'a bit too dark, but fits with the title', '2002-06-09 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67565, 2030, 1715, '<td valign="top">Hello, Langdon...  we meet again...<br/>So, landgdon, have ANYTHING nice to say AT ALL about this picture??<br/>Have you ever heard the expression if you don''t have something nice to say, don''t  say anything at all? You should be more like Magnectic ;-)<br/><br/>I noticed that this person hadn''t had any previous entries so this is their first submission. Be a little nicer hmm? Instead of saying it''s too dark. Mystery-it''s probably supposed to be dark. If you only make a suggestion, you just make it seem like you''re the better photographer, and I know most of you aren''t any better than this person...  It seemed like a lot of baby pictures got under the first fifty... babies and doggies, oh my! How creative :-)</td>', 'Hello, Langdon...  we meet again...So, landgdon, have ANYTHING nice to say AT ALL about this picture??Have you ever heard the expression if you don''t have something nice to say, don''t  say anything at all? You should be more like Magnectic ;-)I noticed that this person hadn''t had any previous entries so this is their first submission. Be a little nicer hmm? Instead of saying it''s too dark. Mystery-it''s probably supposed to be dark. If you only make a suggestion, you just make it seem like you''re the better photographer, and I know most of you aren''t any better than this person...  It seemed like a lot of baby pictures got under the first fifty... babies and doggies, oh my! How creative :-)', '2002-06-10 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(67566, 2033, 409, '<td valign="top">interesting upside down</td>', 'interesting upside down', '2002-06-03 08:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67567, 2033, 798, '<td valign="top">Was this a upside down rejected photo? lol. I like it, I was going to do a shadow one with my kid when the lights went out and we used flashlights  but the camera couldnt adjust to the darkness like my eyes could.</td>', 'Was this a upside down rejected photo? lol. I like it, I was going to do a shadow one with my kid when the lights went out and we used flashlights  but the camera couldnt adjust to the darkness like my eyes could.', '2002-06-03 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67568, 2033, 573, '<td valign="top">Has this been turned upside down?  Very disorentating.</td>', 'Has this been turned upside down?  Very disorentating.', '2002-06-03 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67569, 2033, 1831, '<td valign="top">Why upside down? In my opinion (only my opinion), it looks confusing. I took the liberty of saving to disk and putting the image upright via PS Elements. Having looked at it the right way up, its a lovely photo. Would have scored higher but for this. sorry.</td>', 'Why upside down? In my opinion (only my opinion), it looks confusing. I took the liberty of saving to disk and putting the image upright via PS Elements. Having looked at it the right way up, its a lovely photo. Would have scored higher but for this. sorry.', '2002-06-03 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67570, 2033, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice light and shadow. Well done.</td>', 'Nice light and shadow. Well done.', '2002-06-03 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67571, 2033, 1211, '<td valign="top">Cool concept, really like the angle the picture is taken at.</td>', 'Cool concept, really like the angle the picture is taken at.', '2002-06-03 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67572, 2033, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting image but it doesn''t really grab me and say "nice black and white"... maybe more arms and hands closer to the center of the photo would be a nice improvement :)</td>', 'Interesting image but it doesn''t really grab me and say "nice black and white"... maybe more arms and hands closer to the center of the photo would be a nice improvement :)', '2002-06-03 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67573, 2033, 587, '<td valign="top">more shadows would have helped this. the angle you shot this is....different. (lack of better word)</td>', 'more shadows would have helped this. the angle you shot this is....different. (lack of better word)', '2002-06-04 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67574, 2033, 1128, '<td valign="top">Very unique perspective in this shot, but I feel like I want a different crop-- maybe tighter.  I really like the perspective, though-- it''s neat the way the children are all at the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'Very unique perspective in this shot, but I feel like I want a different crop-- maybe tighter.  I really like the perspective, though-- it''s neat the way the children are all at the bottom of the photo.', '2002-06-04 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67575, 2033, 637, '<td valign="top">I want to know more about ths scene.</td>', 'I want to know more about ths scene.', '2002-06-05 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67576, 2033, 811, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, I just think you need more shadows, if that is what you were wanting.</td>', 'Very good idea, I just think you need more shadows, if that is what you were wanting.', '2002-06-05 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67577, 2033, 1037, '<td valign="top">The composition here is really interesting. It feels like you turned the photo upside down, and I''m not sure if that works, but it''s still a very creative idea.</td>', 'The composition here is really interesting. It feels like you turned the photo upside down, and I''m not sure if that works, but it''s still a very creative idea.', '2002-06-06 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67578, 2033, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute concept, well focused, but couldn''t you have gotten more of the shadows?  (It is your title after all)  Change angles, move your subjects, you really captured the essense of the round flat rock thing (your background).  Photo 9 Creativity 7 B&amp;W 6 total 7</td>', 'Cute concept, well focused, but couldn''t you have gotten more of the shadows?  (It is your title after all)  Change angles, move your subjects, you really captured the essense of the round flat rock thing (your background).  Photo 9 Creativity 7 B&W 6 total 7', '2002-06-07 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67579, 2033, 582, '<td valign="top">Great photo idea.  Would be nice to see a different angle or composition with the same idea.</td>', 'Great photo idea.  Would be nice to see a different angle or composition with the same idea.', '2002-06-08 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67580, 2033, 2093, '<td valign="top">I like the focus on the hands. there doesn''t seem to be enough contrast of shadowing going on though</td>', 'I like the focus on the hands. there doesn''t seem to be enough contrast of shadowing going on though', '2002-06-09 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67581, 2033, 1078, '<td valign="top">The idea is clever, but I have to wonder why you chose to rotate it the 180 degrees?  For me, it adds an uncomfortableness to the picture that seems counter to the subject matter.  Beyond that, I just wish I could see more of the shadow puppets the children are making (or trying to make).  About the only one that is really a strong part of the picture is the one on the far right.  The rest of the children just look like they''re sticking their hands out above the table because their shadows are so minimal.</td>', 'The idea is clever, but I have to wonder why you chose to rotate it the 180 degrees?  For me, it adds an uncomfortableness to the picture that seems counter to the subject matter.  Beyond that, I just wish I could see more of the shadow puppets the children are making (or trying to make).  About the only one that is really a strong part of the picture is the one on the far right.  The rest of the children just look like they''re sticking their hands out above the table because their shadows are so minimal.', '2002-06-09 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67582, 2039, 772, '<td valign="top">I don''t remember giving permission for anyone to photograph my home for this challenge :))  God shot!  Only improvement i see would be to allow a little more breathing room for the building on the left hand side of the frame... good work!</td>', 'I don''t remember giving permission for anyone to photograph my home for this challenge :))  God shot!  Only improvement i see would be to allow a little more breathing room for the building on the left hand side of the frame... good work!', '2002-06-03 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67583, 2039, 1455, '<td valign="top">If walls could talk....I would love to hear the stories this house could tell.</td>', 'If walls could talk....I would love to hear the stories this house could tell.', '2002-06-03 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67584, 2039, 2, '<td valign="top">The image seems slightly off-balance to me with the large amount of sky -- pushing half of the image.  Nice subject for black and white, though.</td>', 'The image seems slightly off-balance to me with the large amount of sky -- pushing half of the image.  Nice subject for black and white, though.', '2002-06-03 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67585, 2039, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w. I think the composition could of been better by leaving out the bottom of the windmill. I do like this shot. Good job.</td>', 'Neat b&w. I think the composition could of been better by leaving out the bottom of the windmill. I do like this shot. Good job.', '2002-06-03 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67586, 2039, 441, '<td valign="top">only 57Kb utilised here - you need to grab as much quality as the 150Kb limit allows.</td>', 'only 57Kb utilised here - you need to grab as much quality as the 150Kb limit allows.', '2002-06-03 19:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67587, 2039, 1313, '<td valign="top">Nice artistic shot.</td>', 'Nice artistic shot.', '2002-06-03 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67588, 2039, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2002-06-03 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67589, 2039, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good subject for b &amp; w.</td>', 'Good subject for b & w.', '2002-06-03 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67590, 2039, 1061, '<td valign="top">Nice; I would have moved back some to catch the desolation of the landscape</td>', 'Nice; I would have moved back some to catch the desolation of the landscape', '2002-06-04 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67591, 2039, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a great subject for black and white. I think my only criticism is that a different angle might have made more use of the windmill. I feel like I want to see its blades more clearly.</td>', 'This is a great subject for black and white. I think my only criticism is that a different angle might have made more use of the windmill. I feel like I want to see its blades more clearly.', '2002-06-04 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67592, 2039, 1882, '<td valign="top">God, one weak tornado and this place is history!</td>', 'God, one weak tornado and this place is history!', '2002-06-04 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67593, 2039, 1031, '<td valign="top">Sure does look old. I like the windmill.</td>', 'Sure does look old. I like the windmill.', '2002-06-04 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67594, 2039, 1446, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subjects for a b&amp;w.  The house is situated oddly within the frame IMO.</td>', 'Good choice of subjects for a b&w.  The house is situated oddly within the frame IMO.', '2002-06-04 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67595, 2039, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the caved in house and the grounds around it, but you got no sky.  Personal opinion, I don''t like that, I need sky.  Otherwise, nice shot!<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 7 B&amp;W 7 total 7 (is there a point behind the blank sky, am I dumb or missing some point?)</td>', 'I like the caved in house and the grounds around it, but you got no sky.  Personal opinion, I don''t like that, I need sky.  Otherwise, nice shot!Photo 8 Creativity 7 B&W 7 total 7 (is there a point behind the blank sky, am I dumb or missing some point?)', '2002-06-05 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67596, 2039, 1908, '<td valign="top">should have taken the photo in front of the fence</td>', 'should have taken the photo in front of the fence', '2002-06-06 03:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67597, 2039, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2002-06-07 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67598, 2039, 1944, '<td valign="top">About the kind of house I can afford.</td>', 'About the kind of house I can afford.', '2002-06-08 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67599, 2039, 582, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  It seems that the contrast is too  much between the sky and the building.</td>', 'Nice photo.  It seems that the contrast is too  much between the sky and the building.', '2002-06-08 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67600, 2039, 1280, '<td valign="top">Sad to see structures deteriorate like this.  You captured that feeling well.  Good job.</td>', 'Sad to see structures deteriorate like this.  You captured that feeling well.  Good job.', '2002-06-08 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67601, 2039, 1897, '<td valign="top">It would be nie to see more detail in the sky, and not see the fence, but excellent use of BW  9</td>', 'It would be nie to see more detail in the sky, and not see the fence, but excellent use of BW  9', '2002-06-09 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67602, 2039, 1, '<td valign="top">Subject works great for black and white, nice framign to include windmill.</td>', 'Subject works great for black and white, nice framign to include windmill.', '2002-06-10 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67603, 2041, 1829, '<td valign="top">What a cutiepie!!  Beautiful picture.</td>', 'What a cutiepie!!  Beautiful picture.', '2002-06-03 06:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67604, 2041, 573, '<td valign="top">This is a good family snapshot.</td>', 'This is a good family snapshot.', '2002-06-03 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67605, 2041, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good b&amp;w portait of a darling little lady.</td>', 'Nicely done. Good b&w portait of a darling little lady.', '2002-06-03 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67606, 2041, 1585, '<td valign="top">Marvelous. Wish the water was on but I know how dangerous that could be.</td>', 'Marvelous. Wish the water was on but I know how dangerous that could be.', '2002-06-03 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67607, 2041, 772, '<td valign="top">This is nice!  I would really like to have her in full view... the lighting here is excellent as well!  good job!</td>', 'This is nice!  I would really like to have her in full view... the lighting here is excellent as well!  good job!', '2002-06-04 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67608, 2041, 156, '<td valign="top">LOL! such glee</td>', 'LOL! such glee', '2002-06-04 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67609, 2041, 885, '<td valign="top">The modernity of the hose and the B&amp;W bother me a bit.  Very cute candid though.</td>', 'The modernity of the hose and the B&W bother me a bit.  Very cute candid though.', '2002-06-04 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67610, 2041, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp contrast between the darker background and the little, white dressed girl.  How did it look a shade darker?  Might have been good, but consider this a NIT.  Good focus, nice subject.<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 7 B&amp;W 9 total 8</td>', 'I like the sharp contrast between the darker background and the little, white dressed girl.  How did it look a shade darker?  Might have been good, but consider this a NIT.  Good focus, nice subject.Photo 10 Creativity 7 B&W 9 total 8', '2002-06-04 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67611, 2041, 1658, '<td valign="top">This shot has a nice ''timelessness'' about it.  She really stands out against the dark background.</td>', 'This shot has a nice ''timelessness'' about it.  She really stands out against the dark background.', '2002-06-05 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67612, 2041, 641, '<td valign="top">Good contrast of tones in this. Playful, sharp, and good lighting</td>', 'Good contrast of tones in this. Playful, sharp, and good lighting', '2002-06-05 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67613, 2041, 543, '<td valign="top">Good tone, good background, and well-armed cutie.  Maybe a lighter hat next time to keep it out of the background.  High marks.</td>', 'Good tone, good background, and well-armed cutie.  Maybe a lighter hat next time to keep it out of the background.  High marks.', '2002-06-06 14:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67614, 2041, 472, '<td valign="top">cute but the girl is too overexposed.  : )</td>', 'cute but the girl is too overexposed.  : )', '2002-06-07 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67615, 2041, 917, '<td valign="top">Well framed.</td>', 'Well framed.', '2002-06-07 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67616, 2041, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice shot and good capture</td>', 'nice shot and good capture', '2002-06-08 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67617, 2041, 1944, '<td valign="top">cute snapshot. Well exposed and processed B/W</td>', 'cute snapshot. Well exposed and processed B/W', '2002-06-08 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67618, 2041, 1, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, though I wish she was looking at the camera and not off at something else, it makes your title not work too well.</td>', 'Cute shot, though I wish she was looking at the camera and not off at something else, it makes your title not work too well.', '2002-06-08 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67619, 2041, 714, '<td valign="top">This is a picture of my 3 year old.  The water was on and she got her daddy pretty wet that day.  I just wish I could have got a good picture when she was spraying the water.  Thank you all for your comments.</td>', 'This is a picture of my 3 year old.  The water was on and she got her daddy pretty wet that day.  I just wish I could have got a good picture when she was spraying the water.  Thank you all for your comments.', '2002-06-10 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(67620, 2042, 1455, '<td valign="top">Love the handles on these tools......But what are they used for?</td>', 'Love the handles on these tools......But what are they used for?', '2002-06-03 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67621, 2042, 1211, '<td valign="top">Really creative shot.</td>', 'Really creative shot.', '2002-06-03 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67622, 2042, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo but i think I''m too stupid to figger out whudd''im lookin at.  The balance doesn''t seem smooth and even, but one again, i don''t know what this is.  Abstract maybe?  I like the composition... nice shot!</td>', 'This is an interesting photo but i think I''m too stupid to figger out whudd''im lookin at.  The balance doesn''t seem smooth and even, but one again, i don''t know what this is.  Abstract maybe?  I like the composition... nice shot!', '2002-06-03 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67623, 2042, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w. Good job.</td>', 'Neat b&w. Good job.', '2002-06-03 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67624, 2042, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool angle...</td>', 'Cool angle...', '2002-06-03 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67625, 2042, 661, '<td valign="top">The shoe or the shadow at the bottom of the picture is distracting.  Otherwise good image, very interesting.</td>', 'The shoe or the shadow at the bottom of the picture is distracting.  Otherwise good image, very interesting.', '2002-06-04 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67626, 2042, 587, '<td valign="top">have no idea what this really is, but it LOOKS like 6 marble colored bowling balls on pedistals taken 5 feet up. :) like the coloring, are those your feet? good job.</td>', 'have no idea what this really is, but it LOOKS like 6 marble colored bowling balls on pedistals taken 5 feet up. :) like the coloring, are those your feet? good job.', '2002-06-05 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67627, 2042, 641, '<td valign="top">Ok.. I give, what is it? I like it though, I must say. Sharp tones, good lighting, and interesting subject.</td>', 'Ok.. I give, what is it? I like it though, I must say. Sharp tones, good lighting, and interesting subject.', '2002-06-05 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67628, 2042, 2000, '<td valign="top">nice reflections/use of light.</td>', 'nice reflections/use of light.', '2002-06-05 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67629, 2042, 543, '<td valign="top">Just when I was growing sure that you couldn''t take an interesting photo of a light fixture from below, here you go.  Very cool tools.  Is that spraypaint on the bulbs?  Excellent tones, though the sharpness could be better.  Congrats!</td>', 'Just when I was growing sure that you couldn''t take an interesting photo of a light fixture from below, here you go.  Very cool tools.  Is that spraypaint on the bulbs?  Excellent tones, though the sharpness could be better.  Congrats!', '2002-06-06 06:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67630, 2042, 472, '<td valign="top">this pic has gone up in my estimation, during the week. of course i have no idea what im looking at. but the lighting and tonalities are bloody excellent</td>', 'this pic has gone up in my estimation, during the week. of course i have no idea what im looking at. but the lighting and tonalities are bloody excellent', '2002-06-07 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67631, 2042, 878, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is but it looks cool</td>', 'Not sure what it is but it looks cool', '2002-06-07 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67632, 2042, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice view</td>', 'nice view', '2002-06-08 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67633, 2042, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the angle on the subject, but it seems to just cry out for a square photo.  (I know - it''s not allowed here.)  Maybe if the rack was moved to one side and one of the tools was laid out on the other side it would fill the frame better.  Are these fireplace tools?</td>', 'I love the angle on the subject, but it seems to just cry out for a square photo.  (I know - it''s not allowed here.)  Maybe if the rack was moved to one side and one of the tools was laid out on the other side it would fill the frame better.  Are these fireplace tools?', '2002-06-09 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67634, 2042, 2091, '<td valign="top">Wicked POV :)</td>', 'Wicked POV :)', '2002-06-09 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67635, 2042, 1, '<td valign="top">cool shot, a little bright on the edges of the bulbs though =/</td>', 'cool shot, a little bright on the edges of the bulbs though =/', '2002-06-10 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67636, 2042, 543, '<td valign="top">Okay... fooled me.  {g}  Still, very good - much moreso than the score indicates.</td>', 'Okay... fooled me.  {g}  Still, very good - much moreso than the score indicates.', '2002-06-10 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
