(67674, 2046, 1759, '<td valign="top">Uh, need some help cleaning that thing out? Seriously though, I wonder if a slave flash with some sort of diffuser could be used to improve the lighting inside.</td>', 'Uh, need some help cleaning that thing out? Seriously though, I wonder if a slave flash with some sort of diffuser could be used to improve the lighting inside.', '2002-06-03 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
