(67677, 2046, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good, but maybe too much distracts.  Like the through the window approach.</td>', 'Good, but maybe too much distracts.  Like the through the window approach.', '2002-06-04 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67678, 2046, 543, '<td valign="top">I''d like it a little brighter, but the tonal range is pretty good and it''s nice and sharp.  The window makes a nice frame.  What if there were something to see in the shed?</td>', 'I''d like it a little brighter, but the tonal range is pretty good and it''s nice and sharp.  The window makes a nice frame.  What if there were something to see in the shed?', '2002-06-04 06:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67679, 2046, 1908, '<td valign="top">should have used o single wondow frame for the cropping would have given greater effect</td>', 'should have used o single wondow frame for the cropping would have given greater effect', '2002-06-04 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67680, 2046, 1882, '<td valign="top">...and the shed is a MESS!</td>', '...and the shed is a MESS!', '2002-06-04 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67681, 2046, 1528, '<td valign="top">very original</td>', 'very original', '2002-06-05 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67682, 2046, 1041, '<td valign="top">You need to clean up that shed! ;-)  Even though there''s nothing really white or black inside the shed, the contrast is pretty good.  The glare from the light on the windows add to this shot.  What is the actual focus, my eye keeps wandering but not really staying anywhere.</td>', 'You need to clean up that shed! ;-)  Even though there''s nothing really white or black inside the shed, the contrast is pretty good.  The glare from the light on the windows add to this shot.  What is the actual focus, my eye keeps wandering but not really staying anywhere.', '2002-06-05 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67683, 2046, 885, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at framing, but I think you should really be sure to make it parallel to the edges of the frame.  It makes it look sloppy to be crooked.</td>', 'Good attempt at framing, but I think you should really be sure to make it parallel to the edges of the frame.  It makes it look sloppy to be crooked.', '2002-06-05 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67684, 2046, 1357, '<td valign="top">Looks like some time could be taken to clear the shed up.</td>', 'Looks like some time could be taken to clear the shed up.', '2002-06-05 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67685, 2046, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think I would have ignored the "true" highlights (the flecks of white on the window), and used something like that large table on the left as my highlight base to work a little of the flatness out of the photo.  Most of this seems fairly grey and I think some differentiation would help.</td>', 'I think I would have ignored the "true" highlights (the flecks of white on the window), and used something like that large table on the left as my highlight base to work a little of the flatness out of the photo.  Most of this seems fairly grey and I think some differentiation would help.', '2002-06-05 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67686, 2046, 1175, '<td valign="top">Yup, that''s the inside of a shed alright.  But why should I care?  I don''t see a real point of interest, just a bunch of stuf fon shelves and lying around.</td>', 'Yup, that''s the inside of a shed alright.  But why should I care?  I don''t see a real point of interest, just a bunch of stuf fon shelves and lying around.', '2002-06-06 01:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67687, 2046, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least you have a bunch of stuff on SHELVES! Nice job using the window frames...</td>', 'At least you have a bunch of stuff on SHELVES! Nice job using the window frames...', '2002-06-06 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67688, 2046, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I think more contrast could have helped differentiate some of these objects a bit more.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I think more contrast could have helped differentiate some of these objects a bit more.', '2002-06-06 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67689, 2046, 1446, '<td valign="top">Intersting idea.  If the window did not cut this photograph in half it would have worked better IMO.</td>', 'Intersting idea.  If the window did not cut this photograph in half it would have worked better IMO.', '2002-06-06 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67690, 2046, 806, '<td valign="top">This is not interesting. Sorry. I think photos should be interested and elicit emotion - positive or negative.</td>', 'This is not interesting. Sorry. I think photos should be interested and elicit emotion - positive or negative.', '2002-06-06 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67691, 2046, 1005, '<td valign="top">Focus is good, but were you going for a messy, jumbled effect?  Probably got alot of too dark comments, I would rather put it as too gloomy.<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 6 B&amp;W 6 total 7</td>', 'Focus is good, but were you going for a messy, jumbled effect?  Probably got alot of too dark comments, I would rather put it as too gloomy.Photo 8 Creativity 6 B&W 6 total 7', '2002-06-07 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67692, 2046, 2, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  I''m usually one for well-centered photographs, but I think your framing really adds to the shot.</td>', 'Great photo.  I''m usually one for well-centered photographs, but I think your framing really adds to the shot.', '2002-06-08 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67697, 2053, 1829, '<td valign="top">Beautiful baby, but a little dark around the face.</td>', 'Beautiful baby, but a little dark around the face.', '2002-06-03 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
