(67699, 2053, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo!  The composition here is great... The lighting is a little strange and *my* preference would be to have a little more light on the face... good shot, however!</td>', 'Very nice photo!  The composition here is great... The lighting is a little strange and *my* preference would be to have a little more light on the face... good shot, however!', '2002-06-03 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
