(67701, 2053, 573, '<td valign="top">I want to see Hannah''s face, a white card on the left of Hannah would reflect just enough nlight back onto her face to add some pleasing detail.  I am glad I took a second look at Hannah from home,  the sharpness is awesom,  but I still feel more light from high left would work great.  I''m rating this higher.</td>', 'I want to see Hannah''s face, a white card on the left of Hannah would reflect just enough nlight back onto her face to add some pleasing detail.  I am glad I took a second look at Hannah from home,  the sharpness is awesom,  but I still feel more light from high left would work great.  I''m rating this higher.', '2002-06-03 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67702, 2053, 1024, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately her face is rather obscured in shadows.  The light at the top of her head is nice, too bad a bit more of that had not been on her cheek.</td>', 'Unfortunately her face is rather obscured in shadows.  The light at the top of her head is nice, too bad a bit more of that had not been on her cheek.', '2002-06-03 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67703, 2053, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. Well done.</td>', 'Neat shot. Well done.', '2002-06-03 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67704, 2053, 1759, '<td valign="top">Sweet baby! Baby shots can be really tough. The problem here is with lighting, not enough on the front of the face. I used an external flash with a micro softbox for a similar photo and got very good results on most shots.</td>', 'Sweet baby! Baby shots can be really tough. The problem here is with lighting, not enough on the front of the face. I used an external flash with a micro softbox for a similar photo and got very good results on most shots.', '2002-06-03 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67705, 2053, 1313, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, I''ll vote her an 8 cause she has the same name as our grand-daughter.</td>', 'Cute kid, I''ll vote her an 8 cause she has the same name as our grand-daughter.', '2002-06-03 21:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67706, 2053, 1990, '<td valign="top">She is sooo beautiful!</td>', 'She is sooo beautiful!', '2002-06-04 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67707, 2053, 543, '<td valign="top">The composition, contrast and textures are very nice here, but it really needs some more of baby''s face (almost entirely hidden in shadow.  I can make out most of her nose and a little of her mouth, but her other eye is just not showing).  Increasing the gamma to 1.3 might work, but would take the edge off of the blacks and reduce the apparent contrast.  Maybe it would work high-key.  Best bet would have been to reflect or shine some light onto her face.</td>', 'The composition, contrast and textures are very nice here, but it really needs some more of baby''s face (almost entirely hidden in shadow.  I can make out most of her nose and a little of her mouth, but her other eye is just not showing).  Increasing the gamma to 1.3 might work, but would take the edge off of the blacks and reduce the apparent contrast.  Maybe it would work high-key.  Best bet would have been to reflect or shine some light onto her face.', '2002-06-04 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67708, 2053, 1041, '<td valign="top">What a cutie she is!  If only her face wasn''t in the shade and her features were more visible, this would be even better.</td>', 'What a cutie she is!  If only her face wasn''t in the shade and her features were more visible, this would be even better.', '2002-06-04 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67709, 2053, 661, '<td valign="top">Too dark on the baby''s face for me.</td>', 'Too dark on the baby''s face for me.', '2002-06-04 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67710, 2053, 806, '<td valign="top">Sweet baby! I wish I could see her face better.</td>', 'Sweet baby! I wish I could see her face better.', '2002-06-04 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67711, 2053, 587, '<td valign="top">would love to see her face better - tad too much contrast for me.  I''m sure you wish the blanket was covering the handle too. Looks like you have an angel among you though! :)</td>', 'would love to see her face better - tad too much contrast for me.  I''m sure you wish the blanket was covering the handle too. Looks like you have an angel among you though! :)', '2002-06-04 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67712, 2053, 1446, '<td valign="top">Face dark against bright white blanket.  Too bad its so hard to see the new baby in this shot.  The side of the baby seat is distracting also.</td>', 'Face dark against bright white blanket.  Too bad its so hard to see the new baby in this shot.  The side of the baby seat is distracting also.', '2002-06-05 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67713, 2053, 811, '<td valign="top">The face is a touch too dark (simply because I would like to see her features).  having said that, though, I imagine getting light in her face might have wakened her, and as the mother of a 4 month old, that is not a cool thing to do.  Beautiful child, peaceful picture.  Well done.</td>', 'The face is a touch too dark (simply because I would like to see her features).  having said that, though, I imagine getting light in her face might have wakened her, and as the mother of a 4 month old, that is not a cool thing to do.  Beautiful child, peaceful picture.  Well done.', '2002-06-05 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67714, 2053, 139, '<td valign="top">I think the photo would have looked more peaceful with less constrast.  It''s a good photo anyway.</td>', 'I think the photo would have looked more peaceful with less constrast.  It''s a good photo anyway.', '2002-06-06 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
