(67727, 2054, 2, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel you''ve used black&amp;white here to the advantage of the photo.  The expression you''ve caught on the child, though, is wonderful.</td>', 'I don''t feel you''ve used black&white here to the advantage of the photo.  The expression you''ve caught on the child, though, is wonderful.', '2002-06-04 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67728, 2054, 1041, '<td valign="top">Oh, my, spaghetties are such a messy affair, aren''t they?  Great expression on the face, DOF and focus are spot on.  The window in the background is pretty distracting though.  Depending on the surrounding that we can''t see on the photo, would it have been possible to move around to the left some more to avoid having the window in the shot?</td>', 'Oh, my, spaghetties are such a messy affair, aren''t they?  Great expression on the face, DOF and focus are spot on.  The window in the background is pretty distracting though.  Depending on the surrounding that we can''t see on the photo, would it have been possible to move around to the left some more to avoid having the window in the shot?', '2002-06-06 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67729, 2055, 724, '<td valign="top">My what an adorable boy!!  Lots of story in this photo, unfortanately the focus is thrown on the fence and the subjects are slightly blurry.  I would still hang this on on my wall though, good luck bro!</td>', 'My what an adorable boy!!  Lots of story in this photo, unfortanately the focus is thrown on the fence and the subjects are slightly blurry.  I would still hang this on on my wall though, good luck bro!', '2002-06-03 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
