(67748, 2059, 772, '<td valign="top">Very interesting capture!  I like the concept here but I don''t believe the overall image works well in black and white, but it is a great capture!  the many sharp contrasts in this photo make it a little tedious in black and white...</td>', 'Very interesting capture!  I like the concept here but I don''t believe the overall image works well in black and white, but it is a great capture!  the many sharp contrasts in this photo make it a little tedious in black and white...', '2002-06-03 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67749, 2059, 92, '<td valign="top">WOW ! How rare this type of photo is ! At *first* glance I thought wow this is pretty busy. However, I gave this a second look this morning as it was late last night when I looked at it. I must say...not only was this a hard subject to capture but the crop is perfect ! It frames it so well. This is a 8 from me.</td>', 'WOW ! How rare this type of photo is ! At *first* glance I thought wow this is pretty busy. However, I gave this a second look this morning as it was late last night when I looked at it. I must say...not only was this a hard subject to capture but the crop is perfect ! It frames it so well. This is a 8 from me.', '2002-06-03 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
