(67929, 2081, 1, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand this shot much.  It seems a little bright too like it was flashed.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand this shot much.  It seems a little bright too like it was flashed.', '2002-06-04 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67930, 2081, 1882, '<td valign="top">That one made me laugh.  Interesting idea to place the photo of real people behind the doll.  IT almost looks like a mirror.  Pretty cool.</td>', 'That one made me laugh.  Interesting idea to place the photo of real people behind the doll.  IT almost looks like a mirror.  Pretty cool.', '2002-06-04 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67931, 2081, 2, '<td valign="top">The compression on this image is pretty bad, but you''re using 130k, and that doesn''t seem quite right to me.  The compression is too bad to be 130k.  I like the idea of the image.  I''d have tried to cut the white area on the right of the photo out, as it''s just distracting from the image.  That would have given you a frame closer to her head, too -- which I also think would be good.</td>', 'The compression on this image is pretty bad, but you''re using 130k, and that doesn''t seem quite right to me.  The compression is too bad to be 130k.  I like the idea of the image.  I''d have tried to cut the white area on the right of the photo out, as it''s just distracting from the image.  That would have given you a frame closer to her head, too -- which I also think would be good.', '2002-06-04 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67932, 2081, 543, '<td valign="top">Eerily compelling.  The door draws my attention in the fg, as if it''s just swung open, and there''s the thing that answered, looking at the detective to my right and slightly startled by the lamp on my video camera..  I zoom in tighter on its head and the portrait in the background.  It replies to the detective, "But I *am* Mrs. Rowan..."  Raising your score on second look.</td>', 'Eerily compelling.  The door draws my attention in the fg, as if it''s just swung open, and there''s the thing that answered, looking at the detective to my right and slightly startled by the lamp on my video camera..  I zoom in tighter on its head and the portrait in the background.  It replies to the detective, "But I *am* Mrs. Rowan..."  Raising your score on second look.', '2002-06-06 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67933, 2081, 2103, '<td valign="top">shaddow is kinda bad</td>', 'shaddow is kinda bad', '2002-06-09 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67934, 2082, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the stone at the front but the sky is far too burnt out - neitral grad might have helped.</td>', 'Nice detail on the stone at the front but the sky is far too burnt out - neitral grad might have helped.', '2002-06-03 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67935, 2082, 1829, '<td valign="top">Graveyards always look fantastic in black n'' white.  You captured it well.</td>', 'Graveyards always look fantastic in black n'' white.  You captured it well.', '2002-06-03 06:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
