(67942, 2082, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way your composition gives some depth to the picture.  It seems like there should be some contrast between teh church (?) roof and the sky.</td>', 'I like the way your composition gives some depth to the picture.  It seems like there should be some contrast between teh church (?) roof and the sky.', '2002-06-04 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67943, 2082, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good capture,  sky kinda washed out, along with the church roof, which makes them blend in together, but that''s pretty minor.   The Raymond''s tombstone appears a bit dark, but it''s not your real subject.   Overall, really nice.<br/>Photo 9  Creativity 7 B&amp;W 8</td>', 'Good capture,  sky kinda washed out, along with the church roof, which makes them blend in together, but that''s pretty minor.   The Raymond''s tombstone appears a bit dark, but it''s not your real subject.   Overall, really nice.Photo 9  Creativity 7 B&W 8', '2002-06-04 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67944, 2082, 1446, '<td valign="top">I really like b&amp;w cemetary shots.  So IMO perfect choice for the challenge. I can tell you where working with natural lighting, but the roof of the church and the tops of the gravestones seem overexposed.  Still an above average shot.</td>', 'I really like b&w cemetary shots.  So IMO perfect choice for the challenge. I can tell you where working with natural lighting, but the roof of the church and the tops of the gravestones seem overexposed.  Still an above average shot.', '2002-06-04 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67945, 2082, 587, '<td valign="top">interesting that you would title this after Minnie, when it''s the church my eye is drawn to - being in the middle of the two head stones. would like to have seen more of the headstone, it seems to have great texture.</td>', 'interesting that you would title this after Minnie, when it''s the church my eye is drawn to - being in the middle of the two head stones. would like to have seen more of the headstone, it seems to have great texture.', '2002-06-04 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67946, 2082, 1590, '<td valign="top">Excellent tonal range. Good subject for the comp topic.</td>', 'Excellent tonal range. Good subject for the comp topic.', '2002-06-05 05:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67947, 2082, 543, '<td valign="top">At another time of day, when the headstones aren''t backlit, I think you''d have a better look.  I can make out some lettering in the far R stone, but it still strikes me as too dark.  Compositionally, I''m not very happy with the way Minnie is ''looking'' out of the frame.</td>', 'At another time of day, when the headstones aren''t backlit, I think you''d have a better look.  I can make out some lettering in the far R stone, but it still strikes me as too dark.  Compositionally, I''m not very happy with the way Minnie is ''looking'' out of the frame.', '2002-06-05 07:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67948, 2082, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice composition here!  I like this photo... I think the church building in the background got just a little over exposed possibly but its not a bad result... good work!</td>', 'Nice composition here!  I like this photo... I think the church building in the background got just a little over exposed possibly but its not a bad result... good work!', '2002-06-05 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
