(67983, 2085, 1042, '<td valign="top">beautiful newborn child, it has to be only days or hours old? Nice shot and what a wonderful photo for the mother to have!</td>', 'beautiful newborn child, it has to be only days or hours old? Nice shot and what a wonderful photo for the mother to have!', '2002-06-03 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
