(67991, 2085, 811, '<td valign="top">This picture has a very tender feel to it, as I am sure it is meant to.  The blurrines of most everything except the face works well, for me.</td>', 'This picture has a very tender feel to it, as I am sure it is meant to.  The blurrines of most everything except the face works well, for me.', '2002-06-04 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(67992, 2085, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo is gorgeous, but something about it makes me feel like there are too many things going on, too many distractions. In a way, though, it just makes it more charming to me. The hand is a wonderful touch (no pun intended).</td>', 'This photo is gorgeous, but something about it makes me feel like there are too many things going on, too many distractions. In a way, though, it just makes it more charming to me. The hand is a wonderful touch (no pun intended).', '2002-06-05 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
