(68006, 2086, 798, '<td valign="top">Like the imagination and the title!</td>', 'Like the imagination and the title!', '2002-06-03 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68007, 2086, 1175, '<td valign="top">Hehehehehehe.  Good one.  I just wish you didn''t have glow spots on the dolls, I''m not sure how you could remove this other than using a very large light diffuser.  A tad bit more focus would have helped.  Looks like there is some noise/grain in the backdrop but not on the picture itself.  i think having it through out the picture would have been a n ice touch.</td>', 'Hehehehehehe.  Good one.  I just wish you didn''t have glow spots on the dolls, I''m not sure how you could remove this other than using a very large light diffuser.  A tad bit more focus would have helped.  Looks like there is some noise/grain in the backdrop but not on the picture itself.  i think having it through out the picture would have been a n ice touch.', '2002-06-03 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68008, 2086, 156, '<td valign="top">ROTFLMAO! i thought there was something funny about their faces on the thumbnail, thought it was masks or something -- what a hoot!!  Very clever, i love it</td>', 'ROTFLMAO! i thought there was something funny about their faces on the thumbnail, thought it was masks or something -- what a hoot!!  Very clever, i love it', '2002-06-03 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68009, 2086, 1379, '<td valign="top">This is too funny!  I looks like a photo of a photo, with the sugary sand and the weirdly grainy backdrop.  So corny, in a good way!</td>', 'This is too funny!  I looks like a photo of a photo, with the sugary sand and the weirdly grainy backdrop.  So corny, in a good way!', '2002-06-03 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68010, 2086, 327, '<td valign="top">Too creative! Just a fun shot. Well done I really like this. Great.</td>', 'Too creative! Just a fun shot. Well done I really like this. Great.', '2002-06-03 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68011, 2086, 1009, '<td valign="top">Hehe... awesome</td>', 'Hehe... awesome', '2002-06-03 18:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68012, 2086, 1651, '<td valign="top">awesome.</td>', 'awesome.', '2002-06-03 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68013, 2086, 1031, '<td valign="top">"Paparazzi''s Viewfinder"? Funny and well done.</td>', '"Paparazzi''s Viewfinder"? Funny and well done.', '2002-06-04 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68014, 2086, 1882, '<td valign="top">Very funny!  Is this a combo of two pictures.  Looks like you have the figurines on your own sand and some sort of photo behind them.  That''s what I''m guessing anyway, but I could be wrong.  Would like to know.  Very neat and clever.</td>', 'Very funny!  Is this a combo of two pictures.  Looks like you have the figurines on your own sand and some sort of photo behind them.  That''s what I''m guessing anyway, but I could be wrong.  Would like to know.  Very neat and clever.', '2002-06-04 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68015, 2086, 1944, '<td valign="top">fun.</td>', 'fun.', '2002-06-04 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68016, 2086, 543, '<td valign="top">Must be nice to have your own private beach.  {g}  The fg ''sand'' and the figurines aren''t a perfect lighting match for the bg, but the overall effect is excellent.  High marks for creativity and execution.  Top 3, IMO.</td>', 'Must be nice to have your own private beach.  {g}  The fg ''sand'' and the figurines aren''t a perfect lighting match for the bg, but the overall effect is excellent.  High marks for creativity and execution.  Top 3, IMO.', '2002-06-05 07:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68017, 2086, 641, '<td valign="top">Cute, a little grainy.. but you may have intended that for the look.</td>', 'Cute, a little grainy.. but you may have intended that for the look.', '2002-06-05 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68018, 2086, 1446, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  I like the light on the figurines.  What appears to be a photograph in the background is pretty grainy.</td>', 'Interesting concept.  I like the light on the figurines.  What appears to be a photograph in the background is pretty grainy.', '2002-06-05 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68019, 2086, 862, '<td valign="top">Now that''s funny!</td>', 'Now that''s funny!', '2002-06-05 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68020, 2086, 772, '<td valign="top">This is neat!  I like it!  Kudos on the originality!!!! = 9</td>', 'This is neat!  I like it!  Kudos on the originality!!!! = 9', '2002-06-05 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68021, 2086, 472, '<td valign="top">amusing idea.  photo is pretty washed out, over exposed.  not enough contrast range.</td>', 'amusing idea.  photo is pretty washed out, over exposed.  not enough contrast range.', '2002-06-06 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68022, 2086, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is cute :).</td>', 'This is cute :).', '2002-06-06 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68023, 2086, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  very clever.  Isn''t the palm tree, etc. a photo backdrop?  Check your sun shadows, the dolls are going to the left, the palm is almost straight down.  (gotcha!)   Photo 9 Creativity 8 B&amp;W 8  total 8</td>', 'Great idea!  very clever.  Isn''t the palm tree, etc. a photo backdrop?  Check your sun shadows, the dolls are going to the left, the palm is almost straight down.  (gotcha!)   Photo 9 Creativity 8 B&W 8  total 8', '2002-06-07 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68024, 2086, 2071, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2002-06-07 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68025, 2086, 332, '<td valign="top">Hehe... like it ;)</td>', 'Hehe... like it ;)', '2002-06-08 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68026, 2086, 2077, '<td valign="top">Fun!</td>', 'Fun!', '2002-06-08 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68027, 2086, 2093, '<td valign="top">I like the graininess of the photo. Lends a nice "oldness" that goes with the porcelin dolls.  The beach is a bit washed out or overexposed though.</td>', 'I like the graininess of the photo. Lends a nice "oldness" that goes with the porcelin dolls.  The beach is a bit washed out or overexposed though.', '2002-06-09 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68028, 2086, 2060, '<td valign="top">The simple ones are always the best ones!</td>', 'The simple ones are always the best ones!', '2002-06-09 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68029, 2086, 2103, '<td valign="top">8 for originality &amp; title</td>', '8 for originality & title', '2002-06-09 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68030, 2086, 1, '<td valign="top">Haha, very nice.  I''d like to know how the background was done.  Funny shot.</td>', 'Haha, very nice.  I''d like to know how the background was done.  Funny shot.', '2002-06-09 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68031, 2087, 409, '<td valign="top">excelent composition<br/>love this idea<br/></td>', 'excelent compositionlove this idea', '2002-06-03 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68032, 2087, 1455, '<td valign="top">Your kitty is not in focus. It could have been</td>', 'Your kitty is not in focus. It could have been', '2002-06-03 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68033, 2087, 1211, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t seem to work with the cat out of focus.  I also wonder about having a flower in a B&amp;W picture.</td>', 'It doesn''t seem to work with the cat out of focus.  I also wonder about having a flower in a B&W picture.', '2002-06-03 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68034, 2087, 772, '<td valign="top">neat photo!  i don''t really ''understand'' any intent or message here but the shot is nice.. i like the blurred cat which forces the subject to be the rose... i would, however, like to see more contrast between the subject and the background... good shot!</td>', 'neat photo!  i don''t really ''understand'' any intent or message here but the shot is nice.. i like the blurred cat which forces the subject to be the rose... i would, however, like to see more contrast between the subject and the background... good shot!', '2002-06-03 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68035, 2087, 573, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus on the Rose, but the detail in the white cat some how got lost.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus on the Rose, but the detail in the white cat some how got lost.', '2002-06-03 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68036, 2087, 1944, '<td valign="top">a snapshot. The main subject is completely blown out</td>', 'a snapshot. The main subject is completely blown out', '2002-06-03 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68037, 2087, 1964, '<td valign="top">Damn.. this on is cool one. Love the ''colors'' :)</td>', 'Damn.. this on is cool one. Love the ''colors'' :)', '2002-06-03 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68038, 2087, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is the most clever of the cat photos this week....  very artistic and unique.  I gave this high marks.</td>', 'This is the most clever of the cat photos this week....  very artistic and unique.  I gave this high marks.', '2002-06-03 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68039, 2087, 203, '<td valign="top">Get your cat to a vet! It needs focus.  OK I read your forum post.  It was on purpose.  In that case the photo is flat, boring and simply does not work for me.  It seems to be grey tones and lacks interest generaly.  Of course the next commentor will love it so you must remember that it is you that you must please.  I rated this one a 2 because I do not give 1s to photos I feel at least meet the challenge.  Pet shots hardly ever work for more than snapshots BTW.</td>', 'Get your cat to a vet! It needs focus.  OK I read your forum post.  It was on purpose.  In that case the photo is flat, boring and simply does not work for me.  It seems to be grey tones and lacks interest generaly.  Of course the next commentor will love it so you must remember that it is you that you must please.  I rated this one a 2 because I do not give 1s to photos I feel at least meet the challenge.  Pet shots hardly ever work for more than snapshots BTW.', '2002-06-03 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68040, 2087, 1379, '<td valign="top">So slinky!</td>', 'So slinky!', '2002-06-03 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68041, 2087, 737, '<td valign="top">An out of focus cat doesn''t go with the title. Good flower shot, though.</td>', 'An out of focus cat doesn''t go with the title. Good flower shot, though.', '2002-06-03 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68042, 2087, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field...</td>', 'Nice depth of field...', '2002-06-03 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68043, 2087, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Neat b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice job. Neat b&w.', '2002-06-03 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68044, 2087, 1897, '<td valign="top">The flower is beautiful, the cat should either be in focus, or even farther out of focus.  The way it is now it too distracting/disturbing.  I crop of just the flower would be a nice photo.</td>', 'The flower is beautiful, the cat should either be in focus, or even farther out of focus.  The way it is now it too distracting/disturbing.  I crop of just the flower would be a nice photo.', '2002-06-03 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68045, 2087, 1759, '<td valign="top">I love the flower, but went away from this photo somewhat confused as to the subject. I''m wondering if a wide-angle lens could put the cat more in the background without loosing the perspective on the rose. The back and tail of the cat are also somewhat blown out.</td>', 'I love the flower, but went away from this photo somewhat confused as to the subject. I''m wondering if a wide-angle lens could put the cat more in the background without loosing the perspective on the rose. The back and tail of the cat are also somewhat blown out.', '2002-06-03 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68046, 2087, 1336, '<td valign="top">to me, this photo would have been better without the cat.</td>', 'to me, this photo would have been better without the cat.', '2002-06-04 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(68047, 2087, 543, '<td valign="top">One of the most difficult subjects is the back of an animal.  Just very, very hard to make that interesting, IMO.  The overexposure on the cat''s back doesn''t help matters.  Perhaps if it were balanced with some pure black somewhere, but as it is it becomes a white, featureless area in a sea of greys.  Did you, by any chance, check out the individual color channels on the original image (if you shot in color)?  Maybe there was a more dnamically balanced option there.</td>', 'One of the most difficult subjects is the back of an animal.  Just very, very hard to make that interesting, IMO.  The overexposure on the cat''s back doesn''t help matters.  Perhaps if it were balanced with some pure black somewhere, but as it is it becomes a white, featureless area in a sea of greys.  Did you, by any chance, check out the individual color channels on the original image (if you shot in color)?  Maybe there was a more dnamically balanced option there.', '2002-06-04 04:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68048, 2087, 1041, '<td valign="top">I know you say the cat''s OOF for a reason, but unfortunately, the reason is not obvious to me when I look at your photo.  The cat''s also washed out (I''m sure there''s a reason for that, too), but overall, IMO, the picture isn''t very appealing to me.  Sorry.</td>', 'I know you say the cat''s OOF for a reason, but unfortunately, the reason is not obvious to me when I look at your photo.  The cat''s also washed out (I''m sure there''s a reason for that, too), but overall, IMO, the picture isn''t very appealing to me.  Sorry.', '2002-06-04 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68049, 2087, 661, '<td valign="top">If the cat had been interested in the flower, I think this would have worked better for me.  Cat seems "too" white.</td>', 'If the cat had been interested in the flower, I think this would have worked better for me.  Cat seems "too" white.', '2002-06-04 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68050, 2087, 1031, '<td valign="top">On my monitor you lose the highlights on the cat, but pretty good DOF to capture these two subjects this well.</td>', 'On my monitor you lose the highlights on the cat, but pretty good DOF to capture these two subjects this well.', '2002-06-04 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68051, 2087, 885, '<td valign="top">The cat is overexposed, but you probably know that.  I can''t decide if it adds to it or detracts though.  It definitely pulls my attention away from the rose though.  A very interesting composition.</td>', 'The cat is overexposed, but you probably know that.  I can''t decide if it adds to it or detracts though.  It definitely pulls my attention away from the rose though.  A very interesting composition.', '2002-06-04 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68052, 2087, 1454, '<td valign="top">It might be my monitor, but the cat looks very bright...<br/>Regards!</td>', 'It might be my monitor, but the cat looks very bright...Regards!', '2002-06-05 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68053, 2087, 1037, '<td valign="top">There are two objects here competing for my attention. Both are interesting, but together they undermine one another.</td>', 'There are two objects here competing for my attention. Both are interesting, but together they undermine one another.', '2002-06-05 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68054, 2087, 2000, '<td valign="top">The cat looks like it should be more in focus.</td>', 'The cat looks like it should be more in focus.', '2002-06-05 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68055, 2087, 741, '<td valign="top">Bold use of 2 subjects but I think it''s distracting</td>', 'Bold use of 2 subjects but I think it''s distracting', '2002-06-05 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68056, 2087, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the rose, the cat distracts from it though</td>', 'Nice job with the rose, the cat distracts from it though', '2002-06-06 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68057, 2087, 878, '<td valign="top">I think the rose had enought going for itself, the cat is a bit much in this shot.</td>', 'I think the rose had enought going for itself, the cat is a bit much in this shot.', '2002-06-07 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68058, 2087, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lovely rose, well done for it, but the cat, even though good contrast element in the photo, is washed out badly.  I also think the color value of the grass and the rose are a little too close for the rose to "stand out" as much as I would have liked to have seen it.  I really like the edges of the rose petals and the way they stand out.  Were the petals tipped in white?  Very nice!<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 6 B&amp;W 7 total 7</td>', 'Lovely rose, well done for it, but the cat, even though good contrast element in the photo, is washed out badly.  I also think the color value of the grass and the rose are a little too close for the rose to "stand out" as much as I would have liked to have seen it.  I really like the edges of the rose petals and the way they stand out.  Were the petals tipped in white?  Very nice!Photo 8 Creativity 6 B&W 7 total 7', '2002-06-07 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68059, 2087, 582, '<td valign="top">Nice rose, but the cat is a bit "fuzzy", I mean out of focus.</td>', 'Nice rose, but the cat is a bit "fuzzy", I mean out of focus.', '2002-06-08 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68060, 2087, 1280, '<td valign="top">Seems to be two subjects here.  The cat should be in focus since he is the one the title describes as walking.</td>', 'Seems to be two subjects here.  The cat should be in focus since he is the one the title describes as walking.', '2002-06-08 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68061, 2087, 2091, '<td valign="top">Interesting focus, nice work.</td>', 'Interesting focus, nice work.', '2002-06-09 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68062, 2087, 1, '<td valign="top">They should both be in focus in my opinion.</td>', 'They should both be in focus in my opinion.', '2002-06-09 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68063, 2091, 741, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit grainy - this might have been caused by shooting so much into the light.</td>', 'Looks a bit grainy - this might have been caused by shooting so much into the light.', '2002-06-03 06:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68064, 2091, 1829, '<td valign="top">Flowers are one of my favourite nature shots to photograph.  You captured this shot well.  A well deserving 9</td>', 'Flowers are one of my favourite nature shots to photograph.  You captured this shot well.  A well deserving 9', '2002-06-03 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68065, 2091, 409, '<td valign="top">technically excelent, nice textures and contrast. <br/> shame I''ve seen too many flower photos to qualify this one as original</td>', 'technically excelent, nice textures and contrast.  shame I''ve seen too many flower photos to qualify this one as original', '2002-06-03 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68066, 2091, 1, '<td valign="top">The textures are def great, especially the background.</td>', 'The textures are def great, especially the background.', '2002-06-03 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68067, 2091, 327, '<td valign="top">?Day Lily. Very nice b&amp;w. Good job.</td>', '?Day Lily. Very nice b&w. Good job.', '2002-06-03 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68068, 2091, 1211, '<td valign="top">Good shot, perhaps sharpened a bit too much, the stem esp. seems a bit off.  Why take a picture of a flower for a B&amp;W challenge, though?</td>', 'Good shot, perhaps sharpened a bit too much, the stem esp. seems a bit off.  Why take a picture of a flower for a B&W challenge, though?', '2002-06-03 19:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68069, 2091, 1651, '<td valign="top">i don''t usually like flower pictures but this one is good. nice job.</td>', 'i don''t usually like flower pictures but this one is good. nice job.', '2002-06-03 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68070, 2091, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good job of capturing the "texture" and isolating your subject.</td>', 'Good job of capturing the "texture" and isolating your subject.', '2002-06-03 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68071, 2091, 811, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but a little too sharp.   I think a softer focus would''ve been truly effective here (but then again, it probably would''ve lowered your score).</td>', 'Very nice, but a little too sharp.   I think a softer focus would''ve been truly effective here (but then again, it probably would''ve lowered your score).', '2002-06-04 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68072, 2091, 637, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W doesn''t work for me here.</td>', 'B&W doesn''t work for me here.', '2002-06-04 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68073, 2091, 772, '<td valign="top">I generally like most flower photos including this one.. I think the wrinkles and curls on the leaves of this lily look a little strange though...</td>', 'I generally like most flower photos including this one.. I think the wrinkles and curls on the leaves of this lily look a little strange though...', '2002-06-04 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68074, 2091, 885, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field.</td>', 'Good depth of field.', '2002-06-05 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68075, 2091, 1042, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in the petals and stem....I like that there''s a background of other flowers instead of just sky...matches the title nicely. I don''t know how to comment on this technically but all I can say is I like what I see.</td>', 'I love the detail in the petals and stem....I like that there''s a background of other flowers instead of just sky...matches the title nicely. I don''t know how to comment on this technically but all I can say is I like what I see.', '2002-06-06 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68076, 2091, 313, '<td valign="top">ordinarily i''d say the contrast was too high, but man this works out great.  excellent shot.</td>', 'ordinarily i''d say the contrast was too high, but man this works out great.  excellent shot.', '2002-06-06 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68077, 2091, 543, '<td valign="top">The vertical composition leaves too much negative space at top, and cuts off the petal at L.  If you really wanted to go this orientation, I''d have moved the bloom higher up in the frame.  Cool texture in the petals.  Near petal goes oof.</td>', 'The vertical composition leaves too much negative space at top, and cuts off the petal at L.  If you really wanted to go this orientation, I''d have moved the bloom higher up in the frame.  Cool texture in the petals.  Near petal goes oof.', '2002-06-06 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68078, 2091, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love the high contrast in this photo. You''re a lot braver than most people have been in pushing that up a bit. It really emphasises the lines of these petals.</td>', 'Beautiful! I love the high contrast in this photo. You''re a lot braver than most people have been in pushing that up a bit. It really emphasises the lines of these petals.', '2002-06-06 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68079, 2091, 1944, '<td valign="top">a little over-contrasty and/or over sharpened for my taste.</td>', 'a little over-contrasty and/or over sharpened for my taste.', '2002-06-08 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68080, 2091, 2, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love this photograph.  Your texture in the background is almost just as exciting as the amazing texture in the foreground.  Awesome levels and contrast.</td>', 'Wow, I love this photograph.  Your texture in the background is almost just as exciting as the amazing texture in the foreground.  Awesome levels and contrast.', '2002-06-08 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68081, 2092, 616, '<td valign="top">This isn''t much contrast here.</td>', 'This isn''t much contrast here.', '2002-06-03 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68082, 2092, 1360, '<td valign="top">Awww.  Puppy!</td>', 'Awww.  Puppy!', '2002-06-03 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68083, 2092, 441, '<td valign="top">lovely detail and DOF</td>', 'lovely detail and DOF', '2002-06-03 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68084, 2092, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w. Good job.</td>', 'Neat b&w. Good job.', '2002-06-03 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68085, 2092, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice job</td>', 'Nice job', '2002-06-03 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68086, 2092, 1597, '<td valign="top">they always smile when their happy..overall good shot</td>', 'they always smile when their happy..overall good shot', '2002-06-03 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68087, 2092, 772, '<td valign="top">Good detail :) I think the tongue should have been fully in the photo :) Good job!</td>', 'Good detail :) I think the tongue should have been fully in the photo :) Good job!', '2002-06-04 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68088, 2092, 885, '<td valign="top">I really like the cropping around the head, but the fact that the toungue is cut off and a little out of the focal plane bother me a bit.  I do like, though, how the body of the dog is slightly out of focus.  The texture and detail you''ve managed to capture in his/her fur it really nice.</td>', 'I really like the cropping around the head, but the fact that the toungue is cut off and a little out of the focal plane bother me a bit.  I do like, though, how the body of the dog is slightly out of focus.  The texture and detail you''ve managed to capture in his/her fur it really nice.', '2002-06-04 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68089, 2092, 1, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, though I feel the tongue doesnt need to be chopped off.</td>', 'Cute shot, though I feel the tongue doesnt need to be chopped off.', '2002-06-04 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68090, 2092, 661, '<td valign="top">Didja have to cut off his tongue?  Nice Clarity.</td>', 'Didja have to cut off his tongue?  Nice Clarity.', '2002-06-04 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
