(68109, 2093, 1856, '<td valign="top">Love this one.  It takes me back to childhood days in the woods.  My one suggestion for improvement would be to downplay (crop out) the bottom right tree just a little.  I could be wrong (I have the flu right now) but it''s strength in the image and perspective is making me a little queasy.  Maybe it''s the dark shadow on the trunk??  Anyway, great picture!</td>', 'Love this one.  It takes me back to childhood days in the woods.  My one suggestion for improvement would be to downplay (crop out) the bottom right tree just a little.  I could be wrong (I have the flu right now) but it''s strength in the image and perspective is making me a little queasy.  Maybe it''s the dark shadow on the trunk??  Anyway, great picture!', '2002-06-08 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
