(68150, 2096, 1863, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the way the river moves off to the right as it disappears. black swans are pretty rare too! I wish it was just a tiny bit closer to the swan! 9 - Annida</td>', 'I like the composition and the way the river moves off to the right as it disappears. black swans are pretty rare too! I wish it was just a tiny bit closer to the swan! 9 - Annida', '2002-06-03 05:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
