(68179, 2097, 1078, '<td valign="top">One of my personal favorites this week.  My one I wish would be that the snail''s head was a little bit better lit, but that would admittedly be hard to do if you wanted to keep the shell well defined.</td>', 'One of my personal favorites this week.  My one I wish would be that the snail''s head was a little bit better lit, but that would admittedly be hard to do if you wanted to keep the shell well defined.', '2002-06-04 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68180, 2097, 1597, '<td valign="top">creative I wish the snail had more lighting</td>', 'creative I wish the snail had more lighting', '2002-06-04 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68181, 2097, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice subject placement on this photo... this allows the shadow to play a nice role in this shot... good work!</td>', 'very nice subject placement on this photo... this allows the shadow to play a nice role in this shot... good work!', '2002-06-04 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68182, 2097, 587, '<td valign="top">cool. if only a tad brighter - love the texture, great job.</td>', 'cool. if only a tad brighter - love the texture, great job.', '2002-06-05 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68183, 2097, 1658, '<td valign="top">Really good use of black and white on this one, especially with that shadow.</td>', 'Really good use of black and white on this one, especially with that shadow.', '2002-06-05 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68184, 2097, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful. The depth of field is nice, the texture of the background, the contrast, the framing, but I especially love the paralell between the ribs in the leaf and the radial grooves all around the spiral of the snail''s shell. 10 from me.</td>', 'Very beautiful. The depth of field is nice, the texture of the background, the contrast, the framing, but I especially love the paralell between the ribs in the leaf and the radial grooves all around the spiral of the snail''s shell. 10 from me.', '2002-06-05 06:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68185, 2097, 1024, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the snail is incredible... including the fact that his antenna are backlit so that they are easily seen.  I think the only (small) recommendation I would make is that I would have cropped it a bit tighter so that the shadow on the right was a bit less noticable.</td>', 'The lighting on the snail is incredible... including the fact that his antenna are backlit so that they are easily seen.  I think the only (small) recommendation I would make is that I would have cropped it a bit tighter so that the shadow on the right was a bit less noticable.', '2002-06-05 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68186, 2097, 641, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting, and the composition.</td>', 'I like the lighting, and the composition.', '2002-06-05 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68187, 2097, 1031, '<td valign="top">Did you remember to get a slimed model release? (Sorry!)</td>', 'Did you remember to get a slimed model release? (Sorry!)', '2002-06-05 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68188, 2097, 255, '<td valign="top">very nice--love the lighting and the DOF that really brings the snail and leaf into perspective. I also like the symmetry between  the lines on the snail and the lines on the leaf. good eye and good job!</td>', 'very nice--love the lighting and the DOF that really brings the snail and leaf into perspective. I also like the symmetry between  the lines on the snail and the lines on the leaf. good eye and good job!', '2002-06-05 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68189, 2097, 313, '<td valign="top">impressive.</td>', 'impressive.', '2002-06-06 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68190, 2097, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting.  Very dramatic.  The snail almost looks fake.</td>', 'Interesting lighting.  Very dramatic.  The snail almost looks fake.', '2002-06-06 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68191, 2097, 543, '<td valign="top">So good, down to the slight spill of light onto the near eyestalk.  {gulp} no critique.  10</td>', 'So good, down to the slight spill of light onto the near eyestalk.  {gulp} no critique.  10', '2002-06-06 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68192, 2097, 875, '<td valign="top">I love all the textures in this.  The lighting is wonderful.  This is one of my top two.</td>', 'I love all the textures in this.  The lighting is wonderful.  This is one of my top two.', '2002-06-06 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68193, 2097, 1863, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite picture of the week. I like the shadows, the subject, and pretty much everything about it. - 10 - Annida</td>', 'I think this is my favorite picture of the week. I like the shadows, the subject, and pretty much everything about it. - 10 - Annida', '2002-06-06 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68194, 2097, 806, '<td valign="top">I find myself wishing the light was coming from the other direction. Also, nature photos should be cropped in tight around the subject. Curious: Did you take any macro shot of just the shell?</td>', 'I find myself wishing the light was coming from the other direction. Also, nature photos should be cropped in tight around the subject. Curious: Did you take any macro shot of just the shell?', '2002-06-06 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68195, 2097, 139, '<td valign="top">Quite pleasing to the eye, and a good use of B&amp;W to emphasize both texture and structure.</td>', 'Quite pleasing to the eye, and a good use of B&W to emphasize both texture and structure.', '2002-06-09 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68196, 2097, 1, '<td valign="top">the lighting is great, but i''d prefer it to be more on the snail, isntead of his back.  You''ve done well to show the shell and his antenni.</td>', 'the lighting is great, but i''d prefer it to be more on the snail, isntead of his back.  You''ve done well to show the shell and his antenni.', '2002-06-09 21:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68197, 2097, 656, '<td valign="top">lighting needs some work to bring out the snail shell.  Maybe a different orientation would have allowed you to fill the frame too ?  Has the elements of a effective shot.</td>', 'lighting needs some work to bring out the snail shell.  Maybe a different orientation would have allowed you to fill the frame too ?  Has the elements of a effective shot.', '2002-06-09 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68198, 2097, 1175, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments.  I knew there would be people that would say they wanted to see the snail more and I do have pictures with more light on the snail, but I enjoyed this picture the most.  It has a sort of mystery as to the appearance of the slug.  I also did not crop it in so tight cause I wanted you to  see the bright light on the left an the shadow on the right.  I think it all adds to the picture.</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments.  I knew there would be people that would say they wanted to see the snail more and I do have pictures with more light on the snail, but I enjoyed this picture the most.  It has a sort of mystery as to the appearance of the slug.  I also did not crop it in so tight cause I wanted you to  see the bright light on the left an the shadow on the right.  I think it all adds to the picture.', '2002-06-10 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(68199, 2097, 1707, '<td valign="top">You known, with the arrangement of the snail on the leave, from afar it could look like a flower</td>', 'You known, with the arrangement of the snail on the leave, from afar it could look like a flower', '2002-06-15 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(68200, 2098, 1829, '<td valign="top">Just stunning.  Beautiful photo.  I''m giving you a (9)</td>', 'Just stunning.  Beautiful photo.  I''m giving you a (9)', '2002-06-03 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68201, 2098, 327, '<td valign="top">Good detail, nice tones. Job well done.</td>', 'Good detail, nice tones. Job well done.', '2002-06-03 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68202, 2098, 1211, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Either you have a great zoom or a willing bird.  The background is really grainy, though, which detracts from the shot.</td>', 'Good shot.  Either you have a great zoom or a willing bird.  The background is really grainy, though, which detracts from the shot.', '2002-06-03 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68203, 2098, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love this bird!  The feathers on the breast look so soft and fluffy.  Nice shot!</td>', 'I love this bird!  The feathers on the breast look so soft and fluffy.  Nice shot!', '2002-06-03 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68204, 2098, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast it seems it could have been a bit more focused</td>', 'nice contrast it seems it could have been a bit more focused', '2002-06-03 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68205, 2098, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, the thumbnail for this looked a bit plain, but up close there''s so much detail in the feathers and around the eye. Nice work!</td>', 'Wow, the thumbnail for this looked a bit plain, but up close there''s so much detail in the feathers and around the eye. Nice work!', '2002-06-04 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68206, 2098, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup!  good blur on the background...</td>', 'Nice closeup!  good blur on the background...', '2002-06-04 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68207, 2098, 641, '<td valign="top">Looks like maybe you used the digital zoom, from the noise. I notice this on my camera too. I tried putting my camera on the highest resolution setting and not zooming in so much then in my software I crop tight around the area I wanted. Since the high resolution setting produces a big shot you end up with the same result just cleaner, after you crop it how you want.</td>', 'Looks like maybe you used the digital zoom, from the noise. I notice this on my camera too. I tried putting my camera on the highest resolution setting and not zooming in so much then in my software I crop tight around the area I wanted. Since the high resolution setting produces a big shot you end up with the same result just cleaner, after you crop it how you want.', '2002-06-05 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68208, 2098, 1750, '<td valign="top">I''m very familiar with the difficulty of photographing skittish things -- like birds. Yet you included eye highlights, beak and eyelid detail, backlighting, and depth of field.</td>', 'I''m very familiar with the difficulty of photographing skittish things -- like birds. Yet you included eye highlights, beak and eyelid detail, backlighting, and depth of field.', '2002-06-05 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68209, 2098, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait...</td>', 'Nice portrait...', '2002-06-05 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68210, 2098, 313, '<td valign="top">what an interesting bird.  i like this shot.  i like how the bird''s in focus while the background is a complete blur.</td>', 'what an interesting bird.  i like this shot.  i like how the bird''s in focus while the background is a complete blur.', '2002-06-06 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68211, 2098, 543, '<td valign="top">I''m not a bird fan, but it''s impressive that you got this tight on the little mutant flying lizard.  Slightly soft.  Nice bokeh and grain.</td>', 'I''m not a bird fan, but it''s impressive that you got this tight on the little mutant flying lizard.  Slightly soft.  Nice bokeh and grain.', '2002-06-06 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68212, 2098, 472, '<td valign="top">what a cute guy.  a little unsharp, but i know they move a lot.  if you have faster shutter speed try that.</td>', 'what a cute guy.  a little unsharp, but i know they move a lot.  if you have faster shutter speed try that.', '2002-06-06 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68213, 2098, 139, '<td valign="top">I''ll be interested to know how far away you were for this shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'I''ll be interested to know how far away you were for this shot.  Nice work.', '2002-06-06 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68214, 2098, 587, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I especially like the details around the birds eye, wish it was just a tad sharper, but can''t have everything! - good job.</td>', 'Great capture, I especially like the details around the birds eye, wish it was just a tad sharper, but can''t have everything! - good job.', '2002-06-08 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68215, 2098, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, movign the camera down a bit would eliminate the un-used space on top.</td>', 'Nice DOF, movign the camera down a bit would eliminate the un-used space on top.', '2002-06-09 20:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68216, 2099, 1226, '<td valign="top">Very cool. The amount of light makes the doorways look like the go into an Abyss. Very very cool.</td>', 'Very cool. The amount of light makes the doorways look like the go into an Abyss. Very very cool.', '2002-06-03 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68217, 2099, 1024, '<td valign="top">Great texture, and your contrast is perfect to bring this out in the photograph.  The sky is a little washed out,  but there is so little of it that it does not distract.  Great job.</td>', 'Great texture, and your contrast is perfect to bring this out in the photograph.  The sky is a little washed out,  but there is so little of it that it does not distract.  Great job.', '2002-06-03 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68218, 2099, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Love this. Please tell me where this is when this is over. Good work, nice tone.</td>', 'Cool shot. Love this. Please tell me where this is when this is over. Good work, nice tone.', '2002-06-03 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68219, 2099, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very cool site...</td>', 'Very cool site...', '2002-06-03 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68220, 2099, 117, '<td valign="top">I like the southwest</td>', 'I like the southwest', '2002-06-03 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68221, 2099, 1446, '<td valign="top">Bottom left seems kind of washed out.  Otherwise and interesting photograph.</td>', 'Bottom left seems kind of washed out.  Otherwise and interesting photograph.', '2002-06-03 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68222, 2099, 1031, '<td valign="top">I likeyour subject choice; good detail.</td>', 'I likeyour subject choice; good detail.', '2002-06-04 03:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68223, 2099, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool semi-mysterious shot.  I would prefer a tighter crop, or maybe singling one cabin out.</td>', 'Cool semi-mysterious shot.  I would prefer a tighter crop, or maybe singling one cabin out.', '2002-06-04 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68224, 2099, 1882, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool.  Would love to know where this is.  Probably would like the photo better in color so I''m not sure it was a great choice for this challenge, but it is a neat looking place.</td>', 'Pretty cool.  Would love to know where this is.  Probably would like the photo better in color so I''m not sure it was a great choice for this challenge, but it is a neat looking place.', '2002-06-04 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68225, 2099, 554, '<td valign="top">I really like this, reminds me of home----10</td>', 'I really like this, reminds me of home----10', '2002-06-04 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68226, 2099, 772, '<td valign="top">I think that this photo would be a little more impressive if you were somewhat closer to the cabins... there''s a little too much empty space in the bottom of the frame to suit my tastes...</td>', 'I think that this photo would be a little more impressive if you were somewhat closer to the cabins... there''s a little too much empty space in the bottom of the frame to suit my tastes...', '2002-06-05 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68227, 2099, 258, '<td valign="top">Could be a little closer to the building.</td>', 'Could be a little closer to the building.', '2002-06-05 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68228, 2099, 1658, '<td valign="top">Great picture and subject matter</td>', 'Great picture and subject matter', '2002-06-05 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68229, 2099, 933, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t reallt grab me as a b&amp;w photo.  not bad though...</td>', 'Doesn''t reallt grab me as a b&w photo.  not bad though...', '2002-06-05 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68230, 2099, 543, '<td valign="top">Great subject for this challenge.  I think another time of day might have made for even more dramatic textures, and could have separated the subject from the backgound better.  Needs a slight CW rotation to straighten out the doorways, and maybe a step to the right to get the bush out of the near doorframe.</td>', 'Great subject for this challenge.  I think another time of day might have made for even more dramatic textures, and could have separated the subject from the backgound better.  Needs a slight CW rotation to straighten out the doorways, and maybe a step to the right to get the bush out of the near doorframe.', '2002-06-06 07:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68231, 2099, 1037, '<td valign="top">Awesome subject for black and white, really nicely composed.</td>', 'Awesome subject for black and white, really nicely composed.', '2002-06-06 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68232, 2099, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful textures.</td>', 'beautiful textures.', '2002-06-07 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68233, 2099, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast</td>', 'nice contrast', '2002-06-08 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68234, 2099, 2093, '<td valign="top">The buildings seem to blend in too much with the cliffs. They need something to bring them forward.</td>', 'The buildings seem to blend in too much with the cliffs. They need something to bring them forward.', '2002-06-08 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68235, 2099, 2077, '<td valign="top">Very nice piece</td>', 'Very nice piece', '2002-06-08 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68236, 2099, 2104, '<td valign="top">I love the tonal range in this image. And i like how the buildings sort of curve to the right and out of the frame. The usage of the rule of thirds is great as well (sky buildings ground)</td>', 'I love the tonal range in this image. And i like how the buildings sort of curve to the right and out of the frame. The usage of the rule of thirds is great as well (sky buildings ground)', '2002-06-09 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68237, 2099, 2091, '<td valign="top">Really Nice Architecture :)</td>', 'Really Nice Architecture :)', '2002-06-09 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68238, 2100, 1175, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  Needs more focus.</td>', 'Too dark.  Needs more focus.', '2002-06-03 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68239, 2100, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo but it''s a little dark and the centering is a little off as well...  The centering works best either centered or on a third line...  I''m not sure if the darkness is intentional or not...</td>', 'This is a good photo but it''s a little dark and the centering is a little off as well...  The centering works best either centered or on a third line...  I''m not sure if the darkness is intentional or not...', '2002-06-03 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68240, 2100, 1455, '<td valign="top">too dark needs a tad more light</td>', 'too dark needs a tad more light', '2002-06-03 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68241, 2100, 1897, '<td valign="top">Contrast is too low</td>', 'Contrast is too low', '2002-06-03 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68242, 2100, 1211, '<td valign="top">Did you mean for it to seem out of focus?  If so, I don''t know that it helps any.</td>', 'Did you mean for it to seem out of focus?  If so, I don''t know that it helps any.', '2002-06-03 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68243, 2100, 573, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to decide if I like her this dark.  I feel that even in a place as dimly lit as you are trying to portray the minds eye would lighten the highlights to a plesent level.</td>', 'I''m trying to decide if I like her this dark.  I feel that even in a place as dimly lit as you are trying to portray the minds eye would lighten the highlights to a plesent level.', '2002-06-03 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68244, 2100, 1658, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but a little too dark.</td>', 'Good shot, but a little too dark.', '2002-06-03 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68245, 2100, 1360, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark, but a nice photo anyway</td>', 'A bit too dark, but a nice photo anyway', '2002-06-03 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68246, 2100, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work, well done.</td>', 'Nice work, well done.', '2002-06-03 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(68247, 2100, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice dark effect... what mood were you trying for?</td>', 'Nice dark effect... what mood were you trying for?', '2002-06-03 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68248, 2100, 117, '<td valign="top">little dark nice shot</td>', 'little dark nice shot', '2002-06-03 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68249, 2100, 1759, '<td valign="top">Good mood portrayal. You might try some additional, well positioned lighting could acentuate her face without loosing the mood.</td>', 'Good mood portrayal. You might try some additional, well positioned lighting could acentuate her face without loosing the mood.', '2002-06-03 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68250, 2100, 1313, '<td valign="top">Another kid pic, not very original and too dark.</td>', 'Another kid pic, not very original and too dark.', '2002-06-03 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68251, 2100, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, but too dark.</td>', 'Very sweet, but too dark.', '2002-06-04 04:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68252, 2100, 1882, '<td valign="top">Cute little girl, but I''m not crazy about the lighting and it looks a little blurry.</td>', 'Cute little girl, but I''m not crazy about the lighting and it looks a little blurry.', '2002-06-04 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68253, 2100, 543, '<td valign="top">If you could increase the contrast while maintaining the density of the black bg, you''d have a winner here.</td>', 'If you could increase the contrast while maintaining the density of the black bg, you''d have a winner here.', '2002-06-05 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68254, 2100, 1454, '<td valign="top">It might be my monitor but the background looks too dark....</td>', 'It might be my monitor but the background looks too dark....', '2002-06-05 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68255, 2100, 641, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on her face and the composition of the shot. But it''s a tad bit dark for my taste. Maybe a little bit of soft light from below going onto her face.</td>', 'I like the expression on her face and the composition of the shot. But it''s a tad bit dark for my taste. Maybe a little bit of soft light from below going onto her face.', '2002-06-05 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68256, 2100, 1031, '<td valign="top">"WHERE is that stupid light switch?"<br/><br/>Seriously, I like this expressive portrait and effective use of a limited tone range...and it''s a handy way to drop out almost any background too.</td>', '"WHERE is that stupid light switch?"Seriously, I like this expressive portrait and effective use of a limited tone range...and it''s a handy way to drop out almost any background too.', '2002-06-06 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68257, 2100, 1944, '<td valign="top">needs more light and contrast.</td>', 'needs more light and contrast.', '2002-06-06 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68258, 2100, 1005, '<td valign="top">Appears too dark on my screen.  Focus isn''t soft, but somehow doesn''t seem sharp either, probably due to the darkness of the shot.  Were you in a brown out situation?  Photo 6 Creativity 6 B&amp;W 6 total 6</td>', 'Appears too dark on my screen.  Focus isn''t soft, but somehow doesn''t seem sharp either, probably due to the darkness of the shot.  Were you in a brown out situation?  Photo 6 Creativity 6 B&W 6 total 6', '2002-06-07 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68259, 2100, 332, '<td valign="top">Too dark!</td>', 'Too dark!', '2002-06-08 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68260, 2100, 1256, '<td valign="top">Dark and out of focus, but I like the girls expression.</td>', 'Dark and out of focus, but I like the girls expression.', '2002-06-09 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68261, 2100, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like the pose, and even though things seem a little soft, I like that too.  However, I''m pretty sure that monitor calibration differences or not, the skin tones in this picture need to be brighter.  As for composition, I either would suggest moving her a little bit further to the right, or maybe turning this into a vertical shot.</td>', 'I like the pose, and even though things seem a little soft, I like that too.  However, I''m pretty sure that monitor calibration differences or not, the skin tones in this picture need to be brighter.  As for composition, I either would suggest moving her a little bit further to the right, or maybe turning this into a vertical shot.', '2002-06-09 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68262, 2100, 2091, '<td valign="top">it''s a little dark, but still not bad</td>', 'it''s a little dark, but still not bad', '2002-06-09 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68263, 2100, 656, '<td valign="top">bit too dark - she seems like a good subject - good expression.  Could have been better vertical ?</td>', 'bit too dark - she seems like a good subject - good expression.  Could have been better vertical ?', '2002-06-09 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68264, 2100, 1, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark.</td>', 'A bit too dark.', '2002-06-10 00:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68265, 2101, 1175, '<td valign="top">Might be cropped a little too tight.  Would have prefered more focus.</td>', 'Might be cropped a little too tight.  Would have prefered more focus.', '2002-06-03 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68266, 2101, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Heaps of detail in there.  Probably would look fantastic up on my wall blown up.  Great job!! (9)</td>', 'Great picture.  Heaps of detail in there.  Probably would look fantastic up on my wall blown up.  Great job!! (9)', '2002-06-03 06:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68267, 2101, 1831, '<td valign="top">Lots of Cats this week, but this stands out above the rest, great shot, nice a clear.<br/>what were you doing to distract the cat?</td>', 'Lots of Cats this week, but this stands out above the rest, great shot, nice a clear.what were you doing to distract the cat?', '2002-06-03 06:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68268, 2101, 409, '<td valign="top">interesting crop.</td>', 'interesting crop.', '2002-06-03 08:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68269, 2101, 1455, '<td valign="top">wow those eyes cute kitty</td>', 'wow those eyes cute kitty', '2002-06-03 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
