(68336, 2104, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, I am assuming the dove was "added", nice touch.  I like how you got the old/new headstone thing going.  You''re risking some low grades with all the crosses.  There was some discussion about them.  Certain youths don''t like them.  Personally, don''t care either way.<br/>I wish I was better at critiquing B&amp;W, this is going to be hard for me.  No suggestions, really nice work.  SMALL Nit:  doves back washed out, but I got no magically suggestions on how to avoid that.<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 8 B&amp;W 9 total 9</td>', 'Interesting composition, I am assuming the dove was "added", nice touch.  I like how you got the old/new headstone thing going.  You''re risking some low grades with all the crosses.  There was some discussion about them.  Certain youths don''t like them.  Personally, don''t care either way.I wish I was better at critiquing B&W, this is going to be hard for me.  No suggestions, really nice work.  SMALL Nit:  doves back washed out, but I got no magically suggestions on how to avoid that.Photo 10 Creativity 8 B&W 9 total 9', '2002-06-04 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
