(68341, 2104, 1446, '<td valign="top">Cant tell by looking at this photo if it was set up, or opportunistic.  Either way the composition is above average IMO.  The contrast is good. Because the cross in the background is so prevalant due to color and size I would have liked it included in the dof.</td>', 'Cant tell by looking at this photo if it was set up, or opportunistic.  Either way the composition is above average IMO.  The contrast is good. Because the cross in the background is so prevalant due to color and size I would have liked it included in the dof.', '2002-06-05 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
