(68481, 2113, 587, '<td valign="top">Hehhehheh...ya missed a spot ;) About time men got some equal airtime around here!! More light would help with the grain, unless it''s intentional - then sorry, don''t care for it. and wish the towel wasn''t there. Great capture though!!</td>', 'Hehhehheh...ya missed a spot ;) About time men got some equal airtime around here!! More light would help with the grain, unless it''s intentional - then sorry, don''t care for it. and wish the towel wasn''t there. Great capture though!!', '2002-06-05 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68482, 2113, 1, '<td valign="top">This doesnt seem like anything that should be here.  Maybe if I was a lady I could enjoy this photograph more, who knows?  It seems like a snapshot, like not much thought or effort went into the creation of it.</td>', 'This doesnt seem like anything that should be here.  Maybe if I was a lady I could enjoy this photograph more, who knows?  It seems like a snapshot, like not much thought or effort went into the creation of it.', '2002-06-05 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68483, 2113, 1175, '<td valign="top">Naked men don''t do anything for me.  Interesting angle and all but you could use a better focus.  Also your background (shower curtain bar, towel, and door) are all distracting.</td>', 'Naked men don''t do anything for me.  Interesting angle and all but you could use a better focus.  Also your background (shower curtain bar, towel, and door) are all distracting.', '2002-06-05 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68484, 2113, 1042, '<td valign="top">This could have been a pretty good shot if it weren''t so grainy (soft focus, I don''t know, maybe that''s the look you were going for?) and if you''d gotten a better angle and closer up.you also have this shower curtain rod coming out of your ear and the towel is distracting. And I have to admit... I like partially nude (or fully nude) men as much as the next red blooded american gal...but dang it, get it in focus please ;)</td>', 'This could have been a pretty good shot if it weren''t so grainy (soft focus, I don''t know, maybe that''s the look you were going for?) and if you''d gotten a better angle and closer up.you also have this shower curtain rod coming out of your ear and the towel is distracting. And I have to admit... I like partially nude (or fully nude) men as much as the next red blooded american gal...but dang it, get it in focus please ;)', '2002-06-06 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68485, 2113, 1037, '<td valign="top">You''re very brave to submit this :). I''m sure a lot of people are offended by a bit of masculine pubic hair, but I think it''s neat. If you hadn''t compressed the image too much, and had more contrast, it would be quite a good photo in my opinion.</td>', 'You''re very brave to submit this :). I''m sure a lot of people are offended by a bit of masculine pubic hair, but I think it''s neat. If you hadn''t compressed the image too much, and had more contrast, it would be quite a good photo in my opinion.', '2002-06-06 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
