(68507, 2114, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the position of the horizon in this photo... the birds add a very nice touch of ''tranquility'' in this photo... The only think that I don''t particularly like here is the proximity of the top of the wooden poles to the horizon line.  I think that either slightly above or slightly below the horizon would have been a nice improvement maybe... good work = 9</td>', 'I like the position of the horizon in this photo... the birds add a very nice touch of ''tranquility'' in this photo... The only think that I don''t particularly like here is the proximity of the top of the wooden poles to the horizon line.  I think that either slightly above or slightly below the horizon would have been a nice improvement maybe... good work = 9', '2002-06-05 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
