(68514, 2114, 806, '<td valign="top">This IS tranquility. The ripples of water on the sand, and the birds soaring. Nice. I just wish it were a bit more contrasty. A bit too gray for my liking. Tweek it up a bit, and frame it for your wall! (8)</td>', 'This IS tranquility. The ripples of water on the sand, and the birds soaring. Nice. I just wish it were a bit more contrasty. A bit too gray for my liking. Tweek it up a bit, and frame it for your wall! (8)', '2002-06-09 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
