(68516, 2115, 1759, '<td valign="top">I gave a high score for originality and setup. I wish that her dress hadn''t gotten blown out. I''m wondering if an 81A or B filter might have allowed the texture of the foilage to come through yet give just enough dynamic range to also get the dress. Overall, very good job!</td>', 'I gave a high score for originality and setup. I wish that her dress hadn''t gotten blown out. I''m wondering if an 81A or B filter might have allowed the texture of the foilage to come through yet give just enough dynamic range to also get the dress. Overall, very good job!', '2002-06-03 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68517, 2115, 92, '<td valign="top">This is a well thought out photo. I really like the concept. The white areas (the dress front, sand and foot,  are a little over exposed due to the sunlight I think. However, this is a really nice photo. ( 8 )</td>', 'This is a well thought out photo. I really like the concept. The white areas (the dress front, sand and foot,  are a little over exposed due to the sunlight I think. However, this is a really nice photo. ( 8 )', '2002-06-03 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
