(68539, 2115, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing photo. It really plays with the timelessness of black and white.</td>', 'Very intriguing photo. It really plays with the timelessness of black and white.', '2002-06-05 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68540, 2115, 641, '<td valign="top">Great setup! Love it.</td>', 'Great setup! Love it.', '2002-06-05 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68541, 2115, 1031, '<td valign="top">On my monitor there''s some detail loss in the hightligts.</td>', 'On my monitor there''s some detail loss in the hightligts.', '2002-06-05 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68542, 2115, 543, '<td valign="top">She really looks the part.  Nicely composed, and pretty good tones.  The overexposure on her foot and dress is a bit of a negative, and the wheelbarrow, though it''s a nice prop, doesn''t really fit for me (especially missing the tire), but the latter is really reaching.  I expect this to do very well.</td>', 'She really looks the part.  Nicely composed, and pretty good tones.  The overexposure on her foot and dress is a bit of a negative, and the wheelbarrow, though it''s a nice prop, doesn''t really fit for me (especially missing the tire), but the latter is really reaching.  I expect this to do very well.', '2002-06-06 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68543, 2115, 313, '<td valign="top">great job (if that was your intention) of making this picture look/feel antique.</td>', 'great job (if that was your intention) of making this picture look/feel antique.', '2002-06-06 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68544, 2115, 1944, '<td valign="top">Well done mood piece.</td>', 'Well done mood piece.', '2002-06-06 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68545, 2115, 917, '<td valign="top">The dress is a little overexposed, and the model doesnt look like shes about to actually use that camera.</td>', 'The dress is a little overexposed, and the model doesnt look like shes about to actually use that camera.', '2002-06-07 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68546, 2115, 436, '<td valign="top">too thin</td>', 'too thin', '2002-06-07 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68547, 2115, 878, '<td valign="top">hehe cool shot,  nice camera.</td>', 'hehe cool shot,  nice camera.', '2002-06-07 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68548, 2115, 875, '<td valign="top">I like the old-fashioned feel to this portrait.  One thing I would change about the model is the profile of her face.  Having the tip of her nose line up with the edge of her cheek looks a little odd.  She could turn her face a little more towards or a little more away from the camera to prevent that.</td>', 'I like the old-fashioned feel to this portrait.  One thing I would change about the model is the profile of her face.  Having the tip of her nose line up with the edge of her cheek looks a little odd.  She could turn her face a little more towards or a little more away from the camera to prevent that.', '2002-06-09 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68549, 2115, 2091, '<td valign="top">Has a real nostalgic feeling, nice work :)</td>', 'Has a real nostalgic feeling, nice work :)', '2002-06-09 20:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68550, 2115, 656, '<td valign="top">too contrived/ set-up for my tastes.  Well exposed/ taken though</td>', 'too contrived/ set-up for my tastes.  Well exposed/ taken though', '2002-06-09 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68551, 2115, 1681, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept!  Great idea.  I think the model needs to be shifted to the right in the frame.  That and the blown out front of the dress really knocks it down a few points though.</td>', 'I really like the concept!  Great idea.  I think the model needs to be shifted to the right in the frame.  That and the blown out front of the dress really knocks it down a few points though.', '2002-06-09 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68552, 2116, 1226, '<td valign="top">LOVE the crisp shadow!</td>', 'LOVE the crisp shadow!', '2002-06-03 02:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68553, 2116, 1455, '<td valign="top">A little dark on the actual vase. But nice shadow....</td>', 'A little dark on the actual vase. But nice shadow....', '2002-06-03 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68554, 2116, 573, '<td valign="top">Striking contrast, maybe a bit too dark overall for my taste.  Are the jagies on the handle an artifact of over sharpening?</td>', 'Striking contrast, maybe a bit too dark overall for my taste.  Are the jagies on the handle an artifact of over sharpening?', '2002-06-03 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68555, 2116, 1211, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting here.  Wondering why you kept the edge of the wood (or whatever the vase is sitting on) in the picture.</td>', 'Superb lighting here.  Wondering why you kept the edge of the wood (or whatever the vase is sitting on) in the picture.', '2002-06-03 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68556, 2116, 327, '<td valign="top">Fine looking b&amp;w. Nice job.</td>', 'Fine looking b&w. Nice job.', '2002-06-03 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68557, 2116, 1831, '<td valign="top">lovely use of lighting, great shadow.</td>', 'lovely use of lighting, great shadow.', '2002-06-03 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68558, 2116, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! Great use of shadow.</td>', 'Gorgeous! Great use of shadow.', '2002-06-04 04:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68559, 2116, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you have used light and shadows here.</td>', 'I really like the way you have used light and shadows here.', '2002-06-04 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68560, 2116, 258, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Is this B &amp; W?</td>', 'Nice composition.  Is this B & W?', '2002-06-04 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68561, 2116, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo... I like the lighting and the contrasts offered here... I don''t particularly like the diagonal across the bottom and I think that some small amout of left side lighting that would have highlighted the designs on the left side of the vase would have been nice as well... I''m not sure of it but this photo may have been slightly over sharpened... in the curved handle of the vase, i can see some jagged edges that are sometimes produced by over sharpening... good photo!</td>', 'This is a great photo... I like the lighting and the contrasts offered here... I don''t particularly like the diagonal across the bottom and I think that some small amout of left side lighting that would have highlighted the designs on the left side of the vase would have been nice as well... I''m not sure of it but this photo may have been slightly over sharpened... in the curved handle of the vase, i can see some jagged edges that are sometimes produced by over sharpening... good photo!', '2002-06-05 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68562, 2116, 1658, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of light and shadow.  I would like to see more of the detail on the art on the vase, but that is more of a personal comment than a criticism of how you composed it.  The light and shadow contrast is pretty striking.</td>', 'Very nice use of light and shadow.  I would like to see more of the detail on the art on the vase, but that is more of a personal comment than a criticism of how you composed it.  The light and shadow contrast is pretty striking.', '2002-06-05 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68563, 2116, 1590, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. Nice tonal rang in the background.</td>', 'Simple but effective. Nice tonal rang in the background.', '2002-06-05 05:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68564, 2116, 1013, '<td valign="top">just the shadow would have been better to me</td>', 'just the shadow would have been better to me', '2002-06-05 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68565, 2116, 875, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic lighting - I love the shadow and the graininess of the dark areas.</td>', 'Very dramatic lighting - I love the shadow and the graininess of the dark areas.', '2002-06-06 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68566, 2116, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice effect</td>', 'Nice effect', '2002-06-07 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68567, 2116, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow work, very nicely done set shot.  Great lighting, personal taste, maybe aimed a  little high, but then the table might have been more of a distraction, so let''s go with the benefit of the doubt, GREAT shot!!!!  Photo 10 Creativity 9 B&amp;W 10  (could you have made the table disappear more?)<br/>total score 10  (one of the best this week)</td>', 'Nice shadow work, very nicely done set shot.  Great lighting, personal taste, maybe aimed a  little high, but then the table might have been more of a distraction, so let''s go with the benefit of the doubt, GREAT shot!!!!  Photo 10 Creativity 9 B&W 10  (could you have made the table disappear more?)total score 10  (one of the best this week)', '2002-06-07 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68568, 2116, 1944, '<td valign="top">Needs more detail in the subject.</td>', 'Needs more detail in the subject.', '2002-06-08 00:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68569, 2116, 1993, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I think, compositionally you might have made a better choice of framing....maybe even a real tight shot of the vase, foregoing the shadow.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I think, compositionally you might have made a better choice of framing....maybe even a real tight shot of the vase, foregoing the shadow.', '2002-06-09 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68570, 2116, 543, '<td valign="top">Good use of light and shadow, but I do have a couple of suggestions.  Don''t know how much control you had of the setup, but it might have been nice to have the bottom of the shadow connect with the bottom of the vase.  The edge of the platform at bottom doesn''t do much for me, and I''d like to see the people on the front of the vase arranged so that the light falloff doesn''t cut anyone in half (while maintaining that perfect profile shadow, of course).  You obviously know what you''re doing - just my thoughts.  Nice work.</td>', 'Good use of light and shadow, but I do have a couple of suggestions.  Don''t know how much control you had of the setup, but it might have been nice to have the bottom of the shadow connect with the bottom of the vase.  The edge of the platform at bottom doesn''t do much for me, and I''d like to see the people on the front of the vase arranged so that the light falloff doesn''t cut anyone in half (while maintaining that perfect profile shadow, of course).  You obviously know what you''re doing - just my thoughts.  Nice work.', '2002-06-09 05:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68571, 2116, 436, '<td valign="top">how much does a grecian urn</td>', 'how much does a grecian urn', '2002-06-09 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68572, 2116, 1256, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The shadow is great.</td>', 'I like this one. The shadow is great.', '2002-06-09 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68573, 2116, 1, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, though the shadow seems more of the subject when it shouldn''t be.  Moving the framing over to the right some to make the vase in the middle and the shadow on the left couldve worked more effectively.</td>', 'Great lighting, though the shadow seems more of the subject when it shouldn''t be.  Moving the framing over to the right some to make the vase in the middle and the shadow on the left couldve worked more effectively.', '2002-06-10 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68574, 2119, 1175, '<td valign="top">File quality problems I take it.  File is only 50kb, you have up to 150kb, use it for better quality.  You also need some focus in the picture, feels like everything is slightly off.</td>', 'File quality problems I take it.  File is only 50kb, you have up to 150kb, use it for better quality.  You also need some focus in the picture, feels like everything is slightly off.', '2002-06-03 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68575, 2119, 1540, '<td valign="top">good shot, but a little out of focus</td>', 'good shot, but a little out of focus', '2002-06-03 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68576, 2119, 1041, '<td valign="top">OMG, you still have snow - poor you!  Personally, I would like the shot better if it was a little sharper, and there was a clear focus that draws my eye in.  Even though I like the composition.</td>', 'OMG, you still have snow - poor you!  Personally, I would like the shot better if it was a little sharper, and there was a clear focus that draws my eye in.  Even though I like the composition.', '2002-06-03 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68577, 2119, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow this is pretty. Nice job.</td>', 'Wow this is pretty. Nice job.', '2002-06-03 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68578, 2119, 1009, '<td valign="top">Awesome... maybe a little sharper if possible. Unless this is the effect you wanted, then keep it this way.  :-)</td>', 'Awesome... maybe a little sharper if possible. Unless this is the effect you wanted, then keep it this way.  :-)', '2002-06-03 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68579, 2119, 1037, '<td valign="top">A very interesting nature shot, but it lacks something to pull it together.</td>', 'A very interesting nature shot, but it lacks something to pull it together.', '2002-06-04 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68580, 2119, 587, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this blown up, I bet it''s better to look at larger - I find myself searching to find ''something'' in the woods back there. to bad about the foot prints, unless of course you wanted them there...imo I like woodsy pic''s to seem like a new discovery :) nice job. (glad we are finished with snow for a while...blah) ;P</td>', 'I''d like to see this blown up, I bet it''s better to look at larger - I find myself searching to find ''something'' in the woods back there. to bad about the foot prints, unless of course you wanted them there...imo I like woodsy pic''s to seem like a new discovery :) nice job. (glad we are finished with snow for a while...blah) ;P', '2002-06-04 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68581, 2119, 772, '<td valign="top">It was 94 degrees here in north carolina today... where in the heck did you find ice? lol... good shot...</td>', 'It was 94 degrees here in north carolina today... where in the heck did you find ice? lol... good shot...', '2002-06-05 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68582, 2119, 543, '<td valign="top">Needs a positive gamma adjustment to make the snow at LLHC whiter and bring out some detail in the bg shadows.  A tighter composition on the play of light on the snow and a few stones might have been more effective than the wider, scenic view.</td>', 'Needs a positive gamma adjustment to make the snow at LLHC whiter and bring out some detail in the bg shadows.  A tighter composition on the play of light on the snow and a few stones might have been more effective than the wider, scenic view.', '2002-06-05 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68583, 2119, 1031, '<td valign="top">How "lucky" to still have snow at the end o May...</td>', 'How "lucky" to still have snow at the end o May...', '2002-06-05 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68584, 2119, 661, '<td valign="top">My thought is to dark at the top?</td>', 'My thought is to dark at the top?', '2002-06-05 21:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68585, 2119, 637, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the lighting is effective in this image....too bright<br/></td>', 'I don''t think the lighting is effective in this image....too bright', '2002-06-06 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68586, 2119, 885, '<td valign="top">it took me a minute to figure out that was snow</td>', 'it took me a minute to figure out that was snow', '2002-06-06 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68587, 2119, 1944, '<td valign="top">not sharp</td>', 'not sharp', '2002-06-06 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68588, 2119, 1078, '<td valign="top">This is very black and white -- too much so to my eyes.  There isn''t anything here for me to really focus on -- so it feels very busy.  I''d suggest getting down really close to one of those rocks and using it to fill part of the frame, maybe from a different direction so that all the trees in the background aren''t hidden in shadows and their own silhouettes.</td>', 'This is very black and white -- too much so to my eyes.  There isn''t anything here for me to really focus on -- so it feels very busy.  I''d suggest getting down really close to one of those rocks and using it to fill part of the frame, maybe from a different direction so that all the trees in the background aren''t hidden in shadows and their own silhouettes.', '2002-06-09 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68589, 2119, 387, '<td valign="top">Call me crazy, but where are you shooting snow this time of year?</td>', 'Call me crazy, but where are you shooting snow this time of year?', '2002-06-09 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68590, 2119, 1, '<td valign="top">I think the frozen river is a nice subject, but the dark background doesnt work at all in black/white.  try a different angle.</td>', 'I think the frozen river is a nice subject, but the dark background doesnt work at all in black/white.  try a different angle.', '2002-06-10 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68591, 2122, 1175, '<td valign="top">You saved this at a very low quality.  You have up to 150kb, use it.  As for the photo, maybe a tad bit tighter.  Also, black and white seems to be better with texture, old age, or something that is very quiet and silent.  I''m sure a child of this age is not. :)</td>', 'You saved this at a very low quality.  You have up to 150kb, use it.  As for the photo, maybe a tad bit tighter.  Also, black and white seems to be better with texture, old age, or something that is very quiet and silent.  I''m sure a child of this age is not. :)', '2002-06-03 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68592, 2122, 409, '<td valign="top">interesting angle</td>', 'interesting angle', '2002-06-03 08:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68593, 2122, 1455, '<td valign="top">weres the crispness in this photo?</td>', 'weres the crispness in this photo?', '2002-06-03 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68594, 2122, 203, '<td valign="top">Focus those snapshots.</td>', 'Focus those snapshots.', '2002-06-03 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68595, 2122, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice portait of a sweetie. Good b&amp;w. Well done.</td>', 'Nice portait of a sweetie. Good b&w. Well done.', '2002-06-03 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68596, 2122, 1897, '<td valign="top">Cute, but is looks slightly pixalated.</td>', 'Cute, but is looks slightly pixalated.', '2002-06-03 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68597, 2122, 368, '<td valign="top">i like the expression - very innocent looking - but the image itself is pixalated</td>', 'i like the expression - very innocent looking - but the image itself is pixalated', '2002-06-03 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68598, 2122, 1901, '<td valign="top">I particularly liked the look in the subject''s face. Natural and trusting. The centre of attention at the eyes which seem to be saying something to the viewer, what I cannot interpret that there is something special in the expression of love and trust of the photographer. The look away from the lens was especially inspired.</td>', 'I particularly liked the look in the subject''s face. Natural and trusting. The centre of attention at the eyes which seem to be saying something to the viewer, what I cannot interpret that there is something special in the expression of love and trust of the photographer. The look away from the lens was especially inspired.', '2002-06-04 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68599, 2122, 885, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Nice uncomplicated background for a portrait.  Nice catchlights in the eyes.</td>', 'Very cute.  Nice uncomplicated background for a portrait.  Nice catchlights in the eyes.', '2002-06-04 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68600, 2122, 637, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look dazed to me... perhaps that''s love (for the photographer) in her eyes</td>', 'She doesn''t look dazed to me... perhaps that''s love (for the photographer) in her eyes', '2002-06-05 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68601, 2122, 1446, '<td valign="top">The soft focus here doesn''t work for me .......sorry</td>', 'The soft focus here doesn''t work for me .......sorry', '2002-06-05 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68602, 2122, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think the best suggestion I can make would have to do with compression and file sizes.  I like what I can see in the pic, but the pixelation takes away from it.  The size of this file is about 1/4 the size allowed by the competition rules -- bigger file size means you can compress it less and have a cleaner picture.</td>', 'I think the best suggestion I can make would have to do with compression and file sizes.  I like what I can see in the pic, but the pixelation takes away from it.  The size of this file is about 1/4 the size allowed by the competition rules -- bigger file size means you can compress it less and have a cleaner picture.', '2002-06-05 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68603, 2122, 1041, '<td valign="top">Aussie, this is a really sweet photo, I love the way she looks up at the camera.  Not sure dazed is the way I''d describe the look on her face.  That file is still pretty small, is that due to your camera (I know you already got a lot of comments during the last challenge on that ...).  If you are compressing the file to that level and would like to know how to compress it less, check out the JPG compression 101 under the Learn section or send me an email.<br/>Last but not least, you shouldn''t really put comments that give your entry away on your other photos (your comment on your first entry).  It''s all supposed to be anonymous.  No points deducted though for this and the jpg compression.</td>', 'Aussie, this is a really sweet photo, I love the way she looks up at the camera.  Not sure dazed is the way I''d describe the look on her face.  That file is still pretty small, is that due to your camera (I know you already got a lot of comments during the last challenge on that ...).  If you are compressing the file to that level and would like to know how to compress it less, check out the JPG compression 101 under the Learn section or send me an email.Last but not least, you shouldn''t really put comments that give your entry away on your other photos (your comment on your first entry).  It''s all supposed to be anonymous.  No points deducted though for this and the jpg compression.', '2002-06-05 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68604, 2122, 772, '<td valign="top">I particularly like the angle and view on this photo... The black and white works nicely with the lighting in this shot... I don''t know if it''s the camera or if this photo has been enlarged from its original size but there is a little pixellation that is quite visible... It''s not a major flaw though... good work!</td>', 'I particularly like the angle and view on this photo... The black and white works nicely with the lighting in this shot... I don''t know if it''s the camera or if this photo has been enlarged from its original size but there is a little pixellation that is quite visible... It''s not a major flaw though... good work!', '2002-06-05 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68605, 2122, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting this comment a lot, but the photo is too compressed. It only uses 37 kb, when it could be using 150 kb. It''s a very fetching picture, I especially love her eyes.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting this comment a lot, but the photo is too compressed. It only uses 37 kb, when it could be using 150 kb. It''s a very fetching picture, I especially love her eyes.', '2002-06-06 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68606, 2122, 715, '<td valign="top">Cute and a nice angle. It looks like the image is enlarged though.</td>', 'Cute and a nice angle. It looks like the image is enlarged though.', '2002-06-09 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68607, 2122, 1, '<td valign="top">Very cute portrait, nice framing... the angle works too.</td>', 'Very cute portrait, nice framing... the angle works too.', '2002-06-09 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68608, 2122, 1897, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, and should not have been knocked down for the compression like it was.</td>', 'This is a great photo, and should not have been knocked down for the compression like it was.', '2002-06-10 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(68609, 2122, 1829, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments.  As this is my second entry, I am trying to get a grip on that "compression" stuff.  I am learning - slowly!!  But, I will hopefully one day produce a photo that is "Just right".   Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments.  As this is my second entry, I am trying to get a grip on that "compression" stuff.  I am learning - slowly!!  But, I will hopefully one day produce a photo that is "Just right".   Thanks again.', '2002-06-14 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(68610, 2123, 573, '<td valign="top">Another one that is too dark for my tastes, I want to see more detail in the building that tells me why it is so special.</td>', 'Another one that is too dark for my tastes, I want to see more detail in the building that tells me why it is so special.', '2002-06-03 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68611, 2123, 1211, '<td valign="top">It seems as though you are going for a silouhette effect, if so increased contrast would have helped.</td>', 'It seems as though you are going for a silouhette effect, if so increased contrast would have helped.', '2002-06-03 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68612, 2123, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot.</td>', 'Neat shot.', '2002-06-03 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68613, 2123, 441, '<td valign="top">this building looks like its creating its own weather sytem</td>', 'this building looks like its creating its own weather sytem', '2002-06-03 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68614, 2123, 1859, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  The creepy lighting immediately brings scary things like Stephen King to mind.  Although this building probably looks ultra-ordinary in daylight, the photo is all about the lighting and you did it wonderfully!  It makes me question whether I''d step inside or not!  Good job!</td>', 'Very cool!  The creepy lighting immediately brings scary things like Stephen King to mind.  Although this building probably looks ultra-ordinary in daylight, the photo is all about the lighting and you did it wonderfully!  It makes me question whether I''d step inside or not!  Good job!', '2002-06-03 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68615, 2123, 1313, '<td valign="top">Tower too dark.</td>', 'Tower too dark.', '2002-06-03 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68616, 2123, 1031, '<td valign="top">I hope you had Gandalf along with you for "protection" ...</td>', 'I hope you had Gandalf along with you for "protection" ...', '2002-06-04 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68617, 2123, 543, '<td valign="top">Glad there''s a little detail (windows) in that black.  The sky is nice and dramatic, almost as if the bldg is giving off steam or getting ready for ignition.  IMO, some positive gamma adjustment to bring the windows out just a little more (you could always punch up the blacks if they lose density), would make the big dark area a little more interesting.</td>', 'Glad there''s a little detail (windows) in that black.  The sky is nice and dramatic, almost as if the bldg is giving off steam or getting ready for ignition.  IMO, some positive gamma adjustment to bring the windows out just a little more (you could always punch up the blacks if they lose density), would make the big dark area a little more interesting.', '2002-06-04 04:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68618, 2123, 1997, '<td valign="top">Too dark a tower...</td>', 'Too dark a tower...', '2002-06-04 08:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68619, 2123, 885, '<td valign="top">Yes, it is dark...</td>', 'Yes, it is dark...', '2002-06-04 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68620, 2123, 661, '<td valign="top">Ominious.  but a little dark... I guess that was the effect you were looking for?</td>', 'Ominious.  but a little dark... I guess that was the effect you were looking for?', '2002-06-04 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68621, 2123, 772, '<td valign="top">Foreboding!  Nice shot!</td>', 'Foreboding!  Nice shot!', '2002-06-05 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68622, 2123, 811, '<td valign="top">Either a touch more exposed to show the details of the building more OR a touch less exposed to make it more of a sihouette would have made it more effective for me.</td>', 'Either a touch more exposed to show the details of the building more OR a touch less exposed to make it more of a sihouette would have made it more effective for me.', '2002-06-05 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68623, 2123, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the shape of the tower and the way it''s edged by clouds.</td>', 'I like the shape of the tower and the way it''s edged by clouds.', '2002-06-06 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68624, 2123, 1944, '<td valign="top">need better control of tonalities.</td>', 'need better control of tonalities.', '2002-06-06 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68625, 2123, 332, '<td valign="top">The Dark Tower is just too dark!</td>', 'The Dark Tower is just too dark!', '2002-06-08 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68626, 2123, 1993, '<td valign="top">I''m partial to monumental pieces...this is nice.  I like the contrast of gray to darker grey.  Might have liked a little more white clouds, but, hey, nature doesn''t always cooperate, does it?</td>', 'I''m partial to monumental pieces...this is nice.  I like the contrast of gray to darker grey.  Might have liked a little more white clouds, but, hey, nature doesn''t always cooperate, does it?', '2002-06-09 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68627, 2123, 715, '<td valign="top">I like it howyou captured  the clouds accentuating the shape of the the tower, but I think the darkness of the tower is dominating the picture too much. I woluld have liked it better with more sky on the right.</td>', 'I like it howyou captured  the clouds accentuating the shape of the the tower, but I think the darkness of the tower is dominating the picture too much. I woluld have liked it better with more sky on the right.', '2002-06-09 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68628, 2123, 656, '<td valign="top">contrast could be stretched a bit for this one - seems quite grey</td>', 'contrast could be stretched a bit for this one - seems quite grey', '2002-06-09 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68629, 2123, 1, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great shot -- the sun behind the building and clouds works AWESOME.  I think an auto-level work `nicen` up the building a bit.  This is one of my favorite, but I don''t execpt to see it in the top 10.  =/</td>', 'Wow.  Great shot -- the sun behind the building and clouds works AWESOME.  I think an auto-level work `nicen` up the building a bit.  This is one of my favorite, but I don''t execpt to see it in the top 10.  =/', '2002-06-10 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68630, 2125, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot but I think it needs a little more light to offer some better contrast :)</td>', 'This is a nice shot but I think it needs a little more light to offer some better contrast :)', '2002-06-03 07:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68631, 2125, 409, '<td valign="top">scary... i like this hovering mood of err... scariness.<br/><br/>maybe a bit more contrast?</td>', 'scary... i like this hovering mood of err... scariness.maybe a bit more contrast?', '2002-06-03 08:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68632, 2125, 327, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Good attempt. Little dark.</td>', 'Good idea. Good attempt. Little dark.', '2002-06-03 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68633, 2125, 661, '<td valign="top">Photo seems a little dark.  Nice cap!</td>', 'Photo seems a little dark.  Nice cap!', '2002-06-03 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68634, 2125, 1597, '<td valign="top">a bit dark around the face but good focus</td>', 'a bit dark around the face but good focus', '2002-06-03 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68635, 2125, 543, '<td valign="top">Good B/W (an all photography, really) is all about light, and the ugliest light known to man (except possibly flourescent)  is, for some reason, built into most cameras.  It''s very hard and directional, which flattens textures, and casts horrid shadows nine times out of ten.  The party headwrap would have me worried if this were my surgeon, unless I was 7.  For intensity, maybe you could zoom in on his eyes.</td>', 'Good B/W (an all photography, really) is all about light, and the ugliest light known to man (except possibly flourescent)  is, for some reason, built into most cameras.  It''s very hard and directional, which flattens textures, and casts horrid shadows nine times out of ten.  The party headwrap would have me worried if this were my surgeon, unless I was 7.  For intensity, maybe you could zoom in on his eyes.', '2002-06-04 04:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68636, 2125, 1, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop of his face is needed to show any intensity.  And perhaps shoot from a lower angle.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop of his face is needed to show any intensity.  And perhaps shoot from a lower angle.', '2002-06-04 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68637, 2125, 1882, '<td valign="top">it would have been more "intense" without the balloons on his surgical cap.</td>', 'it would have been more "intense" without the balloons on his surgical cap.', '2002-06-04 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68638, 2125, 587, '<td valign="top">Like the serious face with the hat - what is happening on his left shoulder? wish it was a tad brighter, but good job.</td>', 'Like the serious face with the hat - what is happening on his left shoulder? wish it was a tad brighter, but good job.', '2002-06-05 05:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68639, 2125, 1031, '<td valign="top">I want a pediatric OR cap with balloons printed on it (if that is what that is, that is)!<br/><br/>Having things a little brighter overall might help covey a more optimistic outcome (if that''s what you want to convey, of course).</td>', 'I want a pediatric OR cap with balloons printed on it (if that is what that is, that is)!Having things a little brighter overall might help covey a more optimistic outcome (if that''s what you want to convey, of course).', '2002-06-05 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68640, 2125, 1041, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait, with good title.  I think this photo could be improved further with some post processing to add some more contrast, it''s too much gray and gray for my liking at the moment.</td>', 'A nice portrait, with good title.  I think this photo could be improved further with some post processing to add some more contrast, it''s too much gray and gray for my liking at the moment.', '2002-06-07 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68641, 2125, 1005, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit dark, good focus, are we birthing?  What are we doing?  The suspense is killing me.  What is he intense about?<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 6 B&amp;W 7 total 7</td>', 'Maybe a bit dark, good focus, are we birthing?  What are we doing?  The suspense is killing me.  What is he intense about?Photo 8 Creativity 6 B&W 7 total 7', '2002-06-07 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68642, 2125, 1944, '<td valign="top">The picture doesn''t seem to illuminate the personality for me. Processing also too dull.</td>', 'The picture doesn''t seem to illuminate the personality for me. Processing also too dull.', '2002-06-08 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68643, 2125, 1897, '<td valign="top">underexposed flash shot with a compressed brightness range.  Every thing here is grey.</td>', 'underexposed flash shot with a compressed brightness range.  Every thing here is grey.', '2002-06-09 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68644, 2125, 1256, '<td valign="top">This photo is a little dark, otherwise a good shot.</td>', 'This photo is a little dark, otherwise a good shot.', '2002-06-09 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68645, 2126, 409, '<td valign="top">i like the degree of contrast</td>', 'i like the degree of contrast', '2002-06-03 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68646, 2126, 798, '<td valign="top">beautiful flowers but its green?!</td>', 'beautiful flowers but its green?!', '2002-06-03 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(68647, 2126, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.. I''m not sure if it''s me or the image but I beleive there is a green tint to this photo... I have looked at it on two different systems with the same results... anyway...  The composition is nice but i''m not quite impressed with the subject... it''s a little ''busy''...</td>', 'Interesting shot.. I''m not sure if it''s me or the image but I beleive there is a green tint to this photo... I have looked at it on two different systems with the same results... anyway...  The composition is nice but i''m not quite impressed with the subject... it''s a little ''busy''...', '2002-06-03 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68648, 2126, 1041, '<td valign="top">This seems to have a slight green tinge to it.  Is it just my monitor?  Good composition, used of ROT.  Something a little more to hold my interest would''ve been nice.</td>', 'This seems to have a slight green tinge to it.  Is it just my monitor?  Good composition, used of ROT.  Something a little more to hold my interest would''ve been nice.', '2002-06-03 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68649, 2126, 1175, '<td valign="top">Is your subject the flowers?  Why the wood thing in the front?  Why the shade of green?</td>', 'Is your subject the flowers?  Why the wood thing in the front?  Why the shade of green?', '2002-06-03 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68650, 2126, 1211, '<td valign="top">Perhaps you could have cropped out the ground at the bottom of the picture.</td>', 'Perhaps you could have cropped out the ground at the bottom of the picture.', '2002-06-03 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68651, 2126, 1296, '<td valign="top">not exactly black and white</td>', 'not exactly black and white', '2002-06-03 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68652, 2126, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. I like it. Nice job.</td>', 'Interesting photo. I like it. Nice job.', '2002-06-03 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68653, 2126, 1831, '<td valign="top">Carries a green tint compared to all the rest.(not B&amp;W)</td>', 'Carries a green tint compared to all the rest.(not B&W)', '2002-06-03 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68654, 2126, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast, just doesn''t grab me</td>', 'nice contrast, just doesn''t grab me', '2002-06-03 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68655, 2126, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. The composition seems a little bit clumsy to me.</td>', 'Interesting photo. The composition seems a little bit clumsy to me.', '2002-06-04 04:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68656, 2126, 368, '<td valign="top">is the image supposed to have the green tint? For a black and white challenge ... it''s not quite right ....</td>', 'is the image supposed to have the green tint? For a black and white challenge ... it''s not quite right ....', '2002-06-04 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68657, 2126, 313, '<td valign="top">pretty shot.  i wish it was a little lighter, though.</td>', 'pretty shot.  i wish it was a little lighter, though.', '2002-06-06 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68658, 2126, 1446, '<td valign="top">Interesting color- for a B&amp;W</td>', 'Interesting color- for a B&W', '2002-06-07 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68659, 2126, 1005, '<td valign="top">Why does this look green to me?</td>', 'Why does this look green to me?', '2002-06-07 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68660, 2126, 1897, '<td valign="top">Pure black and white would have been better, this looks like a blurry image that was sharpened.  great tone.</td>', 'Pure black and white would have been better, this looks like a blurry image that was sharpened.  great tone.', '2002-06-09 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68661, 2126, 255, '<td valign="top">this looks like it was done in duotone-- i found that if you go by gordon''s tutorial *but* lighten the green a few shades, it makes a more pleasing B&amp;W. But I do like the stark contrasts you have here!</td>', 'this looks like it was done in duotone-- i found that if you go by gordon''s tutorial *but* lighten the green a few shades, it makes a more pleasing B&W. But I do like the stark contrasts you have here!', '2002-06-09 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68662, 2126, 387, '<td valign="top">that''s a duotone, challenge was black and white</td>', 'that''s a duotone, challenge was black and white', '2002-06-09 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68663, 2126, 1, '<td valign="top">This doesnt seem like it''s black and white</td>', 'This doesnt seem like it''s black and white', '2002-06-10 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68664, 2127, 798, '<td valign="top">I like this picture. You have shiny eyes!</td>', 'I like this picture. You have shiny eyes!', '2002-06-03 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68665, 2127, 1897, '<td valign="top">Very pretty</td>', 'Very pretty', '2002-06-03 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68666, 2127, 1540, '<td valign="top">hey, you''re a real cutie !!    ... nice shot also</td>', 'hey, you''re a real cutie !!    ... nice shot also', '2002-06-03 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68667, 2127, 772, '<td valign="top">Great self portrait!  now this photo makes me want to know what color your eyes are :)  They look hazel maybe... am i right?  Kudos on a great photo!</td>', 'Great self portrait!  now this photo makes me want to know what color your eyes are :)  They look hazel maybe... am i right?  Kudos on a great photo!', '2002-06-03 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68668, 2127, 1944, '<td valign="top">good portrait. captures personality well. Good exposure.</td>', 'good portrait. captures personality well. Good exposure.', '2002-06-03 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68669, 2127, 1, '<td valign="top">Your eyes are very engaging, nice framing and composition -- the hair and hand is a nice touch.</td>', 'Your eyes are very engaging, nice framing and composition -- the hair and hand is a nice touch.', '2002-06-03 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68670, 2127, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice portait. Well done. Tones are just a little dark for my taste, but this is fine work and congrats to you on a job well done.</td>', 'Nice portait. Well done. Tones are just a little dark for my taste, but this is fine work and congrats to you on a job well done.', '2002-06-03 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68671, 2127, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice. I would have voted slightly higher if you balanced it more towards white. That way you''d have the black blacks, and the white whites. Excellent job!</td>', 'Nice. I would have voted slightly higher if you balanced it more towards white. That way you''d have the black blacks, and the white whites. Excellent job!', '2002-06-03 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68672, 2127, 117, '<td valign="top">it is in the eyes, is that a window reflection? nice shot</td>', 'it is in the eyes, is that a window reflection? nice shot', '2002-06-03 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68673, 2127, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice pose with just the right touch of softness. Good job. I do think you could tweak the levels a little bit brighter (using a histogram) and the large reflections in the eyes tends to mask them somewhat (IMO).</td>', 'Nice pose with just the right touch of softness. Good job. I do think you could tweak the levels a little bit brighter (using a histogram) and the large reflections in the eyes tends to mask them somewhat (IMO).', '2002-06-03 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68674, 2127, 1597, '<td valign="top">good overall shot</td>', 'good overall shot', '2002-06-03 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68675, 2127, 1336, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2002-06-04 01:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68676, 2127, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good job with a "difficult subject." I''m curious as to how you shot this (timer, manual, remote) an how much you had to crop the original frame (if you have time after the voting''s over).</td>', 'Good job with a "difficult subject." I''m curious as to how you shot this (timer, manual, remote) an how much you had to crop the original frame (if you have time after the voting''s over).', '2002-06-04 03:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68677, 2127, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo, but it seems self conscious. We''re always so hard on our own looks that self portraits often end up artifically emotionless. I''d rather see an expression of some kind.</td>', 'This is a very nice photo, but it seems self conscious. We''re always so hard on our own looks that self portraits often end up artifically emotionless. I''d rather see an expression of some kind.', '2002-06-04 04:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68678, 2127, 1831, '<td valign="top">Self portrait, WOW. Nice photo, pretty girl. good job:-)</td>', 'Self portrait, WOW. Nice photo, pretty girl. good job:-)', '2002-06-04 06:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68679, 2127, 885, '<td valign="top">You have windows in your eyes!  That is probably, though, why the light is so nice and soft and flattering.  I like the expression, and how you''ve filled the frame...I wonder though if I''d have preferred the hand on the other side of your face.  Good job.</td>', 'You have windows in your eyes!  That is probably, though, why the light is so nice and soft and flattering.  I like the expression, and how you''ve filled the frame...I wonder though if I''d have preferred the hand on the other side of your face.  Good job.', '2002-06-04 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68680, 2127, 637, '<td valign="top">Love the reflections in the eyes... Could do without the hand under the face.</td>', 'Love the reflections in the eyes... Could do without the hand under the face.', '2002-06-05 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68681, 2127, 1590, '<td valign="top">cute.</td>', 'cute.', '2002-06-05 05:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68682, 2127, 1569, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The only distraction is the catchlight in the eyes.A slight rotation --just enough to miss the window and this would be exceptional.</td>', 'Very nice. The only distraction is the catchlight in the eyes.A slight rotation --just enough to miss the window and this would be exceptional.', '2002-06-05 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68683, 2127, 543, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but needs some brightness.</td>', 'Very pretty, but needs some brightness.', '2002-06-05 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68684, 2127, 641, '<td valign="top">Great detail. Good shot</td>', 'Great detail. Good shot', '2002-06-05 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68685, 2127, 1658, '<td valign="top">Nice balance and contrast.</td>', 'Nice balance and contrast.', '2002-06-05 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68686, 2127, 2023, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!</td>', 'Very nice!!', '2002-06-05 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68687, 2127, 472, '<td valign="top">nice tones. esp eyes and lips.  looks like window light?</td>', 'nice tones. esp eyes and lips.  looks like window light?', '2002-06-07 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68688, 2127, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, Overall a good portrait.</td>', 'Nice focus, Overall a good portrait.', '2002-06-07 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68689, 2127, 875, '<td valign="top">Nice framing job - especially for a self-portrait.  The addition of the hand on the face adds a little visual interest.</td>', 'Nice framing job - especially for a self-portrait.  The addition of the hand on the face adds a little visual interest.', '2002-06-09 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68690, 2127, 2103, '<td valign="top">belle</td>', 'belle', '2002-06-09 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68691, 2127, 715, '<td valign="top">Fascinating self-portrait. I like the reflections in the eyes.</td>', 'Fascinating self-portrait. I like the reflections in the eyes.', '2002-06-09 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68692, 2127, 596, '<td valign="top">I used a remote to take this pic sitting in front of a window to get good lighting.  I probably took like 50 pics before i found one i liked.  I didn''t have to crop it too much other than to take out the background.</td>', 'I used a remote to take this pic sitting in front of a window to get good lighting.  I probably took like 50 pics before i found one i liked.  I didn''t have to crop it too much other than to take out the background.', '2002-06-10 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(68693, 2127, 596, '<td valign="top">I used a remote to take this pic sitting in front of a window to get good lighting.  I probably took like 50 pics before i found one i liked.  I didn''t have to crop it too much other than to take out the background.</td>', 'I used a remote to take this pic sitting in front of a window to get good lighting.  I probably took like 50 pics before i found one i liked.  I didn''t have to crop it too much other than to take out the background.', '2002-06-10 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(68694, 2128, 1122, '<td valign="top">HA~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~</td>', 'HA~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~', '2002-06-03 06:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68695, 2128, 573, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, composition acceptable, but I miss the bright highlights.</td>', 'Cute kid, composition acceptable, but I miss the bright highlights.', '2002-06-03 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68696, 2128, 1, '<td valign="top">Very cute and engaging.  Nice framing.</td>', 'Very cute and engaging.  Nice framing.', '2002-06-03 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68697, 2128, 327, '<td valign="top">Darling, well done b&amp;w. Good, good job. Nice tone.</td>', 'Darling, well done b&w. Good, good job. Nice tone.', '2002-06-03 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68698, 2128, 772, '<td valign="top">cute baby :) the gleam in the eye is a nice touch :)</td>', 'cute baby :) the gleam in the eye is a nice touch :)', '2002-06-03 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68699, 2128, 1759, '<td valign="top">Another great baby face, good shot! You might try a higher f/stop to get rid of the background or just use a backdrop. Overall this is a great shot and should score well.</td>', 'Another great baby face, good shot! You might try a higher f/stop to get rid of the background or just use a backdrop. Overall this is a great shot and should score well.', '2002-06-03 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68700, 2128, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good detail and composition.</td>', 'Good detail and composition.', '2002-06-04 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68701, 2128, 1037, '<td valign="top">Maybe I lack maternal instinct or something (yes, I''m female), but some baby photos just make me go "Eww, get it away from me!" This will probably change if I ever have one of my own, and it''s not your fault because the photo is nice.</td>', 'Maybe I lack maternal instinct or something (yes, I''m female), but some baby photos just make me go "Eww, get it away from me!" This will probably change if I ever have one of my own, and it''s not your fault because the photo is nice.', '2002-06-04 06:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68702, 2128, 811, '<td valign="top">I lvoe the expression.  The little corner of whatever it is attracts my attention more than I want it to.  If it was unavoidable to miss, so be it.  The lighting and focus if very well done.</td>', 'I lvoe the expression.  The little corner of whatever it is attracts my attention more than I want it to.  If it was unavoidable to miss, so be it.  The lighting and focus if very well done.', '2002-06-04 17:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68703, 2128, 258, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.</td>', 'Nice photo.', '2002-06-04 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68704, 2128, 1590, '<td valign="top">Not so much a smile, more a "HOW YA GOIN"...</td>', 'Not so much a smile, more a "HOW YA GOIN"...', '2002-06-05 05:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68705, 2128, 641, '<td valign="top">Good shot. You might try changing the depth of field to blur out the background maybe. I''ve been practicing this myself and it makes a good difference.</td>', 'Good shot. You might try changing the depth of field to blur out the background maybe. I''ve been practicing this myself and it makes a good difference.', '2002-06-05 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68706, 2128, 1031, '<td valign="top">"Remember, pretty soon my agent''s gonna start charging for these sessions!"<br/><br/>The (kid''s) left ear seems quite a bit lighter than the rest of the visible skin, but I didn''t really notice until I went back and looked again. I might adjust it if I was going to go back and print it.</td>', '"Remember, pretty soon my agent''s gonna start charging for these sessions!"The (kid''s) left ear seems quite a bit lighter than the rest of the visible skin, but I didn''t really notice until I went back and looked again. I might adjust it if I was going to go back and print it.', '2002-06-06 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
