(68793, 2131, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great shot and title.  Just a tad more even lighting would make the photo even better.  I''m no expert at lighting, but I believe the Classic Photo Course under the tutorials has some information on it.  Multiple light-sources or moving the light source (or in this case the chair since it looks as if you used natural light) may be options.</td>', 'Great shot and title.  Just a tad more even lighting would make the photo even better.  I''m no expert at lighting, but I believe the Classic Photo Course under the tutorials has some information on it.  Multiple light-sources or moving the light source (or in this case the chair since it looks as if you used natural light) may be options.', '2002-06-07 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68794, 2131, 1, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, framing is great</td>', 'Cute shot, framing is great', '2002-06-10 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68795, 2131, 1357, '<td valign="top">Considering my first entry was of Pierre Cardin Watch in Advertisment Challenge and scored over 5 points on average I thought this would do much better. I didn`t expect to win but an average vote of under average 4.779 is a complete shock. I expected to reach 5.000 or a little above. Cannot understand the 7 that voted this as a 1 or the 16 that voted a 2 as none of them seem to have given me any comments. Maybe it was to try and get their scores up a little. Hopefully I`ll get some comments from them now as to why they such poor votes on my entry. I don`t hold grudges on anyone and if I like the submissions I give good votes on them &amp; if I don`t i try to let them know why I didn`t like it.</td>', 'Considering my first entry was of Pierre Cardin Watch in Advertisment Challenge and scored over 5 points on average I thought this would do much better. I didn`t expect to win but an average vote of under average 4.779 is a complete shock. I expected to reach 5.000 or a little above. Cannot understand the 7 that voted this as a 1 or the 16 that voted a 2 as none of them seem to have given me any comments. Maybe it was to try and get their scores up a little. Hopefully I`ll get some comments from them now as to why they such poor votes on my entry. I don`t hold grudges on anyone and if I like the submissions I give good votes on them & if I don`t i try to let them know why I didn`t like it.', '2002-06-13 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(68796, 2132, 1485, '<td valign="top">GREAT GREAT composition.. EXCELLENT use of B&amp;W for contrast.  This picture is laid out very well and the the balance of light and dark is pure ART!  From darkest black to lightest white.    You truly did a great job.</td>', 'GREAT GREAT composition.. EXCELLENT use of B&W for contrast.  This picture is laid out very well and the the balance of light and dark is pure ART!  From darkest black to lightest white.    You truly did a great job.', '2002-06-03 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68797, 2132, 409, '<td valign="top">i love this texture</td>', 'i love this texture', '2002-06-03 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68798, 2132, 1455, '<td valign="top">Very grainy</td>', 'Very grainy', '2002-06-03 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68799, 2132, 1848, '<td valign="top">Just a little sharper and this would get a 10 from me. I like the grainy look. (I''m assuming you accomplished that without violating the rules) This is one instance where washed out highlights and featureless shadow work. Nice cropping as well. It works well. Good job.</td>', 'Just a little sharper and this would get a 10 from me. I like the grainy look. (I''m assuming you accomplished that without violating the rules) This is one instance where washed out highlights and featureless shadow work. Nice cropping as well. It works well. Good job.', '2002-06-03 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68800, 2132, 1211, '<td valign="top">Contrast is too high, whites out the face.</td>', 'Contrast is too high, whites out the face.', '2002-06-03 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68801, 2132, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice portait, good tone. Yes, I like this very much.</td>', 'Nice portait, good tone. Yes, I like this very much.', '2002-06-03 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68802, 2132, 138, '<td valign="top">I LOVE THIS!!!</td>', 'I LOVE THIS!!!', '2002-06-03 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68803, 2132, 1379, '<td valign="top">Nice profile.  The graininess (at least on my computer) seems to detract from the overall appeal, though.</td>', 'Nice profile.  The graininess (at least on my computer) seems to detract from the overall appeal, though.', '2002-06-03 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68804, 2132, 1037, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this high contrast, grainy black and white. It''s a relief from all the other photos I''ve rated so far. The way it brings out her eyelashes, lips, etc. is really nice. Well done.</td>', 'I LOVE this high contrast, grainy black and white. It''s a relief from all the other photos I''ve rated so far. The way it brings out her eyelashes, lips, etc. is really nice. Well done.', '2002-06-04 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68805, 2132, 1897, '<td valign="top">Good pose, but too high contrast and grainy for my taste in portraits.</td>', 'Good pose, but too high contrast and grainy for my taste in portraits.', '2002-06-04 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68806, 2132, 641, '<td valign="top">I can already hear the tons of comments about the grain. But I''m gonna just say I like this. Don''t listen to them.</td>', 'I can already hear the tons of comments about the grain. But I''m gonna just say I like this. Don''t listen to them.', '2002-06-04 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68807, 2132, 1750, '<td valign="top">Beautiful grainy almost infrared appearance. Solid division between dark (back of head) and light (face) areas of the subject.</td>', 'Beautiful grainy almost infrared appearance. Solid division between dark (back of head) and light (face) areas of the subject.', '2002-06-04 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68808, 2132, 554, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2002-06-04 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68809, 2132, 1569, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and grain---exellent.</td>', 'Great contrast and grain---exellent.', '2002-06-05 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68810, 2132, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting... this is an excellent composition... The lighting is great and the grain is very nice too... good job!</td>', 'interesting... this is an excellent composition... The lighting is great and the grain is very nice too... good job!', '2002-06-05 00:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68811, 2132, 587, '<td valign="top">Obviously the contrast and grain are intended, but I just don''t find this appealing, like around her neck, the black hair blends in with folds - or is it just hair? (sorry)</td>', 'Obviously the contrast and grain are intended, but I just don''t find this appealing, like around her neck, the black hair blends in with folds - or is it just hair? (sorry)', '2002-06-05 05:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68812, 2132, 1590, '<td valign="top">Almost lith film like quality. Nice work.</td>', 'Almost lith film like quality. Nice work.', '2002-06-05 05:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68813, 2132, 543, '<td valign="top">I love the grain in the L bg.  Not as wild about it on her face.  The high contrast is good for defining the line of her profile (possibly better w/o the hand), but I''d prefer it smoothed out just a bit.  Very worth looking at.  Thanks!</td>', 'I love the grain in the L bg.  Not as wild about it on her face.  The high contrast is good for defining the line of her profile (possibly better w/o the hand), but I''d prefer it smoothed out just a bit.  Very worth looking at.  Thanks!', '2002-06-05 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68814, 2132, 208, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - I like the effect.</td>', 'Nice shot - I like the effect.', '2002-06-05 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68815, 2132, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the grainyness, and the hair across her neck.  Actualy, I think I''d have liked to see a bit more detail in the hair, though the lost detail in the face doesn''t bother me so much.</td>', 'I like the grainyness, and the hair across her neck.  Actualy, I think I''d have liked to see a bit more detail in the hair, though the lost detail in the face doesn''t bother me so much.', '2002-06-05 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68816, 2132, 1446, '<td valign="top">Dark and grainy, but I think you planned it this way.  One of the better people shots in this weeks challenge.  The contrast is very good. I like the focus. Lots of texture and the background is interesting.  Very artsey IMO.  I like it.  A 7.</td>', 'Dark and grainy, but I think you planned it this way.  One of the better people shots in this weeks challenge.  The contrast is very good. I like the focus. Lots of texture and the background is interesting.  Very artsey IMO.  I like it.  A 7.', '2002-06-05 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68817, 2132, 854, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh on the face. Also the picture is way too grainy.</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh on the face. Also the picture is way too grainy.', '2002-06-05 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68818, 2132, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like your idea of doing a kind of "reverse silhouette." Conveys a lot of "information without much "data."</td>', 'I like your idea of doing a kind of "reverse silhouette." Conveys a lot of "information without much "data."', '2002-06-06 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68819, 2132, 472, '<td valign="top">looks kind of like bjork. the grain adds a filmic quality that i appreciate.</td>', 'looks kind of like bjork. the grain adds a filmic quality that i appreciate.', '2002-06-06 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68820, 2132, 806, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of B&amp;W!</td>', 'Awesome use of B&W!', '2002-06-06 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68821, 2132, 1908, '<td valign="top">good creativity</td>', 'good creativity', '2002-06-07 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68822, 2132, 1944, '<td valign="top">An interesting technique, but used on the wrong subject.</td>', 'An interesting technique, but used on the wrong subject.', '2002-06-08 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68823, 2132, 875, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty feel to this portrait as well as the composition.  The divisions of dark hair, light face, and midtone background works well.</td>', 'I like the gritty feel to this portrait as well as the composition.  The divisions of dark hair, light face, and midtone background works well.', '2002-06-09 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68824, 2132, 1, '<td valign="top">The grain works very well is this shot.  Her hair coming around her neck adds a nice touch, as does the expression on her face.</td>', 'The grain works very well is this shot.  Her hair coming around her neck adds a nice touch, as does the expression on her face.', '2002-06-09 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68825, 2132, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and compostion of this picture. But because the model is looking at something at the right side  I think she should have been positioned more to the left. This would have minimized the dominating black hair as well. Just because of that I give it a 9 instead of a 10</td>', 'I like the contrast and compostion of this picture. But because the model is looking at something at the right side  I think she should have been positioned more to the left. This would have minimized the dominating black hair as well. Just because of that I give it a 9 instead of a 10', '2002-06-09 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68826, 2132, 656, '<td valign="top">like the over exposed look - works well for this.  Too much black on the left ? but balances well with the white and grey regions.  Good shot.  Maybe a bit too grainy ?</td>', 'like the over exposed look - works well for this.  Too much black on the left ? but balances well with the white and grey regions.  Good shot.  Maybe a bit too grainy ?', '2002-06-09 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68827, 2132, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if you got hammered for what I''m guessing is taking your levels to some extremes.  I like the look and think it works really well.  (When the image was only half loaded, it made me think of a Geisha girl -- or maybe a publicity shot from something like The Mikado.)  It might defeat the ideas you were going for when you shot, but I wonder what kind of mood this would have if she were further to the left.  Right now, she feels too close to the right edge -- totally a personal taste thing.</td>', 'I''m wondering if you got hammered for what I''m guessing is taking your levels to some extremes.  I like the look and think it works really well.  (When the image was only half loaded, it made me think of a Geisha girl -- or maybe a publicity shot from something like The Mikado.)  It might defeat the ideas you were going for when you shot, but I wonder what kind of mood this would have if she were further to the left.  Right now, she feels too close to the right edge -- totally a personal taste thing.', '2002-06-09 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68828, 2132, 2, '<td valign="top">"Or like some people say, just gives me crappy results. :-)"  ... hehehehe..  I personally like the photo very much.</td>', '"Or like some people say, just gives me crappy results. :-)"  ... hehehehe..  I personally like the photo very much.', '2002-07-08 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(68829, 2133, 674, '<td valign="top">oversharpened and a bit to dark ont he right hand side</td>', 'oversharpened and a bit to dark ont he right hand side', '2002-06-03 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68830, 2133, 1455, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. makes me want to go to the beach......</td>', 'Beautiful shot. makes me want to go to the beach......', '2002-06-03 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68831, 2133, 1944, '<td valign="top">if the horizion was level I''d give it a 8, however...</td>', 'if the horizion was level I''d give it a 8, however...', '2002-06-03 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68832, 2133, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems over sharpened, the water is very rigid, and the man&amp;dog get lost in the sand.</td>', 'Seems over sharpened, the water is very rigid, and the man&dog get lost in the sand.', '2002-06-03 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68833, 2133, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. Good job.</td>', 'Neat shot. Good job.', '2002-06-03 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68834, 2133, 441, '<td valign="top">you''ve only used 78Kb - 50%over-compressed</td>', 'you''ve only used 78Kb - 50%over-compressed', '2002-06-03 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68835, 2133, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the picture dividing into 3 zones: shadow detail, highlight details, and no detail. I''d like to run it through a bunch of blurring filters and see how it would look asthe basis for an "abstract" piece...</td>', 'I like the effect of the picture dividing into 3 zones: shadow detail, highlight details, and no detail. I''d like to run it through a bunch of blurring filters and see how it would look asthe basis for an "abstract" piece...', '2002-06-04 02:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68836, 2133, 1041, '<td valign="top">Personally, I feel that beaches often work better in color than b&amp;w.  The people on the beach could be subjects int he photo, but they are too much the same shade as the sand.  Also, the horizon seems a little tilted.</td>', 'Personally, I feel that beaches often work better in color than b&w.  The people on the beach could be subjects int he photo, but they are too much the same shade as the sand.  Also, the horizon seems a little tilted.', '2002-06-04 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68837, 2133, 811, '<td valign="top">This picture is almost too sharp, and a little too bright in the water..  I do like the way you have gotten the curved motion of the water, and how it contrasts with the straightness of the pier.</td>', 'This picture is almost too sharp, and a little too bright in the water..  I do like the way you have gotten the curved motion of the water, and how it contrasts with the straightness of the pier.', '2002-06-04 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68838, 2133, 1336, '<td valign="top">this image is only 78k and the low quality is very evident in the sky.  i''d recommend taking the picture in the highest quality that your camera will allow and then using photoshop to resize to 640x480 and the highest quality possible under 150k.</td>', 'this image is only 78k and the low quality is very evident in the sky.  i''d recommend taking the picture in the highest quality that your camera will allow and then using photoshop to resize to 640x480 and the highest quality possible under 150k.', '2002-06-04 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68839, 2133, 1446, '<td valign="top">Pretty good composition.  The horizon being straight would have made this a little better I think.</td>', 'Pretty good composition.  The horizon being straight would have made this a little better I think.', '2002-06-04 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68840, 2133, 543, '<td valign="top">The water is beautiful, but the sand and buildings are a bit too dark.</td>', 'The water is beautiful, but the sand and buildings are a bit too dark.', '2002-06-05 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68841, 2133, 772, '<td valign="top">The view on this photo is excellent... It looks like the sun may be in front of you and that probably shortened up your shutter speed.. The shorter shutter speed caused the darker areas in your photo (the beach and the people on it) to become under exposed...</td>', 'The view on this photo is excellent... It looks like the sun may be in front of you and that probably shortened up your shutter speed.. The shorter shutter speed caused the darker areas in your photo (the beach and the people on it) to become under exposed...', '2002-06-05 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68842, 2133, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the sun''s reflection off the water, very nice.  (I know they couldn''t be helped, but I don''t like the people on the sand; a distraction, but hardly visible.)  Your horizon has some "ripples" that are barely visible (yes, a REAL NIT), could have been caused by many things, like overblown up, too much digital sharpening, etc.  I''m not going to grade you down for these really insignificant items, just thought you might want to know.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 6 B&amp;W 8 total 7</td>', 'I like the sun''s reflection off the water, very nice.  (I know they couldn''t be helped, but I don''t like the people on the sand; a distraction, but hardly visible.)  Your horizon has some "ripples" that are barely visible (yes, a REAL NIT), could have been caused by many things, like overblown up, too much digital sharpening, etc.  I''m not going to grade you down for these really insignificant items, just thought you might want to know.Photo 9 Creativity 6 B&W 8 total 7', '2002-06-07 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68843, 2133, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast</td>', 'nice contrast', '2002-06-08 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68844, 2133, 587, '<td valign="top">I''m torn on this one, can''t decide if I like it in b&amp;w or  not.  I like the light bouncing off the water, but wish to see the blueness of the water - ah well, can''t have everything ;) good job.</td>', 'I''m torn on this one, can''t decide if I like it in b&w or  not.  I like the light bouncing off the water, but wish to see the blueness of the water - ah well, can''t have everything ;) good job.', '2002-06-08 21:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68845, 2133, 2093, '<td valign="top">too much compression here. but I like the reflections off the water.</td>', 'too much compression here. but I like the reflections off the water.', '2002-06-09 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68846, 2133, 2060, '<td valign="top">Needed a little more work before submitting. The horizon''s not straight and a little cropped off the top &amp; bottom, otherwise a pretty go shot.</td>', 'Needed a little more work before submitting. The horizon''s not straight and a little cropped off the top & bottom, otherwise a pretty go shot.', '2002-06-09 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(68847, 2133, 2103, '<td valign="top">where everyone walked is interesting. wierd seeing it in black &amp; white but nice new perspective on it</td>', 'where everyone walked is interesting. wierd seeing it in black & white but nice new perspective on it', '2002-06-09 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68848, 2133, 656, '<td valign="top">too much dull sky in this really.  The reflections on the water could have been used more strongly if you isolated some elements better</td>', 'too much dull sky in this really.  The reflections on the water could have been used more strongly if you isolated some elements better', '2002-06-09 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68849, 2134, 1863, '<td valign="top">I wish a little more light had fallen on the tulip, then it would be perfect. -Annida</td>', 'I wish a little more light had fallen on the tulip, then it would be perfect. -Annida', '2002-06-03 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68850, 2134, 1908, '<td valign="top">great macro shoot , terrific use of DOF, the back ligthing is great</td>', 'great macro shoot , terrific use of DOF, the back ligthing is great', '2002-06-03 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68851, 2134, 1, '<td valign="top">Much of the image is dark and no visible, I would try lightening it up or cropping it out.  I think there''s too much of a shadow inside your subject (flower) as well.</td>', 'Much of the image is dark and no visible, I would try lightening it up or cropping it out.  I think there''s too much of a shadow inside your subject (flower) as well.', '2002-06-03 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68852, 2134, 616, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2002-06-03 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68853, 2134, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w. Good lighting. Job well done.</td>', 'Neat b&w. Good lighting. Job well done.', '2002-06-03 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68854, 2134, 1009, '<td valign="top">Classic black and white... good job.</td>', 'Classic black and white... good job.', '2002-06-03 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68855, 2134, 1211, '<td valign="top">nice shot, great lighting.</td>', 'nice shot, great lighting.', '2002-06-03 19:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68856, 2134, 1759, '<td valign="top">Lovely! This demonstrates what can be done with B&amp;W. Good lighting</td>', 'Lovely! This demonstrates what can be done with B&W. Good lighting', '2002-06-03 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68857, 2134, 671, '<td valign="top">nice lighting.</td>', 'nice lighting.', '2002-06-03 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68858, 2134, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good lighting with contrasts, detail, almost transparency.  Good work with a flower, usually more suitable for color.</td>', 'Good lighting with contrasts, detail, almost transparency.  Good work with a flower, usually more suitable for color.', '2002-06-04 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68859, 2134, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice use of black and white to bring out the exotic curves and undulations of this flower. Faultless, to me :) 10!</td>', 'Very, very nice use of black and white to bring out the exotic curves and undulations of this flower. Faultless, to me :) 10!', '2002-06-04 04:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68860, 2134, 1031, '<td valign="top">Fine job holding detail across a wide tone range.</td>', 'Fine job holding detail across a wide tone range.', '2002-06-04 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68861, 2134, 885, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  I like the use of the white flower.</td>', 'Pretty.  I like the use of the white flower.', '2002-06-04 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68862, 2134, 587, '<td valign="top">good detail, like how the petals seem to glow. good job.</td>', 'good detail, like how the petals seem to glow. good job.', '2002-06-04 23:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68863, 2134, 772, '<td valign="top">extremely nice lighting on this photo... good work!</td>', 'extremely nice lighting on this photo... good work!', '2002-06-05 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68864, 2134, 543, '<td valign="top">Very nice tonal range.  The light in front of and behing the flower is a bit of a negative, IMO.  There''s enough going on in the flower to not need the stem and leaf bits.</td>', 'Very nice tonal range.  The light in front of and behing the flower is a bit of a negative, IMO.  There''s enough going on in the flower to not need the stem and leaf bits.', '2002-06-05 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68865, 2134, 1528, '<td valign="top">nice lighting<br/>the the left and bottom are a bit distracting</td>', 'nice lightingthe the left and bottom are a bit distracting', '2002-06-05 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68866, 2134, 1750, '<td valign="top">I love the delicate/pristine feel to this photo. You''ve done a good job of capturing the various shapes and textures.</td>', 'I love the delicate/pristine feel to this photo. You''ve done a good job of capturing the various shapes and textures.', '2002-06-05 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68867, 2134, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is one flower photo that does look good in black and white because there is enough texture to pull it off.  Well done.</td>', 'This is one flower photo that does look good in black and white because there is enough texture to pull it off.  Well done.', '2002-06-05 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68868, 2134, 472, '<td valign="top">the lighting on this is just exquisite.</td>', 'the lighting on this is just exquisite.', '2002-06-06 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68869, 2134, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-06-08 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68870, 2134, 2010, '<td valign="top">No fealings in this pic !</td>', 'No fealings in this pic !', '2002-06-09 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68871, 2134, 656, '<td valign="top">great subject, not sure the light is quite right though.</td>', 'great subject, not sure the light is quite right though.', '2002-06-09 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68872, 2134, 472, '<td valign="top">cant belive this didnt place higher.  one of the best lit flower shots : )</td>', 'cant belive this didnt place higher.  one of the best lit flower shots : )', '2002-06-10 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(68873, 2137, 409, '<td valign="top">i love this composition.<br/>evokes a sense of decay</td>', 'i love this composition.evokes a sense of decay', '2002-06-03 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68874, 2137, 1037, '<td valign="top">I feel as though the propellor and chain are great subjects for a photo, but the castrol cans and fence do nothing but compete with them for attention.</td>', 'I feel as though the propellor and chain are great subjects for a photo, but the castrol cans and fence do nothing but compete with them for attention.', '2002-06-03 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68875, 2137, 772, '<td valign="top">This subject id definitely photo-worthy!  I don''t particularly care for the castrol buckets in the background though...  if i was making this photo, i would have made some feeble attempt to move those out of the way..  A little closer and a litlte tighter crop on this shot would have been a nice improvement as well :)  Good job!</td>', 'This subject id definitely photo-worthy!  I don''t particularly care for the castrol buckets in the background though...  if i was making this photo, i would have made some feeble attempt to move those out of the way..  A little closer and a litlte tighter crop on this shot would have been a nice improvement as well :)  Good job!', '2002-06-03 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68876, 2137, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool... I like the style</td>', 'Cool... I like the style', '2002-06-03 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68877, 2137, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w. Good job cool industrial shot.</td>', 'Neat b&w. Good job cool industrial shot.', '2002-06-03 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68878, 2137, 441, '<td valign="top">would have liked that prop closer - nice textures.</td>', 'would have liked that prop closer - nice textures.', '2002-06-03 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68879, 2137, 543, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if you''d gotten in close to the propeller and bit of chain, you''d have found an interesting image.  Looks like there were some nice, long shadows you could have capitalized on, and certainly some great texture in the rusting metal and weathered concrete.  The shipping container, oil barrels and bit of cable at top detract from a possibly interesting piece of work.</td>', 'Perhaps if you''d gotten in close to the propeller and bit of chain, you''d have found an interesting image.  Looks like there were some nice, long shadows you could have capitalized on, and certainly some great texture in the rusting metal and weathered concrete.  The shipping container, oil barrels and bit of cable at top detract from a possibly interesting piece of work.', '2002-06-04 03:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68880, 2137, 1, '<td valign="top">This could be an awesome shot without the buckets.  The anchor and propeller look awesome and take you somewhere not normally ventured, but the everyday paint buckets bring you back to reality and don''t give the shot the uniqueness it deserves.</td>', 'This could be an awesome shot without the buckets.  The anchor and propeller look awesome and take you somewhere not normally ventured, but the everyday paint buckets bring you back to reality and don''t give the shot the uniqueness it deserves.', '2002-06-04 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68881, 2137, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good capture, focus, etc.  Some really good contrast and shadows.  Nit - looks natural, but junky, hard to get excited about this subject.<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 7 B&amp;W 8 total 8</td>', 'Good capture, focus, etc.  Some really good contrast and shadows.  Nit - looks natural, but junky, hard to get excited about this subject.Photo 10 Creativity 7 B&W 8 total 8', '2002-06-04 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68882, 2137, 1750, '<td valign="top">Although I don''t care for the subject matter your photograph is technically perfect.<br/>You followed the rule of thirds well. Your focus is dead on. Your zones are there. You included some great shadows and textures. You used shape very well.</td>', 'Although I don''t care for the subject matter your photograph is technically perfect.You followed the rule of thirds well. Your focus is dead on. Your zones are there. You included some great shadows and textures. You used shape very well.', '2002-06-05 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68883, 2137, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and focus.  The horizontal ''cut'' across the entire photo is very distracting to me.</td>', 'Nice contrast and focus.  The horizontal ''cut'' across the entire photo is very distracting to me.', '2002-06-06 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68884, 2137, 1944, '<td valign="top">Sharp,  good contrast and tonality.</td>', 'Sharp,  good contrast and tonality.', '2002-06-08 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68885, 2137, 1993, '<td valign="top">This is what B&amp;W photography is all about...I think.  I like this a lot.</td>', 'This is what B&W photography is all about...I think.  I like this a lot.', '2002-06-09 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68886, 2137, 656, '<td valign="top">a bit busy - maybe could have isolated one feature ?  Maybe even just the chain ? or some of the prop</td>', 'a bit busy - maybe could have isolated one feature ?  Maybe even just the chain ? or some of the prop', '2002-06-09 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68887, 2137, 1897, '<td valign="top">not really sure what the subject is, but nice contrast</td>', 'not really sure what the subject is, but nice contrast', '2002-06-09 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68888, 2138, 409, '<td valign="top">i LOVE this mood.. resting yet restless<br/>maybe a bit less contrast on the thumb<br/>warm</td>', 'i LOVE this mood.. resting yet restlessmaybe a bit less contrast on the thumbwarm', '2002-06-03 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68889, 2138, 1, '<td valign="top">Could use some lighting work, the slight hint of light on the hand doesn''t work very well.  I think in this case, you need all or none.  The bright light in the background doesnt help to draw viewers into the main subject.</td>', 'Could use some lighting work, the slight hint of light on the hand doesn''t work very well.  I think in this case, you need all or none.  The bright light in the background doesnt help to draw viewers into the main subject.', '2002-06-03 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68890, 2138, 1211, '<td valign="top">I think you have a good idea here, but I think the left part of the photo is too busy and distracts from the subject.  A tighter cropping would have been better.</td>', 'I think you have a good idea here, but I think the left part of the photo is too busy and distracts from the subject.  A tighter cropping would have been better.', '2002-06-03 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68891, 2138, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w --little over exposed on the thumb. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Neat b&w --little over exposed on the thumb. Interesting shot.', '2002-06-03 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68892, 2138, 1009, '<td valign="top">Great mood to this picture..</td>', 'Great mood to this picture..', '2002-06-03 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68893, 2138, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate title and subject, but the harsh lighting (blown out highlights) and unrelated distractions on the left detract from this shot. Perhaps a backdrop would be more nuetral. Fill flash might help give a more even lighting.</td>', 'Very appropriate title and subject, but the harsh lighting (blown out highlights) and unrelated distractions on the left detract from this shot. Perhaps a backdrop would be more nuetral. Fill flash might help give a more even lighting.', '2002-06-03 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68894, 2138, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... I almost want to see a really tight crop of just the hands on this one... good job!</td>', 'Nice shot... I almost want to see a really tight crop of just the hands on this one... good job!', '2002-06-03 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68895, 2138, 1880, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter ...</td>', 'Good subject matter ...', '2002-06-04 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68896, 2138, 1175, '<td valign="top">A little closer on the hands.  You''ve got too much going all the way around the photo that detracts from your subject.</td>', 'A little closer on the hands.  You''ve got too much going all the way around the photo that detracts from your subject.', '2002-06-04 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68897, 2138, 1882, '<td valign="top">More like wrinkled hands....</td>', 'More like wrinkled hands....', '2002-06-04 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68898, 2138, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the repeating plaid motif</td>', 'I like the repeating plaid motif', '2002-06-04 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68899, 2138, 554, '<td valign="top">wonderful------10</td>', 'wonderful------10', '2002-06-04 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68900, 2138, 587, '<td valign="top">interesting title :) would like to see the ''cloth'' up close, without other person in shot and without shadows. I like the concept though. good job.</td>', 'interesting title :) would like to see the ''cloth'' up close, without other person in shot and without shadows. I like the concept though. good job.', '2002-06-05 05:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68901, 2138, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but very stark sunlight with shadows that cut the hands into pieces. It destracts a bit from your subject.</td>', 'Nice idea, but very stark sunlight with shadows that cut the hands into pieces. It destracts a bit from your subject.', '2002-06-06 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
