(68916, 2139, 587, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you brought the spikes into the title but it''s the big leaf that takes my attention. I wish I could see this from the bottom up angle, so it looks like it''s 3 feet tall. I do like the clarity and how you cropped it. Good job.</td>', 'Interesting that you brought the spikes into the title but it''s the big leaf that takes my attention. I wish I could see this from the bottom up angle, so it looks like it''s 3 feet tall. I do like the clarity and how you cropped it. Good job.', '2002-06-04 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68917, 2139, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice compositon... what is it?</td>', 'Nice compositon... what is it?', '2002-06-05 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68918, 2139, 543, '<td valign="top">You might have isolated the spiky bits to greater effect.  Big leaf is oof, and others at bottom don''t add much.  Nice tones, though slightly dark in the shadows.</td>', 'You might have isolated the spiky bits to greater effect.  Big leaf is oof, and others at bottom don''t add much.  Nice tones, though slightly dark in the shadows.', '2002-06-05 01:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68919, 2139, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and shadows on this.  I gave it a 9.  The larger pedal in the front was a little bit distracting, and the only thing IMO that kept this from being a perfect photograph.</td>', 'Great lighting and shadows on this.  I gave it a 9.  The larger pedal in the front was a little bit distracting, and the only thing IMO that kept this from being a perfect photograph.', '2002-06-05 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68920, 2139, 1, '<td valign="top">The huge leaf/blooming thing in the front is horribly distracting from your spiked beauties -- try a different angle</td>', 'The huge leaf/blooming thing in the front is horribly distracting from your spiked beauties -- try a different angle', '2002-06-05 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68921, 2139, 1750, '<td valign="top">Like the shape, form , and focus in your picture.</td>', 'Like the shape, form , and focus in your picture.', '2002-06-05 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68922, 2139, 917, '<td valign="top">Background not completely black, so only an 8.</td>', 'Background not completely black, so only an 8.', '2002-06-07 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68923, 2139, 1005, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  I like the black background very much, limits the distraction from the subject.  I will bet this is very pretty in color.  I am not certain that the leaf in the foreground is a good thing, picky, picky.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 B&amp;W 9 total 9</td>', 'Beautifully done.  I like the black background very much, limits the distraction from the subject.  I will bet this is very pretty in color.  I am not certain that the leaf in the foreground is a good thing, picky, picky.Photo 9 Creativity 8 B&W 9 total 9', '2002-06-07 16:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68924, 2141, 1908, '<td valign="top">wheres the sky is to bright and that tree is distracting</td>', 'wheres the sky is to bright and that tree is distracting', '2002-06-03 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68925, 2141, 798, '<td valign="top">Nice job</td>', 'Nice job', '2002-06-03 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
