(68938, 2141, 543, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject for B/W, and nicely composed, but another day or time of day when you could have avoided the burnt out sky would be better.  Tough when there''s only a week.</td>', 'Wonderful subject for B/W, and nicely composed, but another day or time of day when you could have avoided the burnt out sky would be better.  Tough when there''s only a week.', '2002-06-09 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
