(68949, 2142, 543, '<td valign="top">Closer.  The faces and toast are all that''s really necessary in this image.  The rest is just distractions.</td>', 'Closer.  The faces and toast are all that''s really necessary in this image.  The rest is just distractions.', '2002-06-04 04:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68950, 2142, 641, '<td valign="top">If you cut off the top to just above their heads and get that line out of the shot I think it would be a little better.</td>', 'If you cut off the top to just above their heads and get that line out of the shot I think it would be a little better.', '2002-06-04 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68951, 2142, 1590, '<td valign="top">Nice family moment.  I like the use of space.</td>', 'Nice family moment.  I like the use of space.', '2002-06-05 05:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68952, 2142, 587, '<td valign="top">IMO this would be better if cropped and just the child - the wall, rope(?) p&amp;j jars on table are too distracting, just the child eating that toast would have been a great photo! what a cutie.</td>', 'IMO this would be better if cropped and just the child - the wall, rope(?) p&j jars on table are too distracting, just the child eating that toast would have been a great photo! what a cutie.', '2002-06-05 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68953, 2142, 1446, '<td valign="top">Cute baby, oof picture.</td>', 'Cute baby, oof picture.', '2002-06-05 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68954, 2142, 1041, '<td valign="top">Love the angle and the look on Mum''s and baby''s face.  I''m torn between the format, I''m not sure whether the vertical works or whether I''d prefer a landscape format just with the lower half of the picture.  In any case, the hook in the wall and the pull-thingy from the shutters is distracting.  Also, the image is a tad soft for my liking (unless you were going for that) and could do with just a little more contrast in my opinion.  I did an experiment this week by posting reedits (hope you don''t mind).  Let me know what you think.<br/><br/>//www.pbase.com/image/2377564</td>', 'Love the angle and the look on Mum''s and baby''s face.  I''m torn between the format, I''m not sure whether the vertical works or whether I''d prefer a landscape format just with the lower half of the picture.  In any case, the hook in the wall and the pull-thingy from the shutters is distracting.  Also, the image is a tad soft for my liking (unless you were going for that) and could do with just a little more contrast in my opinion.  I did an experiment this week by posting reedits (hope you don''t mind).  Let me know what you think.//www.pbase.com/image/2377564', '2002-06-05 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68955, 2142, 1024, '<td valign="top">This falls into the shapshot category for me, not because of the subject but because of the softness of the focus and the distracting elements such as the cord hanging down the wall</td>', 'This falls into the shapshot category for me, not because of the subject but because of the softness of the focus and the distracting elements such as the cord hanging down the wall', '2002-06-05 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(68956, 2142, 1750, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have cropped this pic below the picture holder on the wall andjust to the right of the cup with the heart. Also added more light.</td>', 'Personally I would have cropped this pic below the picture holder on the wall andjust to the right of the cup with the heart. Also added more light.', '2002-06-05 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
