(68980, 2145, 1037, '<td valign="top">To me this is very sexual, a bit like the shiva linga from Hinduism that combines symbols of male and female genitals. However, it also unites something organic with something that appears artificial, although both things have their own geometric beauty. It''s a very strong, symbolic photo. Well done :)</td>', 'To me this is very sexual, a bit like the shiva linga from Hinduism that combines symbols of male and female genitals. However, it also unites something organic with something that appears artificial, although both things have their own geometric beauty. It''s a very strong, symbolic photo. Well done :)', '2002-06-03 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
