(68991, 2145, 1569, '<td valign="top">It seems that the marble is in focus but the shell is out of the field of focus. Inching a tripod back and forth and taking a shot avery few cm. would have given you at least one where everything is in focus--front to back and top to bottom.</td>', 'It seems that the marble is in focus but the shell is out of the field of focus. Inching a tripod back and forth and taking a shot avery few cm. would have given you at least one where everything is in focus--front to back and top to bottom.', '2002-06-05 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
