(69013, 2147, 854, '<td valign="top">I think that this would be a great shot even if not in B&amp;W.  I like the picture, but I think that a bit contrast would have been even nicer.</td>', 'I think that this would be a great shot even if not in B&W.  I like the picture, but I think that a bit contrast would have been even nicer.', '2002-06-04 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
