(69019, 2147, 543, '<td valign="top">Increasing the brightness a little more would give a nicer range of contrast in the flower (at least on my somewhat calibrated monitor).  The very center, in particular, would be improved through greater visible detail.</td>', 'Increasing the brightness a little more would give a nicer range of contrast in the flower (at least on my somewhat calibrated monitor).  The very center, in particular, would be improved through greater visible detail.', '2002-06-05 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
