(69048, 2148, 387, '<td valign="top">Idea is good; needs more contrast and sharper focus; also move right to use bricks as background to eliminate sticks(?) and trees behind dog on right.</td>', 'Idea is good; needs more contrast and sharper focus; also move right to use bricks as background to eliminate sticks(?) and trees behind dog on right.', '2002-06-09 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
