(69241, 2159, 1041, '<td valign="top">I have this thing about ''untitled'' pictures - I think they should get one!  Apart from that, this is a wonderfully executed photo.  The framing, crispness, ''colors'' (or should I say shades) are great.  This is definitely in my top 10 and should rate high overall.  Would''ve also rated high for the people competition, I''m sure.</td>', 'I have this thing about ''untitled'' pictures - I think they should get one!  Apart from that, this is a wonderfully executed photo.  The framing, crispness, ''colors'' (or should I say shades) are great.  This is definitely in my top 10 and should rate high overall.  Would''ve also rated high for the people competition, I''m sure.', '2002-06-06 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69242, 2159, 806, '<td valign="top">Charming. Classic. Timeless.... What more can I say? Oh! Great texture in the hat which is picked up beautifully in  B&amp;W.</td>', 'Charming. Classic. Timeless.... What more can I say? Oh! Great texture in the hat which is picked up beautifully in  B&W.', '2002-06-06 21:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69243, 2159, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very good! Perfect lighting for the mood. Excellent pose, good subject, very expressive. I can''t think of a thing that could improve this!</td>', 'Very good! Perfect lighting for the mood. Excellent pose, good subject, very expressive. I can''t think of a thing that could improve this!', '2002-06-06 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69244, 2159, 313, '<td valign="top">is this the same child from the previous challenge?  cute kid.</td>', 'is this the same child from the previous challenge?  cute kid.', '2002-06-07 03:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69245, 2159, 1446, '<td valign="top">The best of the shots of children this week IMO.  Great contrast, excellent focus. And just so you know I am going back and raising my vote on this one, it honestly got rated as average in my first round, because I was so overwhelmed by the shear numbers of children and cat photographs.  My appologies for that.  Nice portrait.</td>', 'The best of the shots of children this week IMO.  Great contrast, excellent focus. And just so you know I am going back and raising my vote on this one, it honestly got rated as average in my first round, because I was so overwhelmed by the shear numbers of children and cat photographs.  My appologies for that.  Nice portrait.', '2002-06-07 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69246, 2159, 2060, '<td valign="top">First Class Portrait. 10/10</td>', 'First Class Portrait. 10/10', '2002-06-07 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69247, 2159, 441, '<td valign="top">great expression, good exposure and tonal control</td>', 'great expression, good exposure and tonal control', '2002-06-07 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69248, 2159, 1856, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2002-06-08 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69249, 2159, 1993, '<td valign="top">Acutally, of all the baby/child shots, I like yours best.  Not really sure why...just do.  Maybe the expression....and the unique hat..</td>', 'Acutally, of all the baby/child shots, I like yours best.  Not really sure why...just do.  Maybe the expression....and the unique hat..', '2002-06-09 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1);
