(69250, 2159, 2104, '<td valign="top">Oh gosh! What an adorable photograph. I love how innocent and ponderous the child looks and how they''re looking up and out of the frame. Lovely capture!</td>', 'Oh gosh! What an adorable photograph. I love how innocent and ponderous the child looks and how they''re looking up and out of the frame. Lovely capture!', '2002-06-09 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
