(69283, 2161, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shapes and textures, and I love the shadows behind them as well. However, the composition seems a little off to me.</td>', 'Very interesting shapes and textures, and I love the shadows behind them as well. However, the composition seems a little off to me.', '2002-06-03 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
