(69288, 2161, 554, '<td valign="top">not too good a subject to me, but done really well-----10</td>', 'not too good a subject to me, but done really well-----10', '2002-06-04 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69289, 2161, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting textures on this photo but I don''t particularly like the crop.. the flower pot in the bottom right of the frame looks a little out of place... i would have either included more of that or cut it out completely in this particular photo...</td>', 'interesting textures on this photo but I don''t particularly like the crop.. the flower pot in the bottom right of the frame looks a little out of place... i would have either included more of that or cut it out completely in this particular photo...', '2002-06-04 23:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69290, 2161, 1042, '<td valign="top">I like this shot...but on my monitor it looks a little light. Overall though, the subject is interesting with it''s shape and uniqueness, and I like the shadows on the wall behind it. I''m sure there will be others who won''t like those but I think it''s interesting.</td>', 'I like this shot...but on my monitor it looks a little light. Overall though, the subject is interesting with it''s shape and uniqueness, and I like the shadows on the wall behind it. I''m sure there will be others who won''t like those but I think it''s interesting.', '2002-06-06 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69291, 2161, 543, '<td valign="top">A good subject, and pretty good contrast.  I wouldn''t mind some pure white, as well.  Might have been more effective to isolate just one part of the cactus, but that''s another image.  Nicely done.</td>', 'A good subject, and pretty good contrast.  I wouldn''t mind some pure white, as well.  Might have been more effective to isolate just one part of the cactus, but that''s another image.  Nicely done.', '2002-06-06 06:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69292, 2161, 885, '<td valign="top">The shadow in back is cool, but I could have done without the corner of the pot there.</td>', 'The shadow in back is cool, but I could have done without the corner of the pot there.', '2002-06-06 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69293, 2161, 1993, '<td valign="top">Well...it wouldn''t be fair, if I gave you a 10, now, would it, sweetie?  I am partial to this photo, though.  So there!</td>', 'Well...it wouldn''t be fair, if I gave you a 10, now, would it, sweetie?  I am partial to this photo, though.  So there!', '2002-06-09 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69294, 2161, 2103, '<td valign="top">maybe the focus shouldve been on the big momma not the front ones</td>', 'maybe the focus shouldve been on the big momma not the front ones', '2002-06-09 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69295, 2162, 205, '<td valign="top">Thats funny, I always thought Ohio was known for nothing but corn.</td>', 'Thats funny, I always thought Ohio was known for nothing but corn.', '2002-06-03 04:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69296, 2162, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this photo quite a bit but i believe the subject would be better served on a different surface... did you try any other sufraces in this setup?  Nice shot!</td>', 'I like this photo quite a bit but i believe the subject would be better served on a different surface... did you try any other sufraces in this setup?  Nice shot!', '2002-06-03 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69297, 2162, 798, '<td valign="top">wouldve been great with space in the background.</td>', 'wouldve been great with space in the background.', '2002-06-03 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69298, 2162, 327, '<td valign="top">Creative shot. Neat b&amp;w.</td>', 'Creative shot. Neat b&w.', '2002-06-03 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69299, 2162, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool idea...</td>', 'Cool idea...', '2002-06-03 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69300, 2162, 368, '<td valign="top">i really enjoyed the simplicity in this image ... makes me want to clean and look at all my quarters!</td>', 'i really enjoyed the simplicity in this image ... makes me want to clean and look at all my quarters!', '2002-06-03 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69301, 2162, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice pic but didn''t grab my attention</td>', 'nice pic but didn''t grab my attention', '2002-06-03 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69302, 2162, 1880, '<td valign="top">Nice close up ...</td>', 'Nice close up ...', '2002-06-04 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69303, 2162, 641, '<td valign="top">Good macro and good contrast, but I think the fuzzy carpet takes away from the shot.</td>', 'Good macro and good contrast, but I think the fuzzy carpet takes away from the shot.', '2002-06-04 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69304, 2162, 587, '<td valign="top">great macro, it''s hard to keep glare off metal - you did a great job. If only you could have gotten it to look like the lower left - all over. Nice clarity on the carpet too. Good job.</td>', 'great macro, it''s hard to keep glare off metal - you did a great job. If only you could have gotten it to look like the lower left - all over. Nice clarity on the carpet too. Good job.', '2002-06-04 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69305, 2162, 1658, '<td valign="top">The coin stands out well in the photo, but I feel like it being placed in the carpet really took a lot away from the image.  Otherwise, it is a well-composed shot with the size of the subject.</td>', 'The coin stands out well in the photo, but I feel like it being placed in the carpet really took a lot away from the image.  Otherwise, it is a well-composed shot with the size of the subject.', '2002-06-05 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69306, 2162, 1, '<td valign="top">I thought North Carolina was First In Flight ?  The image seems a little uninspired, and I''m not sure how well the reflective coin works in B/W.  Maybe different lighting to have the background a. uniform color.</td>', 'I thought North Carolina was First In Flight ?  The image seems a little uninspired, and I''m not sure how well the reflective coin works in B/W.  Maybe different lighting to have the background a. uniform color.', '2002-06-05 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69307, 2162, 885, '<td valign="top">I saw the 1803 at the top and thought "someone made a fake coin with a spacesuit dated 1803".  But now I get it.</td>', 'I saw the 1803 at the top and thought "someone made a fake coin with a spacesuit dated 1803".  But now I get it.', '2002-06-05 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69308, 2162, 1897, '<td valign="top">Good macro work</td>', 'Good macro work', '2002-06-05 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69309, 2162, 2023, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and light</td>', 'Nice detail and light', '2002-06-05 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69310, 2162, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice job holding detail and texture on reflective subject - usually a tricky job...<br/><br/>Just curious, is that slver, gold, or some othr color?</td>', 'Nice job holding detail and texture on reflective subject - usually a tricky job...Just curious, is that slver, gold, or some othr color?', '2002-06-06 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69311, 2162, 1908, '<td valign="top">love the detail in this shoot</td>', 'love the detail in this shoot', '2002-06-06 03:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69312, 2162, 543, '<td valign="top">The ''space age'' carpeting is weirdly interesting, and I like the crescent ''moon'' of the highlight on the coin.</td>', 'The ''space age'' carpeting is weirdly interesting, and I like the crescent ''moon'' of the highlight on the coin.', '2002-06-06 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69313, 2162, 1041, '<td valign="top">So that''s what it looks like on the moon, I''ve always been wondering! ;)  Very good idea and execution.  Coin is maybe a little bit too dark in the bottom left, especially compared to the rest of the coin.</td>', 'So that''s what it looks like on the moon, I''ve always been wondering! ;)  Very good idea and execution.  Coin is maybe a little bit too dark in the bottom left, especially compared to the rest of the coin.', '2002-06-06 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69314, 2162, 472, '<td valign="top">i like this. good tones. the carpet is sort of a weird backdrop, tho.  maybe shot on a sheet would be better.,,</td>', 'i like this. good tones. the carpet is sort of a weird backdrop, tho.  maybe shot on a sheet would be better.,,', '2002-06-07 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69315, 2162, 2103, '<td valign="top">if the coin was in space id say im impressed but on a carpet...nah</td>', 'if the coin was in space id say im impressed but on a carpet...nah', '2002-06-09 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69316, 2162, 656, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit over-sharpened but that''s a personal thing.  Don''t like the carpet/ background</td>', 'Seems a bit over-sharpened but that''s a personal thing.  Don''t like the carpet/ background', '2002-06-09 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69317, 2163, 92, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. It''s nicely cropped and the lighting is perfect. GREAT subjects for a b/w photo !</td>', 'I like this photo. It''s nicely cropped and the lighting is perfect. GREAT subjects for a b/w photo !', '2002-06-03 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69318, 2163, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  I think black and white really fits well with antiques... good job!</td>', 'This is a great shot!  I think black and white really fits well with antiques... good job!', '2002-06-03 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69319, 2163, 573, '<td valign="top">Striking composition.  Maybe a bit too much sharpening.</td>', 'Striking composition.  Maybe a bit too much sharpening.', '2002-06-03 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69320, 2163, 1, '<td valign="top">Wow, great find.  B/W works great for this shot to give it an old time feel.  All it needs is some dust/scratches.  :)</td>', 'Wow, great find.  B/W works great for this shot to give it an old time feel.  All it needs is some dust/scratches.  :)', '2002-06-03 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69321, 2163, 1759, '<td valign="top">The motif is fitting for the B&amp;W medium.</td>', 'The motif is fitting for the B&W medium.', '2002-06-03 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69322, 2163, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject matter for black and white.  A neat thing would be to have it a little out of focus, or not quite so sharp so that it would like an old photograph.  Having said that, I also know why you wouldn''t do anything like that for the challenge, it''s just a though.  My only real suggestion, then, would be to either crop some off of the back car since you cropped the front, crop the back one and not the front one, or don''t crop any of them out.  That way, it would give the impression that the cars have "rolled" into the picture, and they have somewhere to "roll" out.  I hope that made sense, if not ask me after the challenge and I''ll try to elaborate.</td>', 'Excellent subject matter for black and white.  A neat thing would be to have it a little out of focus, or not quite so sharp so that it would like an old photograph.  Having said that, I also know why you wouldn''t do anything like that for the challenge, it''s just a though.  My only real suggestion, then, would be to either crop some off of the back car since you cropped the front, crop the back one and not the front one, or don''t crop any of them out.  That way, it would give the impression that the cars have "rolled" into the picture, and they have somewhere to "roll" out.  I hope that made sense, if not ask me after the challenge and I''ll try to elaborate.', '2002-06-03 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69323, 2163, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, dof, tones. Well done, good job.</td>', 'Nice composition, dof, tones. Well done, good job.', '2002-06-03 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69324, 2163, 737, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean, and well composed. Well chosen lighting conditions. One of my top 3.</td>', 'Crisp, clean, and well composed. Well chosen lighting conditions. One of my top 3.', '2002-06-03 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69325, 2163, 1831, '<td valign="top">Fantastic cars, good DOF, lovely photo.</td>', 'Fantastic cars, good DOF, lovely photo.', '2002-06-03 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69326, 2163, 441, '<td valign="top">lovely detail</td>', 'lovely detail', '2002-06-03 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69327, 2163, 1379, '<td valign="top">This works so well because *everything* was in black and white back then, right?</td>', 'This works so well because *everything* was in black and white back then, right?', '2002-06-03 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69328, 2163, 1519, '<td valign="top">Great subject for b/w. Very nice!</td>', 'Great subject for b/w. Very nice!', '2002-06-04 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69329, 2163, 554, '<td valign="top">great ! ----10</td>', 'great ! ----10', '2002-06-04 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
