(69361, 2164, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think the negative effect is a neat idea, but not for this photo. It''s hard to see what''s going on, so I saved it and inverted the colours just to see. To me it''s a fairly interesting photo, i like the way the kneeling girl is running her hands through her hair, but..  it doesn''t really make any kind of bold statement that the negative version would enhance.</td>', 'I think the negative effect is a neat idea, but not for this photo. It''s hard to see what''s going on, so I saved it and inverted the colours just to see. To me it''s a fairly interesting photo, i like the way the kneeling girl is running her hands through her hair, but..  it doesn''t really make any kind of bold statement that the negative version would enhance.', '2002-06-06 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
