(69389, 2166, 1792, '<td valign="top">Good composition, detail and simplicity.  Lends itself well to b&amp;w.</td>', 'Good composition, detail and simplicity.  Lends itself well to b&w.', '2002-06-04 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69390, 2166, 1336, '<td valign="top">i think i would have liked the picture better without the hand.</td>', 'i think i would have liked the picture better without the hand.', '2002-06-04 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69391, 2166, 885, '<td valign="top">I was trying to figure this out...whether it was two hands and two flowers, but I think that the hand/flower is on top of a mirror, which is why the bottom looks a little softer, and has a ghosting shadow.  I like the composition a lot, and of course your B&amp;W tones are right on.</td>', 'I was trying to figure this out...whether it was two hands and two flowers, but I think that the hand/flower is on top of a mirror, which is why the bottom looks a little softer, and has a ghosting shadow.  I like the composition a lot, and of course your B&W tones are right on.', '2002-06-04 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69392, 2166, 2, '<td valign="top">The movement on that bottom flower is pretty distracting, and it makes the photo look blurred/out of focus at the bottom.  I love the top of the image, though, so I know if that bottom part hadn''t been blurred, I''d really have liked this image.  I think you might have gone for a little more symmetry, though, with how much hand is showing at the top/bottom.</td>', 'The movement on that bottom flower is pretty distracting, and it makes the photo look blurred/out of focus at the bottom.  I love the top of the image, though, so I know if that bottom part hadn''t been blurred, I''d really have liked this image.  I think you might have gone for a little more symmetry, though, with how much hand is showing at the top/bottom.', '2002-06-04 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69393, 2166, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is one of only a few flower phtotographs that work well in black and white.  Sorry I do not have any suggestions to make it better, you have  done so well!</td>', 'This is one of only a few flower phtotographs that work well in black and white.  Sorry I do not have any suggestions to make it better, you have  done so well!', '2002-06-04 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69394, 2166, 661, '<td valign="top">Pretty picture.  Reflection but hard to see the dividing line.  Nice job.</td>', 'Pretty picture.  Reflection but hard to see the dividing line.  Nice job.', '2002-06-04 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69395, 2166, 1519, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! I usually don''t like flowers in b/w, but the detail on this one is wonderful. Love the refelection idea.  And the hand is a good touch - I wasn''t sure at first, but I think it does add something that would have been missing with just the flower. Nice!</td>', 'This is beautiful! I usually don''t like flowers in b/w, but the detail on this one is wonderful. Love the refelection idea.  And the hand is a good touch - I wasn''t sure at first, but I think it does add something that would have been missing with just the flower. Nice!', '2002-06-04 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69396, 2166, 554, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2002-06-04 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69397, 2166, 258, '<td valign="top">Very clear but I''m drawn to the mirrow.</td>', 'Very clear but I''m drawn to the mirrow.', '2002-06-04 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69398, 2166, 637, '<td valign="top">Great use of b+w</td>', 'Great use of b+w', '2002-06-05 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69399, 2166, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... it seems too busy. The hand and the reflection distract from the flower.</td>', 'Hmmm.... it seems too busy. The hand and the reflection distract from the flower.', '2002-06-05 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69400, 2166, 741, '<td valign="top">Great use of reflection - perfectly composed</td>', 'Great use of reflection - perfectly composed', '2002-06-05 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69401, 2166, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo... I am quite impressed :)  I bet you are getting comments about the blur on the mirrored image.. the ''ghost'' image... I ran into a similar problem when I was helping someone with a similar photo a few weeks ago... This ''ghost'' is caused by the thickness of the mirror somehow and I don''t think there is any way you can get rid of this... It can be minimized by elevating the angle of the camera with respect to the subject but that would definitely NOT work in this photo... All of the compositional elements of this photo are excellent... no complaints at all!  Good job!</td>', 'This is an excellent photo... I am quite impressed :)  I bet you are getting comments about the blur on the mirrored image.. the ''ghost'' image... I ran into a similar problem when I was helping someone with a similar photo a few weeks ago... This ''ghost'' is caused by the thickness of the mirror somehow and I don''t think there is any way you can get rid of this... It can be minimized by elevating the angle of the camera with respect to the subject but that would definitely NOT work in this photo... All of the compositional elements of this photo are excellent... no complaints at all!  Good job!', '2002-06-05 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69402, 2166, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good idea. What kind of flower is that?</td>', 'Good idea. What kind of flower is that?', '2002-06-06 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69403, 2166, 875, '<td valign="top">I love the use of symmetry and negative space in this photo.  The detail in the flower is beautiful.</td>', 'I love the use of symmetry and negative space in this photo.  The detail in the flower is beautiful.', '2002-06-06 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69404, 2166, 142, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.', '2002-06-06 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69405, 2166, 811, '<td valign="top">Really nice, I like how you can see the texture of the flower and the hand.  The reflection really adds to the picture, and though the hand doesn''t bother me at all, it would be a nice picture without it as well.</td>', 'Really nice, I like how you can see the texture of the flower and the hand.  The reflection really adds to the picture, and though the hand doesn''t bother me at all, it would be a nice picture without it as well.', '2002-06-06 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69406, 2166, 878, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo, nice reflection and great flower for a B+W shot.  The hand in the photo makes this different from all the other staged flower shots.</td>', 'Very sharp photo, nice reflection and great flower for a B+W shot.  The hand in the photo makes this different from all the other staged flower shots.', '2002-06-07 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69407, 2166, 1944, '<td valign="top">excellent except for a little subject movement</td>', 'excellent except for a little subject movement', '2002-06-08 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69408, 2166, 332, '<td valign="top">What the f*** is that hand doing there? :) I would have scored it a bit higher without that hand. Good picture though.</td>', 'What the f*** is that hand doing there? :) I would have scored it a bit higher without that hand. Good picture though.', '2002-06-08 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69409, 2166, 1, '<td valign="top">Great use of a reflection, I''m not sure if the hand helps or not.  =/</td>', 'Great use of a reflection, I''m not sure if the hand helps or not.  =/', '2002-06-08 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69410, 2166, 1993, '<td valign="top">I think the shot would be more dramatic without the hand...for me, it is distracting.</td>', 'I think the shot would be more dramatic without the hand...for me, it is distracting.', '2002-06-09 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69411, 2166, 543, '<td valign="top">Excellent light, focus, clarity, tones.  Personally, I think the mirror image detracts.  It''s not as sharp as the top due to some doubling of the reflection, and the angle of the reflection makes the composition a bit messy.  Still near the top of the heap.</td>', 'Excellent light, focus, clarity, tones.  Personally, I think the mirror image detracts.  It''s not as sharp as the top due to some doubling of the reflection, and the angle of the reflection makes the composition a bit messy.  Still near the top of the heap.', '2002-06-09 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69412, 2166, 2060, '<td valign="top">Would have given more points if it wasn''t for the hand!</td>', 'Would have given more points if it wasn''t for the hand!', '2002-06-09 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69413, 2166, 1041, '<td valign="top">Everyone, thanks a lot for voting and the comments.  <br/><br/>To answer some of the questions: I knew I was going to get comments both in favor and against the hand.  While this was just a fun ''out-take'' while shooting a lot of flower-ony photos, I finally decided that I actually liked this one best.  Go figure!<br/><br/>I''ve posted another version for your comparison at //www.pbase.com/gr8photos/bandw.  <br/><br/>The reason I took this in b&amp;w is that (a) I wanted to try taking an image of something that is traditionally color in b&amp;w but so that it still looks good.  This shot in particular I like better in b&amp;w than color.  It looks more ''stylized'' I guess.  Feel free to check out the color version at the address above for comparison.<br/><br/>No, the bottom half of the shot is not OOF.  The ''ghosting'' of the mirror cannot really be avoided, other than by changing the camera angle and that wouldn''t have worked for this shot.</td>', 'Everyone, thanks a lot for voting and the comments.  To answer some of the questions: I knew I was going to get comments both in favor and against the hand.  While this was just a fun ''out-take'' while shooting a lot of flower-ony photos, I finally decided that I actually liked this one best.  Go figure!I''ve posted another version for your comparison at //www.pbase.com/gr8photos/bandw.  The reason I took this in b&w is that (a) I wanted to try taking an image of something that is traditionally color in b&w but so that it still looks good.  This shot in particular I like better in b&w than color.  It looks more ''stylized'' I guess.  Feel free to check out the color version at the address above for comparison.No, the bottom half of the shot is not OOF.  The ''ghosting'' of the mirror cannot really be avoided, other than by changing the camera angle and that wouldn''t have worked for this shot.', '2002-06-10 01:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69414, 2166, 772, '<td valign="top">Franziska,<br/><br/>I like the hand as well... I hoped this photo would score higher.. it was one of my 10s this week... good work!</td>', 'Franziska,I like the hand as well... I hoped this photo would score higher.. it was one of my 10s this week... good work!', '2002-06-10 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69415, 2167, 1829, '<td valign="top">Love the creativity in this photo.  Gives me a sense that I''m in a old house!!  Great work! (8)</td>', 'Love the creativity in this photo.  Gives me a sense that I''m in a old house!!  Great work! (8)', '2002-06-03 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69416, 2167, 1848, '<td valign="top">NIce image, I would have given it a 10 if the composition were better. The slant seems careless rather than compositional. Nice tonal range with the highlight on the knob plate and the deep shadow behind the door. Composition would also have been helped with the door know a bit higher.</td>', 'NIce image, I would have given it a 10 if the composition were better. The slant seems careless rather than compositional. Nice tonal range with the highlight on the knob plate and the deep shadow behind the door. Composition would also have been helped with the door know a bit higher.', '2002-06-03 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69417, 2167, 573, '<td valign="top">I like it, nice contrasts, good tonal range, interesting textures, and composition.  In the  top ten.</td>', 'I like it, nice contrasts, good tonal range, interesting textures, and composition.  In the  top ten.', '2002-06-03 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69418, 2167, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice door!  lol... This is a neat shot and it does well in black and white :) Good job!</td>', 'Nice door!  lol... This is a neat shot and it does well in black and white :) Good job!', '2002-06-03 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69419, 2167, 616, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast!</td>', 'Nice contrast!', '2002-06-03 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69420, 2167, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute, creative title. I like this b&amp;w. Well done.</td>', 'Cute, creative title. I like this b&w. Well done.', '2002-06-03 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69421, 2167, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2002-06-03 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69422, 2167, 1597, '<td valign="top">creative,over all shot good</td>', 'creative,over all shot good', '2002-06-03 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69423, 2167, 1792, '<td valign="top">Subject matter well chosen for b &amp; w.</td>', 'Subject matter well chosen for b & w.', '2002-06-03 23:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69424, 2167, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good job finding a textured surface to shoot.</td>', 'Good job finding a textured surface to shoot.', '2002-06-04 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69425, 2167, 543, '<td valign="top">A nice subject for B/W, but the lighting and composition could be better.  Given the limited dynamic range you have to work with, it probaby would have been better to concentrate on either the area in shade, or the area in sunlight, or the place where they intersect.  The small sunlit area at bottom just steals potential contrast from the large shaded area as is.</td>', 'A nice subject for B/W, but the lighting and composition could be better.  Given the limited dynamic range you have to work with, it probaby would have been better to concentrate on either the area in shade, or the area in sunlight, or the place where they intersect.  The small sunlit area at bottom just steals potential contrast from the large shaded area as is.', '2002-06-04 06:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69426, 2167, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great subject for black and white. Very nice textures.</td>', 'Great subject for black and white. Very nice textures.', '2002-06-04 06:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69427, 2167, 637, '<td valign="top">Very nice, yet I''d like this better if you had widened the image.</td>', 'Very nice, yet I''d like this better if you had widened the image.', '2002-06-04 20:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69428, 2167, 1, '<td valign="top">I like the theme to this, but the black space on the left I think could''ve been left out.  The glare on the door knob base is a bit distracting as well.</td>', 'I like the theme to this, but the black space on the left I think could''ve been left out.  The glare on the door knob base is a bit distracting as well.', '2002-06-05 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69429, 2167, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very nice texture in the peeling paint, but the highlight on the back of the doorknob is a little harsh.  Overall, well done.</td>', 'Very nice texture in the peeling paint, but the highlight on the back of the doorknob is a little harsh.  Overall, well done.', '2002-06-05 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69430, 2167, 441, '<td valign="top">good subject - I would have been tempted to up the contrasts in this shot</td>', 'good subject - I would have been tempted to up the contrasts in this shot', '2002-06-05 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69431, 2167, 472, '<td valign="top">great textures.  a little tilted.</td>', 'great textures.  a little tilted.', '2002-06-06 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69432, 2167, 1944, '<td valign="top">Good shot. If the base of the door knob wasn''t blown out, I''d give a 10.</td>', 'Good shot. If the base of the door knob wasn''t blown out, I''d give a 10.', '2002-06-06 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69433, 2167, 656, '<td valign="top">good choice of subject, with tons of texture.  Almost feel a more ''face on'' shot could have worked better ?   Needs better light to highlight the peeling paint</td>', 'good choice of subject, with tons of texture.  Almost feel a more ''face on'' shot could have worked better ?   Needs better light to highlight the peeling paint', '2002-06-09 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69434, 2168, 205, '<td valign="top">Whats those grid things?</td>', 'Whats those grid things?', '2002-06-03 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69435, 2168, 573, '<td valign="top">And I hope you are sitting on an insulated stool or something.  Nice shot, I look forward to the "Details/Etc:".  What is causing that wave effect?</td>', 'And I hope you are sitting on an insulated stool or something.  Nice shot, I look forward to the "Details/Etc:".  What is causing that wave effect?', '2002-06-03 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69436, 2168, 1540, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot.. it would have been spectacular if not shot thru the screen.</td>', 'this is a great shot.. it would have been spectacular if not shot thru the screen.', '2002-06-03 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69437, 2168, 1175, '<td valign="top">What''s with the diagonal shadow?  Detracts from the picture I think.</td>', 'What''s with the diagonal shadow?  Detracts from the picture I think.', '2002-06-03 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69438, 2168, 1, '<td valign="top">Are you looking out a screen door?  Why the uniform checkeredness?  Otherwise it''s amazingly done.</td>', 'Are you looking out a screen door?  Why the uniform checkeredness?  Otherwise it''s amazingly done.', '2002-06-03 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69439, 2168, 2, '<td valign="top">First, you did an amazing (almost unbelievable) job catching this motion, completely in-frame.  Second -- did you try taking any shot with the screen in focus and the lightnight not?  I''d like to see those if you did.</td>', 'First, you did an amazing (almost unbelievable) job catching this motion, completely in-frame.  Second -- did you try taking any shot with the screen in focus and the lightnight not?  I''d like to see those if you did.', '2002-06-03 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69440, 2168, 570, '<td valign="top">man, if it wasn''t for the screen showing up so much in front of it, I would give this a 10.</td>', 'man, if it wasn''t for the screen showing up so much in front of it, I would give this a 10.', '2002-06-03 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69441, 2168, 203, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!</td>', 'Nice capture!', '2002-06-03 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69442, 2168, 661, '<td valign="top">I saw a few of these storms in Florida last week.  Nice catch!</td>', 'I saw a few of these storms in Florida last week.  Nice catch!', '2002-06-03 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69443, 2168, 327, '<td valign="top">Kool title, nice capture.</td>', 'Kool title, nice capture.', '2002-06-03 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69444, 2168, 737, '<td valign="top">Great lightening strike. What''s the mesh background from?</td>', 'Great lightening strike. What''s the mesh background from?', '2002-06-03 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69445, 2168, 772, '<td valign="top">This is EXCELLENT.  I am going to try this myself at some point this summer.  It looks like you shot this through a screen window maybe?  This shot is indeed awesome and would be even moreso without the screen... great job!</td>', 'This is EXCELLENT.  I am going to try this myself at some point this summer.  It looks like you shot this through a screen window maybe?  This shot is indeed awesome and would be even moreso without the screen... great job!', '2002-06-03 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69446, 2168, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very cool</td>', 'Very cool', '2002-06-03 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69447, 2168, 1313, '<td valign="top">Nice pic</td>', 'Nice pic', '2002-06-03 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69448, 2168, 208, '<td valign="top">nice catch!</td>', 'nice catch!', '2002-06-03 20:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69449, 2168, 1336, '<td valign="top">i''m guessing this was taken through a window or screen door.  maybe that look is intentional, but i think it would have been better without it - it''s a distraction to me.</td>', 'i''m guessing this was taken through a window or screen door.  maybe that look is intentional, but i think it would have been better without it - it''s a distraction to me.', '2002-06-04 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(69450, 2168, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Do you know what''s making the pattern effect I see in the sky?</td>', 'Nice capture! Do you know what''s making the pattern effect I see in the sky?', '2002-06-04 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69451, 2168, 1907, '<td valign="top">whats up with the odd crosshatching effect?</td>', 'whats up with the odd crosshatching effect?', '2002-06-04 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69452, 2168, 1882, '<td valign="top">uh, is that the screen we see????</td>', 'uh, is that the screen we see????', '2002-06-04 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69453, 2168, 1446, '<td valign="top">Opening the screen would have made this shot a lot better IMO.  Also cropping so that the lightning is not right in the center would have been my personal choice.</td>', 'Opening the screen would have made this shot a lot better IMO.  Also cropping so that the lightning is not right in the center would have been my personal choice.', '2002-06-04 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69454, 2168, 587, '<td valign="top">Awesome, wish it wasn''t taken through a screen - or is this textured that way on purpose? Great capture though!</td>', 'Awesome, wish it wasn''t taken through a screen - or is this textured that way on purpose? Great capture though!', '2002-06-04 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69455, 2168, 258, '<td valign="top">Was this taken thru a screen?</td>', 'Was this taken thru a screen?', '2002-06-05 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69456, 2168, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, and a perfect B/W choice, but the pattern of the screen detracts.</td>', 'Nice catch, and a perfect B/W choice, but the pattern of the screen detracts.', '2002-06-05 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69457, 2168, 1590, '<td valign="top">a little ripper!</td>', 'a little ripper!', '2002-06-05 05:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69458, 2168, 641, '<td valign="top">I''d love to catch a shot like this.</td>', 'I''d love to catch a shot like this.', '2002-06-05 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69459, 2168, 2023, '<td valign="top">Great timing</td>', 'Great timing', '2002-06-05 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69460, 2168, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice catch! It seems to be through a screen, which is a bit distracting, but still...</td>', 'Very nice catch! It seems to be through a screen, which is a bit distracting, but still...', '2002-06-06 02:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69461, 2168, 313, '<td valign="top">wow.  did you capture that or is this on tv?  if so, ph33r.</td>', 'wow.  did you capture that or is this on tv?  if so, ph33r.', '2002-06-06 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69462, 2168, 92, '<td valign="top">This would be a perfect 10 if not for the lines on it. I tried to catch this very thing the other afternoon and ummmmmmm it''s not easy ! Nice job:)</td>', 'This would be a perfect 10 if not for the lines on it. I tried to catch this very thing the other afternoon and ummmmmmm it''s not easy ! Nice job:)', '2002-06-06 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69463, 2168, 472, '<td valign="top">good catch. what''s the pattern? is that the window? it does detract as im sure you know. still, you done good :)</td>', 'good catch. what''s the pattern? is that the window? it does detract as im sure you know. still, you done good :)', '2002-06-07 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69464, 2168, 917, '<td valign="top">What a shame about the wire mesh on the window. (That is what it is isnt it?)</td>', 'What a shame about the wire mesh on the window. (That is what it is isnt it?)', '2002-06-07 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69465, 2168, 1005, '<td valign="top">WOW, (needs to be repeated WOW!!)  {{through a screen door?}}  Don''t think I like the screen pattern, otherwise PERFECTION!!!!<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 10 B&amp;W 10 total 10  (isn''t there a number higher than 10?)</td>', 'WOW, (needs to be repeated WOW!!)  {{through a screen door?}}  Don''t think I like the screen pattern, otherwise PERFECTION!!!!Photo 10 Creativity 10 B&W 10 total 10  (isn''t there a number higher than 10?)', '2002-06-07 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69466, 2168, 509, '<td valign="top">Unless this is a picture of a picture, you have great timing.  I wish the mesh wasn''t there, but still.....wow</td>', 'Unless this is a picture of a picture, you have great timing.  I wish the mesh wasn''t there, but still.....wow', '2002-06-07 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69467, 2168, 582, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Awesome shot, especially with a digital camera!</td>', 'Wow.  Awesome shot, especially with a digital camera!', '2002-06-08 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69468, 2168, 1128, '<td valign="top">I am SO impressed that you captured this...too bad the screen was in the way, though.</td>', 'I am SO impressed that you captured this...too bad the screen was in the way, though.', '2002-06-09 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69469, 2168, 875, '<td valign="top">Good job catching the lightening strike!  The screen door adds an interesting sort of pattern to the photo.</td>', 'Good job catching the lightening strike!  The screen door adds an interesting sort of pattern to the photo.', '2002-06-09 01:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69470, 2168, 616, '<td valign="top">this is a kool pic, but it looks as if it was taken through a screen</td>', 'this is a kool pic, but it looks as if it was taken through a screen', '2002-06-09 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69471, 2168, 656, '<td valign="top">good timing!</td>', 'good timing!', '2002-06-09 22:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69472, 2168, 1344, '<td valign="top">Um, for everyone who was wondering what the "grid" was, it was a window screen.  I didn''t exactly get 1000 tries to get this pic, so I hadda use what I got, which was a shot thru a screen...<br/><br/>Thx for the kind comments!<br/></td>', 'Um, for everyone who was wondering what the "grid" was, it was a window screen.  I didn''t exactly get 1000 tries to get this pic, so I hadda use what I got, which was a shot thru a screen...Thx for the kind comments!', '2002-06-10 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69473, 2169, 409, '<td valign="top">cosy</td>', 'cosy', '2002-06-03 08:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69474, 2169, 327, '<td valign="top">Bit tilted to the right although this is a fine b&amp;w shot.</td>', 'Bit tilted to the right although this is a fine b&w shot.', '2002-06-03 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69475, 2169, 1585, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good coverage of the scale.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good coverage of the scale.', '2002-06-03 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69476, 2169, 388, '<td valign="top">If the bench had been horizontal this would have been a much beter photo.</td>', 'If the bench had been horizontal this would have been a much beter photo.', '2002-06-03 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69477, 2169, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo should definitely be re-framed to remove the dark strip from the left edge... that is accenting the tilt to the right on the camera quite a bit...</td>', 'This photo should definitely be re-framed to remove the dark strip from the left edge... that is accenting the tilt to the right on the camera quite a bit...', '2002-06-03 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69478, 2169, 661, '<td valign="top">I feel like he is going to slide off the bench... is it just me or are we in SF?</td>', 'I feel like he is going to slide off the bench... is it just me or are we in SF?', '2002-06-03 21:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69479, 2169, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast of the bench nice shot</td>', 'nice contrast of the bench nice shot', '2002-06-03 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69480, 2169, 1882, '<td valign="top">uh, the bench is slanted...he''s going to slide off!...oh, maybe that''s just because you didn''t hold the camera straight.  lol</td>', 'uh, the bench is slanted...he''s going to slide off!...oh, maybe that''s just because you didn''t hold the camera straight.  lol', '2002-06-04 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69481, 2169, 1024, '<td valign="top">The dark column on the left bothers me a little bit.  maybe if you had either moved a bit closer, or if that was not possible, cropped it out.</td>', 'The dark column on the left bothers me a little bit.  maybe if you had either moved a bit closer, or if that was not possible, cropped it out.', '2002-06-04 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69482, 2169, 156, '<td valign="top">ergh, i wish this wasn''t tilted, i love the lighting and architectural elements</td>', 'ergh, i wish this wasn''t tilted, i love the lighting and architectural elements', '2002-06-04 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69483, 2169, 1897, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range.  Very sharp.  I do not like the quirky framing.</td>', 'Great tonal range.  Very sharp.  I do not like the quirky framing.', '2002-06-05 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69484, 2169, 811, '<td valign="top">I think cropping or framing it so that the pole-thing wasn''t in it and moving the subject to the left would have made it more balanced.  I kinda get the feeling you were hiding somewhere and were trying to take the shot without him seeing you.</td>', 'I think cropping or framing it so that the pole-thing wasn''t in it and moving the subject to the left would have made it more balanced.  I kinda get the feeling you were hiding somewhere and were trying to take the shot without him seeing you.', '2002-06-05 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69485, 2169, 2023, '<td valign="top">Very nice!<br/></td>', 'Very nice!', '2002-06-05 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69486, 2169, 1042, '<td valign="top">I believe the blacks and whites contrast well, there''s something about the tilt that bothers me and the fact that you almost lose the subject in all that''s surrounding him. The black area to the left is bothersome to me as well.</td>', 'I believe the blacks and whites contrast well, there''s something about the tilt that bothers me and the fact that you almost lose the subject in all that''s surrounding him. The black area to the left is bothersome to me as well.', '2002-06-06 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69487, 2169, 1037, '<td valign="top">Nice, peaceful, contemplative shot. I like that it''s slightly skewed, although some people are probably suggesting that''s wrong. It makes it seem more candid.</td>', 'Nice, peaceful, contemplative shot. I like that it''s slightly skewed, although some people are probably suggesting that''s wrong. It makes it seem more candid.', '2002-06-06 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69488, 2169, 1944, '<td valign="top">needs a level horizon. Good exposure, B/W conversion though.</td>', 'needs a level horizon. Good exposure, B/W conversion though.', '2002-06-06 20:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69489, 2169, 878, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot but the black bar on the left side is distracting.  If rotated and taken with the subject on the lower half this would of really done it for me.  Still its a clean photo with nice tones and shades.</td>', 'This is a good shot but the black bar on the left side is distracting.  If rotated and taken with the subject on the lower half this would of really done it for me.  Still its a clean photo with nice tones and shades.', '2002-06-07 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69490, 2169, 582, '<td valign="top">Good shot, however, it seems that the photo is not quite level.</td>', 'Good shot, however, it seems that the photo is not quite level.', '2002-06-08 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69491, 2169, 637, '<td valign="top">Reader''s face is a little too bright for my taste.  Image is a little slanted.</td>', 'Reader''s face is a little too bright for my taste.  Image is a little slanted.', '2002-06-08 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69492, 2169, 543, '<td valign="top">The reflected light from the open book is perfect for lightening the shadows there.  Good focus and clarity.  Don''t know if the black bit of architecture at L adds anything, and certianly needs a CCW rotation.  I''d straighten the horizontals, then crop tighter on the man.  Still nice.</td>', 'The reflected light from the open book is perfect for lightening the shadows there.  Good focus and clarity.  Don''t know if the black bit of architecture at L adds anything, and certianly needs a CCW rotation.  I''d straighten the horizontals, then crop tighter on the man.  Still nice.', '2002-06-09 04:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69493, 2169, 2103, '<td valign="top">is it crooked?</td>', 'is it crooked?', '2002-06-09 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69494, 2169, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think this either needs to be more drammatically tilted than it now is, or straightened so that it''s level.  The little bit of a tilt makes it feel like it''s accidental and not intentional.  I''d also suggest a slightly tighter crop, if possible, to remove the support post that''s along the left side of the image.  That would move your subject further to the left and make use of rule of thirds too.</td>', 'I think this either needs to be more drammatically tilted than it now is, or straightened so that it''s level.  The little bit of a tilt makes it feel like it''s accidental and not intentional.  I''d also suggest a slightly tighter crop, if possible, to remove the support post that''s along the left side of the image.  That would move your subject further to the left and make use of rule of thirds too.', '2002-06-09 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69495, 2169, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a slight tilt problem... this photo lacks interest.</td>', 'Seems to be a slight tilt problem... this photo lacks interest.', '2002-06-10 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69496, 2170, 1175, '<td valign="top">The front of that vehicle (the screen looking part) gives the appearance that its out of focus.  Otherwise a nice photo.</td>', 'The front of that vehicle (the screen looking part) gives the appearance that its out of focus.  Otherwise a nice photo.', '2002-06-03 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69497, 2170, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done. Good composition, good tone, good shot!!!</td>', 'Well done. Good composition, good tone, good shot!!!', '2002-06-03 17:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69498, 2170, 1831, '<td valign="top">Would have given it an 8(its a lovely picture), were it not for the blur on the radiator grill.</td>', 'Would have given it an 8(its a lovely picture), were it not for the blur on the radiator grill.', '2002-06-03 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69499, 2170, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat photo!  As I look at this, i wonder how many different angles and approaches to a photo would be available with this subject?  Did you try quite a few different perspectives on this tractor?  If so, I would love to see a few of them.. good job!</td>', 'This is a neat photo!  As I look at this, i wonder how many different angles and approaches to a photo would be available with this subject?  Did you try quite a few different perspectives on this tractor?  If so, I would love to see a few of them.. good job!', '2002-06-03 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69500, 2170, 1880, '<td valign="top">I like this picture very much but the grill looks somewhat blurred ?</td>', 'I like this picture very much but the grill looks somewhat blurred ?', '2002-06-04 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69501, 2170, 1882, '<td valign="top">i liked it except the front of the tractor looks blurry.  Or is it just my eyes....</td>', 'i liked it except the front of the tractor looks blurry.  Or is it just my eyes....', '2002-06-04 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69502, 2170, 554, '<td valign="top">I want to buy this tractor. This is my favorite but some other cat might beat ya.</td>', 'I want to buy this tractor. This is my favorite but some other cat might beat ya.', '2002-06-04 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69503, 2170, 156, '<td valign="top">CooL! but why''s the grill blurry?</td>', 'CooL! but why''s the grill blurry?', '2002-06-04 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69504, 2170, 641, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, the only thing is the grill area seems blurred and it is distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot, the only thing is the grill area seems blurred and it is distracting.', '2002-06-04 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
