(69527, 2171, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern the fence (?) makes.  I think it would have seemed more balanced to me if the reader had been about 4 posts to the right.   From a different angle, I think it would have also been a nice shot without the reader.</td>', 'I like the pattern the fence (?) makes.  I think it would have seemed more balanced to me if the reader had been about 4 posts to the right.   From a different angle, I think it would have also been a nice shot without the reader.', '2002-06-04 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
