(69595, 2174, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great lighting for this shot.  I think there is just a bit too much dead space at the top.  Maybe just 25% less.  I really like this though, don''t get me wrong.</td>', 'Great lighting for this shot.  I think there is just a bit too much dead space at the top.  Maybe just 25% less.  I really like this though, don''t get me wrong.', '2002-06-03 19:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69596, 2174, 671, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it cropped a little closer.  The large empty space at the top distracts from the picture.</td>', 'I would have liked it cropped a little closer.  The large empty space at the top distracts from the picture.', '2002-06-03 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69597, 2174, 811, '<td valign="top">A touch too much empty space at the top and I wish the right elbow hadn''t been cut off, though I think I can understand why you did.  Very effective lighting.</td>', 'A touch too much empty space at the top and I wish the right elbow hadn''t been cut off, though I think I can understand why you did.  Very effective lighting.', '2002-06-03 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69598, 2174, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast, and creative</td>', 'nice contrast, and creative', '2002-06-03 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69599, 2174, 1792, '<td valign="top">Simplicity of subject matter makes it effective</td>', 'Simplicity of subject matter makes it effective', '2002-06-03 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69600, 2174, 1336, '<td valign="top">great photo.  others may disagree, but i really like the empty space in the top half of the photo.  it has a very dramatic effect for some reason.</td>', 'great photo.  others may disagree, but i really like the empty space in the top half of the photo.  it has a very dramatic effect for some reason.', '2002-06-04 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69601, 2174, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I''m torn between two things tho and don''t know which one would be better.  I don''t like the cut-off arm on the right.  But moving more to the center of the photo would make it less appealing, too.  I''m not sure what to do.  Was it possible to take a landscape shot with you in the bottom right (including both elbows)?  Anyway, good picture!</td>', 'Great shot.  I''m torn between two things tho and don''t know which one would be better.  I don''t like the cut-off arm on the right.  But moving more to the center of the photo would make it less appealing, too.  I''m not sure what to do.  Was it possible to take a landscape shot with you in the bottom right (including both elbows)?  Anyway, good picture!', '2002-06-04 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69602, 2174, 878, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2002-06-04 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69603, 2174, 312, '<td valign="top">this is really great. perfect lighting, great contrasts, and that negative space is scrumptious. this might look neat on a lighter background to introduce a tad more contrast, but you''d lose that amazing light streak and that would be a shame. great work.</td>', 'this is really great. perfect lighting, great contrasts, and that negative space is scrumptious. this might look neat on a lighter background to introduce a tad more contrast, but you''d lose that amazing light streak and that would be a shame. great work.', '2002-06-04 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69604, 2174, 661, '<td valign="top">The picture is interesting but the all blank space at the top doesn''t add anything for me.</td>', 'The picture is interesting but the all blank space at the top doesn''t add anything for me.', '2002-06-04 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69605, 2174, 641, '<td valign="top">Only suggestion I have is move to the left a little to get that other elbow in. Most will probably say crop some off the top. That was my first thought, but the more I looked at it.. the more I decided I like it better with it not cropped.</td>', 'Only suggestion I have is move to the left a little to get that other elbow in. Most will probably say crop some off the top. That was my first thought, but the more I looked at it.. the more I decided I like it better with it not cropped.', '2002-06-05 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69606, 2174, 587, '<td valign="top">She must be a professional, because you shouldn''t try this at home! :) I wish this had both arms in the shot, and her whole back. good job.</td>', 'She must be a professional, because you shouldn''t try this at home! :) I wish this had both arms in the shot, and her whole back. good job.', '2002-06-05 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69607, 2174, 472, '<td valign="top">i like the negative space at the top of this image.  is that window light?  tall windows.</td>', 'i like the negative space at the top of this image.  is that window light?  tall windows.', '2002-06-05 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69608, 2174, 441, '<td valign="top">lot of space up there but like the light, nice shot</td>', 'lot of space up there but like the light, nice shot', '2002-06-05 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69609, 2174, 1658, '<td valign="top">I like the light usage in this picture.  I keep going back and forth as to all the open space above the subject.  But, since I keep thinking about, I have to say that''s it''s a more engaging photo than I had thought at first glance.</td>', 'I like the light usage in this picture.  I keep going back and forth as to all the open space above the subject.  But, since I keep thinking about, I have to say that''s it''s a more engaging photo than I had thought at first glance.', '2002-06-05 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69610, 2174, 543, '<td valign="top">I saw this on your pbase portfolio, and thought ''she''d better submit that''.  Good eye for the light.  I wish your right elbow were tucked into the frame.  Took a while to see the clippings on your shouldesr, but they''d show on a print.</td>', 'I saw this on your pbase portfolio, and thought ''she''d better submit that''.  Good eye for the light.  I wish your right elbow were tucked into the frame.  Took a while to see the clippings on your shouldesr, but they''d show on a print.', '2002-06-06 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69611, 2174, 1037, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this photo, the more I like about it :). I''m going to give it 10.</td>', 'The more I look at this photo, the more I like about it :). I''m going to give it 10.', '2002-06-06 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69612, 2174, 806, '<td valign="top">Poor composition.</td>', 'Poor composition.', '2002-06-06 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69613, 2174, 2023, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like pictures that tell a story.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like pictures that tell a story.', '2002-06-07 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69614, 2174, 332, '<td valign="top">Like it! A bit more contrast maby? Simular to my ''People'' submission ;)</td>', 'Like it! A bit more contrast maby? Simular to my ''People'' submission ;)', '2002-06-08 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69615, 2174, 1, '<td valign="top">Must be the oddest framing job i''ve ever seen.  I like the verticalness of it all, but cutting off her right elbow doesnt work for me -- I''d like to see her centered at the bottom.  The lighting is pretty cool too.</td>', 'Must be the oddest framing job i''ve ever seen.  I like the verticalness of it all, but cutting off her right elbow doesnt work for me -- I''d like to see her centered at the bottom.  The lighting is pretty cool too.', '2002-06-09 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69616, 2174, 1897, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract framing, and the lighting,   I would play with the tonal range a litle more thought, and a textured background may have been more interesting.  Good use of black and white - 9</td>', 'I like the abstract framing, and the lighting,   I would play with the tonal range a litle more thought, and a textured background may have been more interesting.  Good use of black and white - 9', '2002-06-09 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69617, 2174, 255, '<td valign="top">cool framing and almost cool lighting. i would have liked to see the light coming across the wall and her back and hand a little brighter and the background a little darker to add extra drama. *very* good and creative idea though!</td>', 'cool framing and almost cool lighting. i would have liked to see the light coming across the wall and her back and hand a little brighter and the background a little darker to add extra drama. *very* good and creative idea though!', '2002-06-09 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69618, 2174, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think this is very cool.  I like the sharp slant of light/shadow and only wish it were a little bit more distinct (the shadow a little darker).  It looks like there is some already cut hair on the left shoulder, but I can''t quite tell -- I assume that''s what it is, but I wish it were a tiny bit more obvious.  Still very cool.</td>', 'I think this is very cool.  I like the sharp slant of light/shadow and only wish it were a little bit more distinct (the shadow a little darker).  It looks like there is some already cut hair on the left shoulder, but I can''t quite tell -- I assume that''s what it is, but I wish it were a tiny bit more obvious.  Still very cool.', '2002-06-09 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69619, 2174, 885, '<td valign="top">Oh dudes, it''s really not that hard to cut your hair by yourself :)  <br/><br/>I do have very tall windows (12 foot ceilings and 11 foot windows), but I was still crouched down a bit.  I knew the cut-off elbow thing would get me in trouble.  It was centered in the original shot, but I really wanted to use the 427x640 dimension, because it seemed to be more what I had in mind for the shot, probably because it''s more the dimension of my windows than 480x640.  I also wanted it to be off-center, so I decided to cut off the elbow slightly.  Oh, I also flipped it horizontally so I could look like I was left handed.  I was going for it to be something that was slightly ''off'', to make people think "there''s something wrong with that".  Obviously, people did, but not quite in the way I had hoped :)<br/><br/>I wanted to go back and do it again with the hair clipping on the other shoulder where it might have shown up better, but I never got that light again last week (stupid rain).</td>', 'Oh dudes, it''s really not that hard to cut your hair by yourself :)  I do have very tall windows (12 foot ceilings and 11 foot windows), but I was still crouched down a bit.  I knew the cut-off elbow thing would get me in trouble.  It was centered in the original shot, but I really wanted to use the 427x640 dimension, because it seemed to be more what I had in mind for the shot, probably because it''s more the dimension of my windows than 480x640.  I also wanted it to be off-center, so I decided to cut off the elbow slightly.  Oh, I also flipped it horizontally so I could look like I was left handed.  I was going for it to be something that was slightly ''off'', to make people think "there''s something wrong with that".  Obviously, people did, but not quite in the way I had hoped :)I wanted to go back and do it again with the hair clipping on the other shoulder where it might have shown up better, but I never got that light again last week (stupid rain).', '2002-06-10 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69620, 2174, 885, '<td valign="top">It''s also a somewhat direct rip-off of Arni''s and Gordon''s negative space photos last week.</td>', 'It''s also a somewhat direct rip-off of Arni''s and Gordon''s negative space photos last week.', '2002-06-10 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69621, 2174, 885, '<td valign="top">And I''m not sure how I did that twice :-P</td>', 'And I''m not sure how I did that twice :-P', '2002-06-10 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69622, 2174, 1066, '<td valign="top">Kimbly...your best effort by far and one of my favorites this week...I gave it a 9.<br/><br/>You could have backed off a bit and got her (your?} elbow in there but thats a nit.<br/><br/>You keep this up and we''ll be seeing your photos on the magazines before long :-)<br/><br/>BTW I cut my own hair (what little I have left) and Ted Turner cuts his own hair!!</td>', 'Kimbly...your best effort by far and one of my favorites this week...I gave it a 9.You could have backed off a bit and got her (your?} elbow in there but thats a nit.You keep this up and we''ll be seeing your photos on the magazines before long :-)BTW I cut my own hair (what little I have left) and Ted Turner cuts his own hair!!', '2002-06-10 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69623, 2174, 472, '<td valign="top">i think that anyone that doesn''t understand the use of negative space should have their camera taken away and be enrolled in a class on basic composition.</td>', 'i think that anyone that doesn''t understand the use of negative space should have their camera taken away and be enrolled in a class on basic composition.', '2002-06-10 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69624, 2175, 138, '<td valign="top">ah, shure sm 58, gotta love it</td>', 'ah, shure sm 58, gotta love it', '2002-06-03 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69625, 2175, 1829, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  Makes you feel a sense of what the speaker/singer is portraying.  Now there''s some food for thought!!  (9).</td>', 'Very creative.  Makes you feel a sense of what the speaker/singer is portraying.  Now there''s some food for thought!!  (9).', '2002-06-03 06:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69626, 2175, 1455, '<td valign="top">Nice clear picture.....</td>', 'Nice clear picture.....', '2002-06-03 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69627, 2175, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and background.  I would prefer to have a hand more so in focus.</td>', 'Nice framing and background.  I would prefer to have a hand more so in focus.', '2002-06-03 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69628, 2175, 327, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. I like this idea, it''s a good b&amp;w. Well done.</td>', 'Fun shot. I like this idea, it''s a good b&w. Well done.', '2002-06-03 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69629, 2175, 1759, '<td valign="top">Technically a very good photo, but I''m not so Shure of the subject ;-)</td>', 'Technically a very good photo, but I''m not so Shure of the subject ;-)', '2002-06-03 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69630, 2175, 582, '<td valign="top">As a sound man, I appreciate this shot.  Good focus, nice details.</td>', 'As a sound man, I appreciate this shot.  Good focus, nice details.', '2002-06-03 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69631, 2175, 1031, '<td valign="top">Maybe the most famous mic of all time...</td>', 'Maybe the most famous mic of all time...', '2002-06-04 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69632, 2175, 1882, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp shot.</td>', 'Nice, crisp shot.', '2002-06-04 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69633, 2175, 2000, '<td valign="top">Shure is a big mic.</td>', 'Shure is a big mic.', '2002-06-04 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69634, 2175, 1078, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how much of a macro this is, but it''s clean nonetheless.  I might suggest cropping this to the 427 size and see if that helps cut out a little of the extra white space, but I don''t know if it would be effective or not.  That would also, depending on how you cropped, even a little of the margin between the right of the mic and the top.</td>', 'I don''t know how much of a macro this is, but it''s clean nonetheless.  I might suggest cropping this to the 427 size and see if that helps cut out a little of the extra white space, but I don''t know if it would be effective or not.  That would also, depending on how you cropped, even a little of the margin between the right of the mic and the top.', '2002-06-04 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69635, 2175, 772, '<td valign="top">This photograph is clean... the framing and composition is excellent as well!  This does very well in black and white... the patterns on the microphone cover really stand out nicely!  good work!</td>', 'This photograph is clean... the framing and composition is excellent as well!  This does very well in black and white... the patterns on the microphone cover really stand out nicely!  good work!', '2002-06-04 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69636, 2175, 543, '<td valign="top">Great composition, and no-nit technicals.  My one suggestion is for the B/W conversion - since you''ve gone for pure black shadows on the back of the hand and on the grip of the mic, and have that good, bright gradient background, I''d have darkened up the mids just a little to give the detailed part of the hand a little more weight.  Bumping up your score on 2nd viewing.</td>', 'Great composition, and no-nit technicals.  My one suggestion is for the B/W conversion - since you''ve gone for pure black shadows on the back of the hand and on the grip of the mic, and have that good, bright gradient background, I''d have darkened up the mids just a little to give the detailed part of the hand a little more weight.  Bumping up your score on 2nd viewing.', '2002-06-05 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69637, 2175, 509, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a shot of the mic on a stand as opposed to the hand.  Also, I think a darker background would have been better, but these are just my opinions</td>', 'I would have preferred a shot of the mic on a stand as opposed to the hand.  Also, I think a darker background would have been better, but these are just my opinions', '2002-06-06 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69638, 2175, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the texture of the skin on the hand.</td>', 'I love the texture of the skin on the hand.', '2002-06-06 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69639, 2175, 1944, '<td valign="top">good shot. well composed and exposed!</td>', 'good shot. well composed and exposed!', '2002-06-06 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69640, 2175, 472, '<td valign="top">i would have liked this more without the hand.  for some reason the hand makes it seem like a snapshot.</td>', 'i would have liked this more without the hand.  for some reason the hand makes it seem like a snapshot.', '2002-06-07 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69641, 2175, 1280, '<td valign="top">love it</td>', 'love it', '2002-06-08 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69642, 2175, 1993, '<td valign="top">Nice composition...nice balance of b&amp;w spatial relation.</td>', 'Nice composition...nice balance of b&w spatial relation.', '2002-06-09 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69643, 2175, 1256, '<td valign="top">Good, clear picture, but could be cropped a little more.</td>', 'Good, clear picture, but could be cropped a little more.', '2002-06-09 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69644, 2176, 1829, '<td valign="top">Wonderful live motion shot.  Ummm did the cowboy ever capture that little ole'' calf?</td>', 'Wonderful live motion shot.  Ummm did the cowboy ever capture that little ole'' calf?', '2002-06-03 06:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69645, 2176, 409, '<td valign="top">nice composition -alot of energy.<br/>could have done with a better title</td>', 'nice composition -alot of energy.could have done with a better title', '2002-06-03 08:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69646, 2176, 92, '<td valign="top">What a great subject for a b/w photo ! I REALLY like this one. Just a tat crisper would be nice but that just may be your camera ability. Well done !</td>', 'What a great subject for a b/w photo ! I REALLY like this one. Just a tat crisper would be nice but that just may be your camera ability. Well done !', '2002-06-03 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69647, 2176, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo!  You have captured a lot of excitment in this one... good work!</td>', 'This is a great photo!  You have captured a lot of excitment in this one... good work!', '2002-06-03 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69648, 2176, 573, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject for a B/W photo.</td>', 'Good choice of subject for a B/W photo.', '2002-06-03 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69649, 2176, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I just don''t think black and white is a good medium for action shots.</td>', 'Great shot, but I just don''t think black and white is a good medium for action shots.', '2002-06-03 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(69650, 2176, 203, '<td valign="top">Well done, i am doing a bull riding assignment now.  It is not easy in poor light with a max shutter of 1/1000.</td>', 'Well done, i am doing a bull riding assignment now.  It is not easy in poor light with a max shutter of 1/1000.', '2002-06-03 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69651, 2176, 327, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Action in B&amp;W. Well done.</td>', 'Good capture. Action in B&W. Well done.', '2002-06-03 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69652, 2176, 1211, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Nice cropping.</td>', 'Good shot.  Nice cropping.', '2002-06-03 16:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69653, 2176, 1831, '<td valign="top">Great timing, Great photo.</td>', 'Great timing, Great photo.', '2002-06-03 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69654, 2176, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice job...</td>', 'Nice job...', '2002-06-03 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69655, 2176, 1651, '<td valign="top">giddy up.</td>', 'giddy up.', '2002-06-03 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69656, 2176, 1820, '<td valign="top">Good one!!!</td>', 'Good one!!!', '2002-06-04 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69657, 2176, 661, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  Good stop motion pic.  I think the rodeo works in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  Good stop motion pic.  I think the rodeo works in B&W.', '2002-06-04 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69658, 2176, 811, '<td valign="top">Very good capture of the action.  I like this shot in black and white, and having the background slightly blurry makes the attention focus on teh cowboy.</td>', 'Very good capture of the action.  I like this shot in black and white, and having the background slightly blurry makes the attention focus on teh cowboy.', '2002-06-04 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69659, 2176, 554, '<td valign="top">ALL RIGHT !!! Team Roping!   good job  10</td>', 'ALL RIGHT !!! Team Roping!   good job  10', '2002-06-04 23:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69660, 2176, 258, '<td valign="top">Yee Haa!</td>', 'Yee Haa!', '2002-06-05 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69661, 2176, 1590, '<td valign="top">A good action shot. Nice tonal range.</td>', 'A good action shot. Nice tonal range.', '2002-06-05 05:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69662, 2176, 637, '<td valign="top">Great action and framing.</td>', 'Great action and framing.', '2002-06-05 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69663, 2176, 587, '<td valign="top">good capture, got the whole lasso and you can almost feel the  energy, good job.</td>', 'good capture, got the whole lasso and you can almost feel the  energy, good job.', '2002-06-05 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69664, 2176, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photographs that screams out for color.  Your tonal range is good as is your capture of the action.</td>', 'This is one of those photographs that screams out for color.  Your tonal range is good as is your capture of the action.', '2002-06-05 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69665, 2176, 2023, '<td valign="top">Great action shot!</td>', 'Great action shot!', '2002-06-05 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69666, 2176, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot -- too bad about the off-topic advertising...<br/><br/>Do you know anything about the protective gear the horse is wearing on its forelegs?</td>', 'Nice action shot -- too bad about the off-topic advertising...Do you know anything about the protective gear the horse is wearing on its forelegs?', '2002-06-06 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69667, 2176, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, but the huge DOF makes the bg around the cowboy a little distracting.  Could you have caught the guy who''s roped the cow as well if you''d been in landscape orientation?</td>', 'Nice and sharp, but the huge DOF makes the bg around the cowboy a little distracting.  Could you have caught the guy who''s roped the cow as well if you''d been in landscape orientation?', '2002-06-06 08:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69668, 2176, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice job framing this action shot.</td>', 'Nice job framing this action shot.', '2002-06-07 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69669, 2176, 2093, '<td valign="top">The leash on the cow is distracting.</td>', 'The leash on the cow is distracting.', '2002-06-08 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69670, 2176, 2091, '<td valign="top">Nice capture :)</td>', 'Nice capture :)', '2002-06-09 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69671, 2176, 656, '<td valign="top">great action shot - well captured on the rope too.  Probably better in B&amp;W rather than just shades of brown!</td>', 'great action shot - well captured on the rope too.  Probably better in B&W rather than just shades of brown!', '2002-06-09 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69672, 2177, 1122, '<td valign="top">Great Creative Work</td>', 'Great Creative Work', '2002-06-03 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69673, 2177, 409, '<td valign="top">very interesting textures</td>', 'very interesting textures', '2002-06-03 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69674, 2177, 1848, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like the tonal range. The whte seems to be just a few % below the highlight on the rock. I the composition would feel better for me with a bit more space on the left and the top, right a bottom equal. (bottom is a bit too much.) Another alternative would be more space at the top with right and bottom equal. One criterian I use for B&amp;W is if I would rather see the image with color. This image passes that test easilly, color would be a distraction.</td>', 'Well done. I like the tonal range. The whte seems to be just a few % below the highlight on the rock. I the composition would feel better for me with a bit more space on the left and the top, right a bottom equal. (bottom is a bit too much.) Another alternative would be more space at the top with right and bottom equal. One criterian I use for B&W is if I would rather see the image with color. This image passes that test easilly, color would be a distraction.', '2002-06-03 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69675, 2177, 1, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot, so simple, yet effective.  The waves in the grid work great.</td>', 'Very interesting shot, so simple, yet effective.  The waves in the grid work great.', '2002-06-03 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
