(69740, 2181, 1078, '<td valign="top">So how many people have been suckered into believing it''s a real baby?  While the picture was loading, I was thinking, "The lighting is a little dark, but wow -- that baby looks perfect."  Then I saw the hand, and thought, "Aha -- that''s why it looks perfect."  Like I said, the picture is a little dark.  A simplified background would help, as would a different surface (more simple, perhaps lighter colored) for the "baby" to be resting on.</td>', 'So how many people have been suckered into believing it''s a real baby?  While the picture was loading, I was thinking, "The lighting is a little dark, but wow -- that baby looks perfect."  Then I saw the hand, and thought, "Aha -- that''s why it looks perfect."  Like I said, the picture is a little dark.  A simplified background would help, as would a different surface (more simple, perhaps lighter colored) for the "baby" to be resting on.', '2002-06-05 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
