(69777, 2182, 332, '<td valign="top">Good contrast!</td>', 'Good contrast!', '2002-06-08 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69778, 2182, 587, '<td valign="top">Like how shiny and bright this is, good use of b&amp;w, I think. I wonder what it would have looked like if you had the whole background black? good job.</td>', 'Like how shiny and bright this is, good use of b&w, I think. I wonder what it would have looked like if you had the whole background black? good job.', '2002-06-08 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69779, 2182, 1993, '<td valign="top">Nice. Chrome.  Who would have thought chrome would look so good in B&amp;W.  Fine choice.</td>', 'Nice. Chrome.  Who would have thought chrome would look so good in B&W.  Fine choice.', '2002-06-09 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69780, 2182, 715, '<td valign="top">Chrome objects always look nice in B&amp;W and you have proven that again. Excelent picture.</td>', 'Chrome objects always look nice in B&W and you have proven that again. Excelent picture.', '2002-06-09 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69781, 2182, 1847, '<td valign="top">Precicely the kind of photo black and white makes better.</td>', 'Precicely the kind of photo black and white makes better.', '2002-06-09 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69782, 2182, 1, '<td valign="top">nice shot, very crisp very clear, well done</td>', 'nice shot, very crisp very clear, well done', '2002-06-10 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69783, 2182, 772, '<td valign="top">Vin, congrats and welcome back... haven''t seen you around here lately.. this is a great shot and one of my 10s this week... excellent work as usual :)</td>', 'Vin, congrats and welcome back... haven''t seen you around here lately.. this is a great shot and one of my 10s this week... excellent work as usual :)', '2002-06-10 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69784, 2182, 1569, '<td valign="top">My favorite shot,congratulations!!!</td>', 'My favorite shot,congratulations!!!', '2002-06-10 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69785, 2182, 441, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your votes and comments.  This was a ''grab'' shot a few hours before the challenge expired, saw this machine at Clumber Park, England,  and got permission from the owner to get the shot! - right place . right time and right subject fot B &amp; W!!</td>', 'Thanks for all your votes and comments.  This was a ''grab'' shot a few hours before the challenge expired, saw this machine at Clumber Park, England,  and got permission from the owner to get the shot! - right place . right time and right subject fot B & W!!', '2002-06-10 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69786, 2183, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice view but I think it needs a little more light to make the flower really stand out... It would also offer some more contrast and make the subject JUMP out at me a little harder :)</td>', 'This is a nice view but I think it needs a little more light to make the flower really stand out... It would also offer some more contrast and make the subject JUMP out at me a little harder :)', '2002-06-03 04:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69787, 2183, 1540, '<td valign="top">nice shot but too dark</td>', 'nice shot but too dark', '2002-06-03 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69788, 2183, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w.</td>', 'Neat b&w.', '2002-06-03 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69789, 2183, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I don''t like so much grey though, unless of course that was your goal. Nice job overall.</td>', 'Nice picture, I don''t like so much grey though, unless of course that was your goal. Nice job overall.', '2002-06-03 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69790, 2183, 1211, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, like the long stem.  Could stand to be brighter.  I also wonder why you took a picture of a flower (something usually quite colorful) for a B&amp;W challenge.</td>', 'Cool shot, like the long stem.  Could stand to be brighter.  I also wonder why you took a picture of a flower (something usually quite colorful) for a B&W challenge.', '2002-06-03 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69791, 2183, 1759, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition!  I suggest that there is not enough contrast for the main subject. Perhaps some additional lighting, maybe using a snoot at low power or something to bring out the texture and add some life to it?</td>', 'Really nice composition!  I suggest that there is not enough contrast for the main subject. Perhaps some additional lighting, maybe using a snoot at low power or something to bring out the texture and add some life to it?', '2002-06-03 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69792, 2183, 1313, '<td valign="top">OK pic but too many flower shots here.</td>', 'OK pic but too many flower shots here.', '2002-06-03 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69793, 2183, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast</td>', 'nice contrast', '2002-06-03 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69794, 2183, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice DOF</td>', 'nice DOF', '2002-06-04 00:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69795, 2183, 543, '<td valign="top">Could use some brightness - very flat tonal range.  Nice texture, but the stem leading in from the top draws the eye away from the flower.  You could crop the top away for more impact, IMO.</td>', 'Could use some brightness - very flat tonal range.  Nice texture, but the stem leading in from the top draws the eye away from the flower.  You could crop the top away for more impact, IMO.', '2002-06-04 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69796, 2183, 2, '<td valign="top">I''ve generally liked the images that used black and white to pull out the contrast of their shot, but I really like the dull, almost mysterious mood of your shot.  I love the vertical frame of the photograph, though I wish the flower were horizontally centered.</td>', 'I''ve generally liked the images that used black and white to pull out the contrast of their shot, but I really like the dull, almost mysterious mood of your shot.  I love the vertical frame of the photograph, though I wish the flower were horizontally centered.', '2002-06-04 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69797, 2183, 1750, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite subjects. I like the composition. I would have dodged the petals to get a bit more texture.</td>', 'One of my favorite subjects. I like the composition. I would have dodged the petals to get a bit more texture.', '2002-06-04 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69798, 2183, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, but a little bit too grey (on my monitor).</td>', 'Very nice composition, but a little bit too grey (on my monitor).', '2002-06-05 06:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69799, 2183, 1908, '<td valign="top">good photo but the background is to distracting</td>', 'good photo but the background is to distracting', '2002-06-05 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69800, 2183, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I''m trying to decide the relationship between the title "shallow" or "flat" tone range. Good detail though, not over-sharpened, and I can see it would be hard to lighten it without blowing out the highlights.</td>', 'Hmmm...I''m trying to decide the relationship between the title "shallow" or "flat" tone range. Good detail though, not over-sharpened, and I can see it would be hard to lighten it without blowing out the highlights.', '2002-06-05 23:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69801, 2183, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and dof.  The stem running up the middle is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice contrast and dof.  The stem running up the middle is a little distracting.', '2002-06-06 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69802, 2183, 509, '<td valign="top">To me, this shot needs a bit more contrast to make the flower more predominant.</td>', 'To me, this shot needs a bit more contrast to make the flower more predominant.', '2002-06-07 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69803, 2183, 1, '<td valign="top">Too much dead space at the top, the light vertical stem is distracting.</td>', 'Too much dead space at the top, the light vertical stem is distracting.', '2002-06-08 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69804, 2183, 2103, '<td valign="top">a bit too dark</td>', 'a bit too dark', '2002-06-09 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69805, 2183, 656, '<td valign="top">contrast/ lighting needs work but a good subject for B&amp;W</td>', 'contrast/ lighting needs work but a good subject for B&W', '2002-06-09 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69806, 2183, 1078, '<td valign="top">The whites here, on my machine, look fairly flat.  That would be my major suggestion, a little bit more in the highlight range.  Beyond that, the only thing I find detracts from the photo is the stickthat goes right throught the middle of the shot.  Maybe it wasn''t possible to remove it, but maybe a different angle of the main subject so it wasn''t in the shot?</td>', 'The whites here, on my machine, look fairly flat.  That would be my major suggestion, a little bit more in the highlight range.  Beyond that, the only thing I find detracts from the photo is the stickthat goes right throught the middle of the shot.  Maybe it wasn''t possible to remove it, but maybe a different angle of the main subject so it wasn''t in the shot?', '2002-06-09 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69807, 2184, 1829, '<td valign="top">Three natural subjects in the one shot.  Great work.</td>', 'Three natural subjects in the one shot.  Great work.', '2002-06-03 07:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69808, 2184, 409, '<td valign="top">i love this compostion</td>', 'i love this compostion', '2002-06-03 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69809, 2184, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great shot here.  Love how everything fits into the photo.</td>', 'Great shot here.  Love how everything fits into the photo.', '2002-06-03 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69810, 2184, 2, '<td valign="top">I told you I liked "feel the heat" better, but I really do love how the kid almost seems to be diving into the picture.  You''re hot.</td>', 'I told you I liked "feel the heat" better, but I really do love how the kid almost seems to be diving into the picture.  You''re hot.', '2002-06-03 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69811, 2184, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Nice work. Interesting shot.', '2002-06-03 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69812, 2184, 441, '<td valign="top">good depth in this shot</td>', 'good depth in this shot', '2002-06-03 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69813, 2184, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice use of ROT and placement of objects, however, all three are competing for my attention, and I''m not sure which to focus on.  I know you wanted to show life at the beach, but picking one subject would''ve worked better in my mind.  I like how the boy is about to dive into the water.</td>', 'Nice use of ROT and placement of objects, however, all three are competing for my attention, and I''m not sure which to focus on.  I know you wanted to show life at the beach, but picking one subject would''ve worked better in my mind.  I like how the boy is about to dive into the water.', '2002-06-04 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69814, 2184, 139, '<td valign="top">This photo has a lot going on.  You captured three worlds in one, all three of which are most likely completely unaware of the others.   I love the feeling of this photo.</td>', 'This photo has a lot going on.  You captured three worlds in one, all three of which are most likely completely unaware of the others.   I love the feeling of this photo.', '2002-06-04 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69815, 2184, 587, '<td valign="top">not sure what you want me to look at. Seems almost as if one of the 3 got in the way of your shot. (IMO) I wish the sand wasn''t so out of focus.</td>', 'not sure what you want me to look at. Seems almost as if one of the 3 got in the way of your shot. (IMO) I wish the sand wasn''t so out of focus.', '2002-06-04 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69816, 2184, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I like the color graduation from light to dark in the water...</td>', 'Nice shot!  I like the color graduation from light to dark in the water...', '2002-06-05 00:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69817, 2184, 811, '<td valign="top">My only suggestion is probably impossible, but . . .  If the liner could have been just a bit more to the right, it would have felt more balanced.  the swimmer almost balances it, but he is a lot smaller than the ship.  I really like the way you have gotten three different "uses" of the ocean captured.</td>', 'My only suggestion is probably impossible, but . . .  If the liner could have been just a bit more to the right, it would have felt more balanced.  the swimmer almost balances it, but he is a lot smaller than the ship.  I really like the way you have gotten three different "uses" of the ocean captured.', '2002-06-05 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69818, 2184, 1357, '<td valign="top">If the person in the foreground had more to the left you could of had everthing more central in a triangle shape making this even better. I like the way that everthing is on three layers.</td>', 'If the person in the foreground had more to the left you could of had everthing more central in a triangle shape making this even better. I like the way that everthing is on three layers.', '2002-06-05 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69819, 2184, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2002-06-06 03:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69820, 2184, 1597, '<td valign="top">I bet this looks good in color nice contrast</td>', 'I bet this looks good in color nice contrast', '2002-06-08 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69821, 2184, 1944, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I would have given it a ''9'' if the foreground had been a little more in focus.</td>', 'Nice shot. I would have given it a ''9'' if the foreground had been a little more in focus.', '2002-06-08 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69822, 2184, 2103, '<td valign="top">love the depth. I wish this photo wasnt limited to 480x640<br/>nice job</td>', 'love the depth. I wish this photo wasnt limited to 480x640nice job', '2002-06-09 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69823, 2184, 2091, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, looks like one of the "lower lakers" around here in the Great Lakes, nice capture :)</td>', 'Nice shot, looks like one of the "lower lakers" around here in the Great Lakes, nice capture :)', '2002-06-09 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69824, 2184, 656, '<td valign="top">like the compressed depth and great to have the back/mid/ foreground elements.</td>', 'like the compressed depth and great to have the back/mid/ foreground elements.', '2002-06-09 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69825, 2185, 1122, '<td valign="top">Sweet angelic smile</td>', 'Sweet angelic smile', '2002-06-03 05:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69826, 2185, 1829, '<td valign="top">What a sweetie.  Lovely and clear.</td>', 'What a sweetie.  Lovely and clear.', '2002-06-03 06:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69827, 2185, 92, '<td valign="top">Children can be hard to photography and not everyone can do it well. This is a well done photo. You captured the moment so well. She''s not only a cutie pie... but her personality shows through ! (8)</td>', 'Children can be hard to photography and not everyone can do it well. This is a well done photo. You captured the moment so well. She''s not only a cutie pie... but her personality shows through ! (8)', '2002-06-03 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69828, 2185, 1455, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, she''s such a cutie</td>', 'Wonderful, she''s such a cutie', '2002-06-03 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69829, 2185, 1, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, though it needs some work on the composure side.  The grass on the left seems like waste space.</td>', 'Cute shot, though it needs some work on the composure side.  The grass on the left seems like waste space.', '2002-06-03 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69830, 2185, 1296, '<td valign="top">not grayscale (flower)</td>', 'not grayscale (flower)', '2002-06-03 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69831, 2185, 1360, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2002-06-03 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69832, 2185, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a great b&amp;w portait. Very well done. Congrats to you!!!!</td>', 'Just a great b&w portait. Very well done. Congrats to you!!!!', '2002-06-03 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69833, 2185, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very good job</td>', 'Very good job', '2002-06-03 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69834, 2185, 1547, '<td valign="top">I love the exposure and skin tone. Great job with eye highlight.</td>', 'I love the exposure and skin tone. Great job with eye highlight.', '2002-06-03 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69835, 2185, 1882, '<td valign="top">oh good...another shot of another cute little girl...this time she''s holding a flower...yay!!!!!!!</td>', 'oh good...another shot of another cute little girl...this time she''s holding a flower...yay!!!!!!!', '2002-06-04 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69836, 2185, 587, '<td valign="top">this is wonderful - a winner. I love it just the way it is and would not change a thing. great job.</td>', 'this is wonderful - a winner. I love it just the way it is and would not change a thing. great job.', '2002-06-04 23:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69837, 2185, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice.. the lighting is perfect and the composition and focus are excellent as well :)</td>', 'Very nice.. the lighting is perfect and the composition and focus are excellent as well :)', '2002-06-05 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69838, 2185, 907, '<td valign="top">beautiful. well done.</td>', 'beautiful. well done.', '2002-06-05 15:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69839, 2185, 1658, '<td valign="top">The composition really makes this shot for me.  I like that her hand and the flower are sharper than her.  Nicely done.</td>', 'The composition really makes this shot for me.  I like that her hand and the flower are sharper than her.  Nicely done.', '2002-06-05 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69840, 2185, 854, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the face. For some reason, she looks a little mischevious.</td>', 'Great expression on the face. For some reason, she looks a little mischevious.', '2002-06-06 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69841, 2185, 1707, '<td valign="top">Such a cute girl!  She must make her parents very happy!</td>', 'Such a cute girl!  She must make her parents very happy!', '2002-06-06 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69842, 2185, 543, '<td valign="top">I envy you the cooperative child.  Mine actually will look in the direction of the camera - if anyone other than me is holding it.  I really like what you''ve done here.  Might have been better without the flash, as it makes those pinpoint highlights in her eyes, but that''s not a biggie.  Kind of wish her hand were a little more to the right so it didn''t block so much of her mouth and the stem didn''t cross her eye, but it''s effective, in a way.  She''s looking at the viewer through the flower.  If you were to print this, I''d leave the flower colored, as the rest is slightly soft.  Very nice.</td>', 'I envy you the cooperative child.  Mine actually will look in the direction of the camera - if anyone other than me is holding it.  I really like what you''ve done here.  Might have been better without the flash, as it makes those pinpoint highlights in her eyes, but that''s not a biggie.  Kind of wish her hand were a little more to the right so it didn''t block so much of her mouth and the stem didn''t cross her eye, but it''s effective, in a way.  She''s looking at the viewer through the flower.  If you were to print this, I''d leave the flower colored, as the rest is slightly soft.  Very nice.', '2002-06-06 07:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69843, 2185, 885, '<td valign="top">there''s just a hint of color in there, isn''t there?</td>', 'there''s just a hint of color in there, isn''t there?', '2002-06-06 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69844, 2185, 806, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - a keeper! What I would give to have a shot of my children like this!</td>', 'Beautiful - a keeper! What I would give to have a shot of my children like this!', '2002-06-06 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69845, 2185, 917, '<td valign="top">The focus on the flower really makes this work for me.</td>', 'The focus on the flower really makes this work for me.', '2002-06-07 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69846, 2185, 1005, '<td valign="top">Best of the little girl shots!  Good skin ?color?, very good focus, nice subject and the flower is a great touch.   Photo 10 Creativity 8 B&amp;W 10 total 10</td>', 'Best of the little girl shots!  Good skin ?color?, very good focus, nice subject and the flower is a great touch.   Photo 10 Creativity 8 B&W 10 total 10', '2002-06-07 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69847, 2185, 1944, '<td valign="top">I''m not a great fan of kid''s portraits, but this one is excellent.</td>', 'I''m not a great fan of kid''s portraits, but this one is excellent.', '2002-06-08 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69848, 2185, 1856, '<td valign="top">great composition...the lighting/contrast could be a little better for my untrained eye.  Adorable little girl.</td>', 'great composition...the lighting/contrast could be a little better for my untrained eye.  Adorable little girl.', '2002-06-08 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69849, 2185, 527, '<td valign="top">I know there is some color on the flower but I think it is excellently handled. A definite 10 from me. Great cropping.</td>', 'I know there is some color on the flower but I think it is excellently handled. A definite 10 from me. Great cropping.', '2002-06-10 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(69850, 2185, 1226, '<td valign="top">To all who asked, yes there is a hint of color. I adjusted it as I would a sepia pic, and then removed most of the saturation from that. It is almost like adding a trace drop of a single color to a chemical wash. Just enough to give a hint without actually givning a full color.</td>', 'To all who asked, yes there is a hint of color. I adjusted it as I would a sepia pic, and then removed most of the saturation from that. It is almost like adding a trace drop of a single color to a chemical wash. Just enough to give a hint without actually givning a full color.', '2002-06-10 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(69851, 2186, 409, '<td valign="top">nice contrast..</td>', 'nice contrast..', '2002-06-03 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69852, 2186, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great focus, perfect dof, Great contrast.  Overall a 10.</td>', 'Great focus, perfect dof, Great contrast.  Overall a 10.', '2002-06-03 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69853, 2186, 573, '<td valign="top">Clean crisp detail and full tonal range.  I realy like the uncluttered composition.</td>', 'Clean crisp detail and full tonal range.  I realy like the uncluttered composition.', '2002-06-03 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69854, 2186, 327, '<td valign="top">Not sure who his is, but this is a good b&amp;w. Well done my friend. Nice work.</td>', 'Not sure who his is, but this is a good b&w. Well done my friend. Nice work.', '2002-06-03 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69855, 2186, 1585, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear. Great scale use.</td>', 'Nice and clear. Great scale use.', '2002-06-03 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69856, 2186, 737, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Very clean photo, good lighting. A top 10.</td>', 'Excellent. Very clean photo, good lighting. A top 10.', '2002-06-03 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69857, 2186, 441, '<td valign="top">nice detail</td>', 'nice detail', '2002-06-03 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69858, 2186, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very artistic. Good job!</td>', 'Very artistic. Good job!', '2002-06-03 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69859, 2186, 1313, '<td valign="top">Oh no math!  OK pic at least its different.</td>', 'Oh no math!  OK pic at least its different.', '2002-06-03 20:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69860, 2186, 1907, '<td valign="top">i think 4/2.2 doesn''t equal 1.3/3 :)</td>', 'i think 4/2.2 doesn''t equal 1.3/3 :)', '2002-06-04 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69861, 2186, 1882, '<td valign="top">good job.  Expert clarity and positioning.  The best photo of a compass I''ve seen in...well, forever...</td>', 'good job.  Expert clarity and positioning.  The best photo of a compass I''ve seen in...well, forever...', '2002-06-04 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69862, 2186, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the subject -- a litle over-sharpened for my taste, though. Also, I have one of these -- I think this version is technically known as a "bow-pencil" -- mine has a cool double-nibbed india ink tip which attaches where the lead is...</td>', 'I like the subject -- a litle over-sharpened for my taste, though. Also, I have one of these -- I think this version is technically known as a "bow-pencil" -- mine has a cool double-nibbed india ink tip which attaches where the lead is...', '2002-06-04 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69863, 2186, 811, '<td valign="top">Good sharp focus and composed well.</td>', 'Good sharp focus and composed well.', '2002-06-04 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69864, 2186, 258, '<td valign="top">Mechanical engineering?  Very nice photo.</td>', 'Mechanical engineering?  Very nice photo.', '2002-06-04 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69865, 2186, 772, '<td valign="top">Wonderful compositoin and clarity on this photo... the soft shadows work very nicely here!  This is one of the best photos out here this week... great job!</td>', 'Wonderful compositoin and clarity on this photo... the soft shadows work very nicely here!  This is one of the best photos out here this week... great job!', '2002-06-05 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69866, 2186, 1658, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I am especially impressed with curves and lines of the subject.</td>', 'Great shot!  I am especially impressed with curves and lines of the subject.', '2002-06-05 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
