(69886, 2187, 1897, '<td valign="top">Turn off the date stamp!  It could use a little contrast adjustment to help this great composition "pop" out a little more.</td>', 'Turn off the date stamp!  It could use a little contrast adjustment to help this great composition "pop" out a little more.', '2002-06-03 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69887, 2187, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get this comment a lot (again), but the date print is REALLY distracting.  Most camera''s have the option to turn it off, if yours does, I would turn it off for the dpchallenge shots.   You can prove the date (if need be) through the information your camera stores about the date.  Now, moving beyond that, this is a nice picture, good composition.  Have you tried adjusting the levels just a little more so that the wall would look more white?  Maybe just lighten the whole shot.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get this comment a lot (again), but the date print is REALLY distracting.  Most camera''s have the option to turn it off, if yours does, I would turn it off for the dpchallenge shots.   You can prove the date (if need be) through the information your camera stores about the date.  Now, moving beyond that, this is a nice picture, good composition.  Have you tried adjusting the levels just a little more so that the wall would look more white?  Maybe just lighten the whole shot.', '2002-06-03 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69888, 2187, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but your date stamp doesn''t help the image out any.</td>', 'Cool shot, but your date stamp doesn''t help the image out any.', '2002-06-03 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
