(69892, 2187, 1211, '<td valign="top">Boy, this is a really cool shot that is spoiled by that date stamp.  I''ll bet your camera has a way to get rid of that.</td>', 'Boy, this is a really cool shot that is spoiled by that date stamp.  I''ll bet your camera has a way to get rid of that.', '2002-06-03 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69893, 2187, 587, '<td valign="top">Get rid of your date stamp!  Perhaps if this was a touch brighter - great photo otherwise. good job.</td>', 'Get rid of your date stamp!  Perhaps if this was a touch brighter - great photo otherwise. good job.', '2002-06-03 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69894, 2187, 1336, '<td valign="top">do yourself a favor and turn the date "feature" off in your future pictures.  this would have been a really nice photo without it.</td>', 'do yourself a favor and turn the date "feature" off in your future pictures.  this would have been a really nice photo without it.', '2002-06-04 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69895, 2187, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have tried to brighten the background wall a little, or else maybe darken it to look more like a closet or back shelf...</td>', 'I think I''d have tried to brighten the background wall a little, or else maybe darken it to look more like a closet or back shelf...', '2002-06-04 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69896, 2187, 543, '<td valign="top">Of course, the date stamp has to go.  A very good subject for B/W - lots of texture and curves to catch light.  Avaliable light was a good choice, too.  Sadly, the tonal range is limited to black - middle gray, so most of the detail and play of light doesn''t show.</td>', 'Of course, the date stamp has to go.  A very good subject for B/W - lots of texture and curves to catch light.  Avaliable light was a good choice, too.  Sadly, the tonal range is limited to black - middle gray, so most of the detail and play of light doesn''t show.', '2002-06-04 06:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69897, 2187, 1882, '<td valign="top">uh, the date on the photo does not sit well with me.  I would have definitely cropped that out!</td>', 'uh, the date on the photo does not sit well with me.  I would have definitely cropped that out!', '2002-06-04 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69898, 2187, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the ttexture in this photograph.  This was the perfect subject for black and white.</td>', 'I love the ttexture in this photograph.  This was the perfect subject for black and white.', '2002-06-04 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69899, 2187, 92, '<td valign="top">A wonderful photo. A *little* more light and the removal of the date ON the photo would make it perfect:)</td>', 'A wonderful photo. A *little* more light and the removal of the date ON the photo would make it perfect:)', '2002-06-04 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69900, 2187, 1078, '<td valign="top">This would have been a contender, except for two things: first the date stamp -- it''s great for memory photos where you want the date on the picture, but not so good for artwork.  I''d turn it off if possible.  Second, I think that wall needs to be a lot brighter -- adjusting the levels to fix that would also lighten the jug a little.  To test what I''m saying, I saved the photo and used PS''s auto levels and it looks great.</td>', 'This would have been a contender, except for two things: first the date stamp -- it''s great for memory photos where you want the date on the picture, but not so good for artwork.  I''d turn it off if possible.  Second, I think that wall needs to be a lot brighter -- adjusting the levels to fix that would also lighten the jug a little.  To test what I''m saying, I saved the photo and used PS''s auto levels and it looks great.', '2002-06-04 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69901, 2187, 641, '<td valign="top">good shot, too bad about the annoying time stamp.</td>', 'good shot, too bad about the annoying time stamp.', '2002-06-04 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69902, 2187, 806, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous....except for the date at the bottom! Yikes! Please reshoot this if you can, or get rid of the date somehow, and this would sell!</td>', 'This is gorgeous....except for the date at the bottom! Yikes! Please reshoot this if you can, or get rid of the date somehow, and this would sell!', '2002-06-04 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
