(69905, 2187, 1750, '<td valign="top">Can you cancel that date stamp? It detracts from the photograph.</td>', 'Can you cancel that date stamp? It detracts from the photograph.', '2002-06-06 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69906, 2187, 1037, '<td valign="top">This would be an excellent photo without that date there, but since you''re not allowed to remove it at least through editing for the contest I''ll ignore it. Beautiful pottery, nicely framed, with nice soft lighting to bring out the texture of the clay. Perhaps a little too dark (on my monitor).</td>', 'This would be an excellent photo without that date there, but since you''re not allowed to remove it at least through editing for the contest I''ll ignore it. Beautiful pottery, nicely framed, with nice soft lighting to bring out the texture of the clay. Perhaps a little too dark (on my monitor).', '2002-06-06 02:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69907, 2187, 637, '<td valign="top">Lose the date!</td>', 'Lose the date!', '2002-06-06 03:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69908, 2187, 811, '<td valign="top">This is actually a very good picture, I think.  The balance and composition is very effective, though it may be a little flat.  If you had a way to make the subtle shadow a little stronger, it may give it some depth.  Not sure.  Next time turn the date off, or make the picture big enough so that it can be cropped out. :-)</td>', 'This is actually a very good picture, I think.  The balance and composition is very effective, though it may be a little flat.  If you had a way to make the subtle shadow a little stronger, it may give it some depth.  Not sure.  Next time turn the date off, or make the picture big enough so that it can be cropped out. :-)', '2002-06-06 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
