(69936, 2188, 543, '<td valign="top">Yes, you do.  Out in the world you could clean up those specks at UR.  Maybe darken up his spots a little.  Great composition, light and focus control.</td>', 'Yes, you do.  Out in the world you could clean up those specks at UR.  Maybe darken up his spots a little.  Great composition, light and focus control.', '2002-06-06 13:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
