(69958, 2190, 1882, '<td valign="top">Now, THAT''S  a great shot!  Awesome!</td>', 'Now, THAT''S  a great shot!  Awesome!', '2002-06-04 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69959, 2190, 1078, '<td valign="top">Really cool.  I wish there was a little more shadow in it to balance out all the light, but I don''t think it''s possible to do without spot touches.  The only element I''d say detracts is the patch of sunlight in the water in the lower right.  But, you can''t really do anything about that without losing the reflections on the ceiling.  Maybe a smaller crop that cuts it out?  All just suggestions -- good shot.</td>', 'Really cool.  I wish there was a little more shadow in it to balance out all the light, but I don''t think it''s possible to do without spot touches.  The only element I''d say detracts is the patch of sunlight in the water in the lower right.  But, you can''t really do anything about that without losing the reflections on the ceiling.  Maybe a smaller crop that cuts it out?  All just suggestions -- good shot.', '2002-06-04 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69960, 2190, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect. I the pattern the reflection of those rocks through the arch or just from the wavelets?</td>', 'Very cool effect. I the pattern the reflection of those rocks through the arch or just from the wavelets?', '2002-06-04 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69961, 2190, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat.  I admit I don''t know quite what it is, but I like the repeating patterns between the tiles/stones? and the reflections.</td>', 'Neat.  I admit I don''t know quite what it is, but I like the repeating patterns between the tiles/stones? and the reflections.', '2002-06-04 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69962, 2190, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple geometry and very nice reflections - you have the knack of thinking in B/W.  The patch of sunlight on the water at R is a shame.  I can''t help but wonder how this would look from the other side of the creek.</td>', 'Nice, simple geometry and very nice reflections - you have the knack of thinking in B/W.  The patch of sunlight on the water at R is a shame.  I can''t help but wonder how this would look from the other side of the creek.', '2002-06-05 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69963, 2190, 772, '<td valign="top">The reflections in this photo add a nice touch!  Good job!</td>', 'The reflections in this photo add a nice touch!  Good job!', '2002-06-05 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69964, 2190, 1446, '<td valign="top">Good contrast.  Something seems to be cutting this photograph in half horizontally.</td>', 'Good contrast.  Something seems to be cutting this photograph in half horizontally.', '2002-06-05 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69965, 2190, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the pattern of the shadows on the top, and the way this picture is framed is nice also.  The only thing that would improve it is the way the light shines in on teh right, but I fully recognize that that is out of your control, and would probably change the picture dramatically.</td>', 'I really like the pattern of the shadows on the top, and the way this picture is framed is nice also.  The only thing that would improve it is the way the light shines in on teh right, but I fully recognize that that is out of your control, and would probably change the picture dramatically.', '2002-06-05 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69966, 2190, 1175, '<td valign="top">Kind of interesting in an abstract sort of way.  I wish that light on the water to the right wasn''t there.  Also would have enjoyed some more contrast.</td>', 'Kind of interesting in an abstract sort of way.  I wish that light on the water to the right wasn''t there.  Also would have enjoyed some more contrast.', '2002-06-05 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69967, 2190, 139, '<td valign="top">Great work.  This photo is so full of interesting structures that I''m glad there is no central focus.  My eye doesn''t rest on any one part of the photo, and in this case that''s a good thing, because everything I look at is interesting.</td>', 'Great work.  This photo is so full of interesting structures that I''m glad there is no central focus.  My eye doesn''t rest on any one part of the photo, and in this case that''s a good thing, because everything I look at is interesting.', '2002-06-06 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69968, 2190, 1908, '<td valign="top">love the shapes and lighting</td>', 'love the shapes and lighting', '2002-06-06 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69969, 2190, 472, '<td valign="top">the reflection and abstract graphical forms are compelling and give this iamge a good score.</td>', 'the reflection and abstract graphical forms are compelling and give this iamge a good score.', '2002-06-06 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69970, 2190, 1037, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is very nice! It reminds me of the turkish baths scene from the Orson Welles version of Othello. Another to go in my 10s :)</td>', 'Oh, this is very nice! It reminds me of the turkish baths scene from the Orson Welles version of Othello. Another to go in my 10s :)', '2002-06-06 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69971, 2190, 1944, '<td valign="top">Just a beautiful picture. I love it.</td>', 'Just a beautiful picture. I love it.', '2002-06-06 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
