(69975, 2190, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shadow play!  Nothing to critique, personally I would have centered on the reflection and left the view guessing about the source, but your choice was good, too.  Photo 10 Creativity 9 B&amp;W 9 total 9</td>', 'Great shadow play!  Nothing to critique, personally I would have centered on the reflection and left the view guessing about the source, but your choice was good, too.  Photo 10 Creativity 9 B&W 9 total 9', '2002-06-07 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
