(69995, 2191, 641, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Not that you could have controlled it, but if the branches on the left weren''t there I think it would be better.</td>', 'Cool shot. Not that you could have controlled it, but if the branches on the left weren''t there I think it would be better.', '2002-06-05 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69996, 2191, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great use of light.  Did you use a star filter? Very good contrast IMO.  The tree kind of cuts the shot right up the middle, but I am not sure you had a lot of choice about that to maintain context.  I gave this one an 8.</td>', 'Great use of light.  Did you use a star filter? Very good contrast IMO.  The tree kind of cuts the shot right up the middle, but I am not sure you had a lot of choice about that to maintain context.  I gave this one an 8.', '2002-06-05 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69997, 2191, 1897, '<td valign="top">I like the tones of this.  Are getting any comments about the tree being too dark?  It looks great to me.  Bery good texture on the bark.  This would make a nice print.</td>', 'I like the tones of this.  Are getting any comments about the tree being too dark?  It looks great to me.  Bery good texture on the bark.  This would make a nice print.', '2002-06-05 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69998, 2191, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good job of incorporating but limiting the sun flare.<br/><br/>Do you know what kind of pine this is? I have a similar shot somewhere of a Monterey Pine we planted after Christmas when I was about 10 -- it''s thick branches start much lower than these...</td>', 'Good job of incorporating but limiting the sun flare.Do you know what kind of pine this is? I have a similar shot somewhere of a Monterey Pine we planted after Christmas when I was about 10 -- it''s thick branches start much lower than these...', '2002-06-06 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(69999, 2191, 885, '<td valign="top">Sun star makes it a lot more interesting.</td>', 'Sun star makes it a lot more interesting.', '2002-06-06 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70000, 2191, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  Offers the viewer the feel of really tall, nicely done.  I got no idea how to improve this shot, or even if it needs improvement.  It''s less than a "jump out and get you" subject, but there is appeal, so that''s really all I can say constructive or other.  Photo 9 Creativity 6 B&amp;W 8 total 7</td>', 'Really nice.  Offers the viewer the feel of really tall, nicely done.  I got no idea how to improve this shot, or even if it needs improvement.  It''s less than a "jump out and get you" subject, but there is appeal, so that''s really all I can say constructive or other.  Photo 9 Creativity 6 B&W 8 total 7', '2002-06-07 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70001, 2191, 1256, '<td valign="top">I love the angle that you shot this from and the "star" of light.  Very well done.</td>', 'I love the angle that you shot this from and the "star" of light.  Very well done.', '2002-06-09 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70002, 2191, 656, '<td valign="top">lens flare works well for this shot</td>', 'lens flare works well for this shot', '2002-06-09 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70003, 2191, 1, '<td valign="top">nice shot, you used the sun to your advantage.</td>', 'nice shot, you used the sun to your advantage.', '2002-06-10 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70004, 2192, 772, '<td valign="top">I am able to see this caterpillar nest but it is quite difficult with the bright and dark contrasts throughout the photo... I''m not sure how this could be improved on this particular view...</td>', 'I am able to see this caterpillar nest but it is quite difficult with the bright and dark contrasts throughout the photo... I''m not sure how this could be improved on this particular view...', '2002-06-03 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70005, 2192, 1863, '<td valign="top">(This is my first comment ever!) I''d like to just say that I feel there is a minor problem with this picture because it all seems to blend in, and I can''t really tell what you were trying to do. I''ve been staring at it for about five minutes now, and I can''t decide what it is, and what all the fuzzy things are meant to be. -Annida</td>', '(This is my first comment ever!) I''d like to just say that I feel there is a minor problem with this picture because it all seems to blend in, and I can''t really tell what you were trying to do. I''ve been staring at it for about five minutes now, and I can''t decide what it is, and what all the fuzzy things are meant to be. -Annida', '2002-06-03 04:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70006, 2192, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great photo, however, looks very busy to my eyes.  Good job though.</td>', 'Great photo, however, looks very busy to my eyes.  Good job though.', '2002-06-03 06:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70007, 2192, 318, '<td valign="top">Too much clutter,  getting closer and/or using shallower depth would have made it better</td>', 'Too much clutter,  getting closer and/or using shallower depth would have made it better', '2002-06-03 07:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70008, 2192, 409, '<td valign="top">eeewww   hahaa  gory<br/>a close-up would have been interesting</td>', 'eeewww   hahaa  gorya close-up would have been interesting', '2002-06-03 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70009, 2192, 1455, '<td valign="top">Are those Spiders?  If so you must have been watching that nest sack for some time......</td>', 'Are those Spiders?  If so you must have been watching that nest sack for some time......', '2002-06-03 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70010, 2192, 1540, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but  too busy</td>', 'nice shot, but  too busy', '2002-06-03 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70011, 2192, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this is an awesome shot in color (could you post that somewhere after the comp?  I would love to see it), but IMO it does not work in b&amp;w.  Too busy, too little contrast.</td>', 'I''m sure this is an awesome shot in color (could you post that somewhere after the comp?  I would love to see it), but IMO it does not work in b&w.  Too busy, too little contrast.', '2002-06-03 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70012, 2192, 1, '<td valign="top">The caterpillar''s are lost in the confusion of the branches.  If you''re going to shoot b/w you need a large distinction between your subject and background.</td>', 'The caterpillar''s are lost in the confusion of the branches.  If you''re going to shoot b/w you need a large distinction between your subject and background.', '2002-06-03 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70013, 2192, 1211, '<td valign="top">Subject gets lost amongst the leaves.</td>', 'Subject gets lost amongst the leaves.', '2002-06-03 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70014, 2192, 1175, '<td valign="top">That just looks nasty.  I wish it was closer.</td>', 'That just looks nasty.  I wish it was closer.', '2002-06-03 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70015, 2192, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w. Good job.<br/>--still it gives me the creeps!</td>', 'Neat b&w. Good job.--still it gives me the creeps!', '2002-06-03 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70016, 2192, 1024, '<td valign="top">The background is very busy and its hard to isolate the subject.</td>', 'The background is very busy and its hard to isolate the subject.', '2002-06-04 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
