(70019, 2192, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but without the color to differentiate, I think the leaves really distract.  Cropped in tighter on the caterpillars would have been a lot better, I think.</td>', 'Nice lighting, but without the color to differentiate, I think the leaves really distract.  Cropped in tighter on the caterpillars would have been a lot better, I think.', '2002-06-04 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70020, 2192, 811, '<td valign="top">It''s almost too hard to see teh catepillars with all of the limbs.  I''m not sure how you could correct that, but they kinda blend in with the branches.</td>', 'It''s almost too hard to see teh catepillars with all of the limbs.  I''m not sure how you could correct that, but they kinda blend in with the branches.', '2002-06-04 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70021, 2192, 661, '<td valign="top">The effect is a little lost in the leaves.</td>', 'The effect is a little lost in the leaves.', '2002-06-04 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70022, 2192, 543, '<td valign="top">This would make an interesting abstract if it were a little more vague, but as a nature shot I think the subject is completely overwhelmed by the background.  Probably shows better in color.  Cropped very tight it might work in B/W.  Contrast is very good.</td>', 'This would make an interesting abstract if it were a little more vague, but as a nature shot I think the subject is completely overwhelmed by the background.  Probably shows better in color.  Cropped very tight it might work in B/W.  Contrast is very good.', '2002-06-05 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70023, 2192, 1590, '<td valign="top">Absolutely no idea what this. But I like it. Nice tonal range.</td>', 'Absolutely no idea what this. But I like it. Nice tonal range.', '2002-06-05 05:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70024, 2192, 587, '<td valign="top">hard to see what is happening here, would like to have it either lighter or closer to see the details and help distinguish the different objects.</td>', 'hard to see what is happening here, would like to have it either lighter or closer to see the details and help distinguish the different objects.', '2002-06-05 11:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70025, 2192, 1446, '<td valign="top">Not enough definition in this photograph for my tastes.  Seems kind of all over washed out.</td>', 'Not enough definition in this photograph for my tastes.  Seems kind of all over washed out.', '2002-06-05 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70026, 2192, 1031, '<td valign="top">Too bad they wouldn''t wait for a day with a little more diffuse lighting to make your job easier...I thnk maybe I''d have cropped tighter...</td>', 'Too bad they wouldn''t wait for a day with a little more diffuse lighting to make your job easier...I thnk maybe I''d have cropped tighter...', '2002-06-05 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70027, 2192, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy photo. It took me a while to decide that these are caterpillars (am I right?).</td>', 'This is a very busy photo. It took me a while to decide that these are caterpillars (am I right?).', '2002-06-06 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70028, 2192, 1944, '<td valign="top">A little busy. Needs a focal point for the eye to rest on.</td>', 'A little busy. Needs a focal point for the eye to rest on.', '2002-06-06 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70029, 2192, 917, '<td valign="top">I think colour would have helped this along.</td>', 'I think colour would have helped this along.', '2002-06-07 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70030, 2192, 715, '<td valign="top">Good piocture, but I think it would have been better if you would have gotten closer to the caterpilars. All the branches and leaves are distracting.</td>', 'Good piocture, but I think it would have been better if you would have gotten closer to the caterpilars. All the branches and leaves are distracting.', '2002-06-07 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70031, 2192, 878, '<td valign="top">It looks like some kind of alien. This is a pretty busy shot and all the branches are taking me away from the growth thingy in the middle of the photo.  There is lots of detail and nice shades of grey in this photo.</td>', 'It looks like some kind of alien. This is a pretty busy shot and all the branches are taking me away from the growth thingy in the middle of the photo.  There is lots of detail and nice shades of grey in this photo.', '2002-06-07 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70032, 2192, 2082, '<td valign="top">The lack of contrast between the subject and the background makes it difficult for the eye to latch on to anything.</td>', 'The lack of contrast between the subject and the background makes it difficult for the eye to latch on to anything.', '2002-06-09 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70033, 2192, 1897, '<td valign="top">great brightness range, but a cluttered image</td>', 'great brightness range, but a cluttered image', '2002-06-09 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70034, 2192, 2103, '<td valign="top">the disgusting wermies blend too much</td>', 'the disgusting wermies blend too much', '2002-06-09 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70035, 2192, 1078, '<td valign="top">This is one of two photos I''m making the B&amp;W vs. Color statement about.  You are more than welcome to flame me once the votings over (although I''d really appreciate it if you didn''t -- but I''d be happy to talk about it).  Lots of good contrast -- I think maybe too much.  The caterpillars just kind of blend into everything else.  I wonder if this shot in color is easier to read because you have the colors of the caterpillars to set them apart from the branches and leaves.  Perhaps not, I just don''t know without being able to see the original.  Otherwise, very clean shot -- nice focus and good tones.</td>', 'This is one of two photos I''m making the B&W vs. Color statement about.  You are more than welcome to flame me once the votings over (although I''d really appreciate it if you didn''t -- but I''d be happy to talk about it).  Lots of good contrast -- I think maybe too much.  The caterpillars just kind of blend into everything else.  I wonder if this shot in color is easier to read because you have the colors of the caterpillars to set them apart from the branches and leaves.  Perhaps not, I just don''t know without being able to see the original.  Otherwise, very clean shot -- nice focus and good tones.', '2002-06-09 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70036, 2192, 656, '<td valign="top">great textures</td>', 'great textures', '2002-06-09 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70037, 2193, 1211, '<td valign="top">Probably could have used unsharp mask to really make this look good.</td>', 'Probably could have used unsharp mask to really make this look good.', '2002-06-03 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70038, 2193, 203, '<td valign="top">Molly requires focus.  She deserves better.</td>', 'Molly requires focus.  She deserves better.', '2002-06-03 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70039, 2193, 327, '<td valign="top">Molly. What a sweet looking dog and aren''t you lucky she''s b&amp;w. &amp;lt;lol&amp;gt; Fine work, job well done.</td>', 'Molly. What a sweet looking dog and aren''t you lucky she''s b&w. &lt;lol&gt; Fine work, job well done.', '2002-06-03 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70040, 2193, 518, '<td valign="top">You caught the Border Collie "eye"</td>', 'You caught the Border Collie "eye"', '2002-06-03 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70041, 2193, 543, '<td valign="top">This one could use just a little *less* contrast.  The hightlights on her muzzle are blown out, and there''s no detail in the fur around her eye.  Judging from the grass and the fur on her back at the URHC, the focus was behind the subject.  Nicely composed, though, and she''s a beautiful dog.</td>', 'This one could use just a little *less* contrast.  The hightlights on her muzzle are blown out, and there''s no detail in the fur around her eye.  Judging from the grass and the fur on her back at the URHC, the focus was behind the subject.  Nicely composed, though, and she''s a beautiful dog.', '2002-06-04 06:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70042, 2193, 1882, '<td valign="top">well, well, a family shot of the dog...how creative....zzzzz</td>', 'well, well, a family shot of the dog...how creative....zzzzz', '2002-06-04 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70043, 2193, 772, '<td valign="top">Molly is cute :)  I''ll have to say that I like the soft focus on this shot!!  Good work!</td>', 'Molly is cute :)  I''ll have to say that I like the soft focus on this shot!!  Good work!', '2002-06-04 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70044, 2193, 587, '<td valign="top">not the most interesting of poses for a dog but good clarity. good job.</td>', 'not the most interesting of poses for a dog but good clarity. good job.', '2002-06-04 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70045, 2193, 554, '<td valign="top">9</td>', '9', '2002-06-04 23:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70046, 2193, 1590, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for a border collie. Nice shot, handsome dog.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for a border collie. Nice shot, handsome dog.', '2002-06-05 05:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70047, 2193, 441, '<td valign="top">focus slightly missed - hairs at top right look sharper, difficult subjects to get spot on.</td>', 'focus slightly missed - hairs at top right look sharper, difficult subjects to get spot on.', '2002-06-05 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
