(70138, 2198, 1037, '<td valign="top">A bit more tonal depth would have helped this, ie deepening the darker shades to black to outline the eyes, nose, ears, and the planks of wood. The cat is beautiful and sleek.</td>', 'A bit more tonal depth would have helped this, ie deepening the darker shades to black to outline the eyes, nose, ears, and the planks of wood. The cat is beautiful and sleek.', '2002-06-06 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
