(70142, 2198, 1681, '<td valign="top">A good b&amp;w usually needs some BLACKS and some WHITES.  Not enough contrast or range to interest me.  I do like the composition and the position of the cat.  I may have moved her(him?) a little to the left to enhance the composition a little.</td>', 'A good b&w usually needs some BLACKS and some WHITES.  Not enough contrast or range to interest me.  I do like the composition and the position of the cat.  I may have moved her(him?) a little to the left to enhance the composition a little.', '2002-06-09 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
