(70149, 2199, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great contrast.  Good dof. Nice use of lines to draw your eye into the photograph, but they dont seem to take me anywhere.  Overall I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Great contrast.  Good dof. Nice use of lines to draw your eye into the photograph, but they dont seem to take me anywhere.  Overall I gave you a 7.', '2002-06-05 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70150, 2199, 1658, '<td valign="top">The light of the fence against the dark of the trees behind make give this shot nice balance.</td>', 'The light of the fence against the dark of the trees behind make give this shot nice balance.', '2002-06-05 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70151, 2199, 1042, '<td valign="top">I really like this and I can''t get all techy on you but I''ll tell you what I like. I like the detail in the posts and the shadow on the road and the detail of the grass and even the rocks of what looks like the ocean shoreline in the background. I think the contrast is great and I like the way the fence cuts through the photo. Great Job in my opinion.</td>', 'I really like this and I can''t get all techy on you but I''ll tell you what I like. I like the detail in the posts and the shadow on the road and the detail of the grass and even the rocks of what looks like the ocean shoreline in the background. I think the contrast is great and I like the way the fence cuts through the photo. Great Job in my opinion.', '2002-06-06 00:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70152, 2199, 543, '<td valign="top">Good subject, and nice tones.  Maybe a bit more angle to the fence, to have it complete the diagonal to the URHC?  Horizon looks wickedly tilted, but not too noticable.  Nice work.</td>', 'Good subject, and nice tones.  Maybe a bit more angle to the fence, to have it complete the diagonal to the URHC?  Horizon looks wickedly tilted, but not too noticable.  Nice work.', '2002-06-09 04:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
