(70155, 2199, 312, '<td valign="top">marc, this is a great shot. my only wish is that the sky weren''t so grey. otherwise, all the other contrasts are great, the depth of field is sweet, and the angle is perfection. great shot.</td>', 'marc, this is a great shot. my only wish is that the sky weren''t so grey. otherwise, all the other contrasts are great, the depth of field is sweet, and the angle is perfection. great shot.', '2002-06-10 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
