(70159, 2200, 92, '<td valign="top">What a sweet photo. This would be so nice if done in grandmoms lap. I love a moving photo and this is so well done.</td>', 'What a sweet photo. This would be so nice if done in grandmoms lap. I love a moving photo and this is so well done.', '2002-06-03 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
