(70161, 2200, 1658, '<td valign="top">I generally have this really stupid prejudice against pictures of hands.    I think it is a tough subject to do well.  However, the execution here as well as the subject are amazing.  This is a commendable effort.  Great job!</td>', 'I generally have this really stupid prejudice against pictures of hands.    I think it is a tough subject to do well.  However, the execution here as well as the subject are amazing.  This is a commendable effort.  Great job!', '2002-06-03 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70162, 2200, 327, '<td valign="top">Moving photo, done VERY well. Super tones. Bravo! Congrats to you!!</td>', 'Moving photo, done VERY well. Super tones. Bravo! Congrats to you!!', '2002-06-03 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
