(70182, 2200, 543, '<td valign="top">The low contrast works here, IMO, although I wouldn''t mind the blacks just a touch denser and a positive gamma adjustment to bring more area into the lighter range.  The one dark area at LL is a little jarring, as the rest of the image is all on one plane.  Not a big deal, just though I''d mention it.  Good work.</td>', 'The low contrast works here, IMO, although I wouldn''t mind the blacks just a touch denser and a positive gamma adjustment to bring more area into the lighter range.  The one dark area at LL is a little jarring, as the rest of the image is all on one plane.  Not a big deal, just though I''d mention it.  Good work.', '2002-06-09 05:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
