(70211, 2202, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, and pretty well exposed (gamma could go up just a little, IMO).  The necklace (which, to my eye, doesn''t match the kartouche - SE asian?), competes for my attention.  The texture on the fg is a minor distration.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, and pretty well exposed (gamma could go up just a little, IMO).  The necklace (which, to my eye, doesn''t match the kartouche - SE asian?), competes for my attention.  The texture on the fg is a minor distration.', '2002-06-05 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
