(70213, 2202, 1446, '<td valign="top">I dont understand the subject of this.  Is it a necklace?  Oh well it doesn''t matter.  Nice contrast,  Interesting dof,  Pretty good capture of what appears to be shiny metal. Nice leading lines into the center of focus.  Because your subject is centered it makes my eyes stop in the middle and not travel any further.</td>', 'I dont understand the subject of this.  Is it a necklace?  Oh well it doesn''t matter.  Nice contrast,  Interesting dof,  Pretty good capture of what appears to be shiny metal. Nice leading lines into the center of focus.  Because your subject is centered it makes my eyes stop in the middle and not travel any further.', '2002-06-05 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70214, 2202, 2023, '<td valign="top">Great detail!</td>', 'Great detail!', '2002-06-05 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70215, 2202, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice, but what''s the message?(This is a joke)  Very good macro shot.   You have good contrast and focus.    Sorry, but I have no constructive remarks.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 B&amp;W 9 total 8<br/></td>', 'Nice, but what''s the message?(This is a joke)  Very good macro shot.   You have good contrast and focus.    Sorry, but I have no constructive remarks.  Photo 9 Creativity 7 B&W 9 total 8', '2002-06-05 20:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70216, 2202, 1031, '<td valign="top">Will you reveal what it says when the voting is over?</td>', 'Will you reveal what it says when the voting is over?', '2002-06-06 01:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70217, 2202, 885, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  Nice composition, and I like the depth of field.</td>', 'Pretty.  Nice composition, and I like the depth of field.', '2002-06-06 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70218, 2202, 1944, '<td valign="top">good product lighting, needs more depth of field, possible more than the camera will give.</td>', 'good product lighting, needs more depth of field, possible more than the camera will give.', '2002-06-06 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70219, 2202, 885, '<td valign="top">Hey, I guessed that this was yours...big discrepancy between cameras and non-cameras there...</td>', 'Hey, I guessed that this was yours...big discrepancy between cameras and non-cameras there...', '2002-06-10 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(70220, 2202, 472, '<td valign="top">lol.  so true .  .  .<br/>how did you know?</td>', 'lol.  so true .  .  .how did you know?', '2002-06-10 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(70221, 2202, 1175, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get comment much this week due to a busy schedule, including the weekend.  I saw this photo and really liked it alot.  You were in my top 10, top 6 or 7 I think actually.</td>', 'I didn''t get comment much this week due to a busy schedule, including the weekend.  I saw this photo and really liked it alot.  You were in my top 10, top 6 or 7 I think actually.', '2002-06-10 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(70222, 2203, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I think it needs a tighter on the right though.... or just move it to the left a bit.</td>', 'Nice shot, I think it needs a tighter on the right though.... or just move it to the left a bit.', '2002-06-03 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70223, 2203, 1211, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Great reflections.  The expression is perfect for this shot.</td>', 'Very cool.  Great reflections.  The expression is perfect for this shot.', '2002-06-03 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70224, 2203, 1379, '<td valign="top">Candid?  I like the reflection in the glasses.</td>', 'Candid?  I like the reflection in the glasses.', '2002-06-03 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70225, 2203, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute title, good portrait. Neat b&amp;w. Good job.</td>', 'Cute title, good portrait. Neat b&w. Good job.', '2002-06-03 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70226, 2203, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast</td>', 'nice contrast', '2002-06-03 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70227, 2203, 2000, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections.</td>', 'Nice reflections.', '2002-06-04 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70228, 2203, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo :)  The reflections in her sunglasses tell me that this was probably done while she was driving...  This scores well with me this week!  The only critique I have to offer is on the crop.. I believe that just a little more extra space above the glasses and below the lips would be very nice... great shot!</td>', 'I really like this photo :)  The reflections in her sunglasses tell me that this was probably done while she was driving...  This scores well with me this week!  The only critique I have to offer is on the crop.. I believe that just a little more extra space above the glasses and below the lips would be very nice... great shot!', '2002-06-04 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70229, 2203, 587, '<td valign="top">I work in salon and I mean this in the nicest way...don''t take close ups without a professional make up job. Lipstick is bleeding and either she is very freckly or she needs some cover up on her nose - close up of womens poors and wrinkles around eyes is not very flattering. (sorry)</td>', 'I work in salon and I mean this in the nicest way...don''t take close ups without a professional make up job. Lipstick is bleeding and either she is very freckly or she needs some cover up on her nose - close up of womens poors and wrinkles around eyes is not very flattering. (sorry)', '2002-06-04 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70230, 2203, 1042, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast here...I think I would have liked it more if there were something different reflected in the glasses though. Otherwise...good job.</td>', 'I like the contrast here...I think I would have liked it more if there were something different reflected in the glasses though. Otherwise...good job.', '2002-06-06 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70231, 2203, 1037, '<td valign="top">This photo creates a really interesting, mysterious mood. The reflections in the sunglasses are a  nice element, making me try to work out what she''s looking at.</td>', 'This photo creates a really interesting, mysterious mood. The reflections in the sunglasses are a  nice element, making me try to work out what she''s looking at.', '2002-06-06 17:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70232, 2203, 368, '<td valign="top">i like the image ... i do wish the skin on the left side wasnt as dark .. but maybe it''s my monitor</td>', 'i like the image ... i do wish the skin on the left side wasnt as dark .. but maybe it''s my monitor', '2002-06-08 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70233, 2203, 543, '<td valign="top">Cropped just slightly too tight for my taste.  I''d like to see the bottom of her lower lip and the tops of her frames.  Gamma needs a boost, too (my monitor calibrated to 2.2).  I do like the focus on just her features, and the shades are a plus.  A polarizer to cut the reflections there might be worth trying.</td>', 'Cropped just slightly too tight for my taste.  I''d like to see the bottom of her lower lip and the tops of her frames.  Gamma needs a boost, too (my monitor calibrated to 2.2).  I do like the focus on just her features, and the shades are a plus.  A polarizer to cut the reflections there might be worth trying.', '2002-06-09 05:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70234, 2203, 255, '<td valign="top">cool framing cool lighting cool shot. my only teeny nit pick is to maybe have pulled the frame a quarter of an inch down to get a little bit more of her bottom lip in the shot, otherwise it is great! nice job.</td>', 'cool framing cool lighting cool shot. my only teeny nit pick is to maybe have pulled the frame a quarter of an inch down to get a little bit more of her bottom lip in the shot, otherwise it is great! nice job.', '2002-06-09 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70235, 2204, 1144, '<td valign="top">very cockey of you to enter such a photo</td>', 'very cockey of you to enter such a photo', '2002-06-03 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70236, 2204, 772, '<td valign="top">The focus on the rooster is a tad soft for my preferences... the shadow does look good though!  Nice shot!</td>', 'The focus on the rooster is a tad soft for my preferences... the shadow does look good though!  Nice shot!', '2002-06-03 03:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70237, 2204, 1908, '<td valign="top">too soft need more focus</td>', 'too soft need more focus', '2002-06-03 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70238, 2204, 1829, '<td valign="top">Great shadow there!!</td>', 'Great shadow there!!', '2002-06-03 07:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70239, 2204, 409, '<td valign="top">haha scary!<br/>would have looked interesting with alot alot of contrast...</td>', 'haha scary!would have looked interesting with alot alot of contrast...', '2002-06-03 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70240, 2204, 573, '<td valign="top">Just too flat, tonaly, no black blacks or white whites.</td>', 'Just too flat, tonaly, no black blacks or white whites.', '2002-06-03 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70241, 2204, 327, '<td valign="top">He''ll be Humpty Dumpty if he''s not careful. Neat shot. Fun.</td>', 'He''ll be Humpty Dumpty if he''s not careful. Neat shot. Fun.', '2002-06-03 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70242, 2204, 441, '<td valign="top">focus looks out here, intentional? I would guess not.</td>', 'focus looks out here, intentional? I would guess not.', '2002-06-03 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70243, 2204, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shadow</td>', 'Nice use of shadow', '2002-06-03 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70244, 2204, 1597, '<td valign="top">to blurry and not enough contrast</td>', 'to blurry and not enough contrast', '2002-06-03 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70245, 2204, 543, '<td valign="top">Looks to me like he''s got an evil twin.  I think you could have spread the contrast around a little better here.  The black eye and white highlight in it show that you do have a full range here, but the rest of the subject is kind of clumped in the middle gray range.  I''d increase the gamma, then punch up the blacks a lot and the whites a little.</td>', 'Looks to me like he''s got an evil twin.  I think you could have spread the contrast around a little better here.  The black eye and white highlight in it show that you do have a full range here, but the rest of the subject is kind of clumped in the middle gray range.  I''d increase the gamma, then punch up the blacks a lot and the whites a little.', '2002-06-04 04:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70246, 2204, 587, '<td valign="top">I think it would have made a better black and white picture if you just used the shadow on the wall. :)</td>', 'I think it would have made a better black and white picture if you just used the shadow on the wall. :)', '2002-06-04 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70247, 2204, 1041, '<td valign="top">Shadows usually work well in b&amp;w, however, IMO, this shot needs more contrast, it''s more gray&amp;gray right now.  Good use of ROT.</td>', 'Shadows usually work well in b&w, however, IMO, this shot needs more contrast, it''s more gray&gray right now.  Good use of ROT.', '2002-06-05 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70248, 2204, 1658, '<td valign="top">This shot would have been much better with either the rooster or the shadow in sharper focus.  I like his profile as it looks in the shadow.</td>', 'This shot would have been much better with either the rooster or the shadow in sharper focus.  I like his profile as it looks in the shadow.', '2002-06-05 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70249, 2204, 1031, '<td valign="top">Where''s his sidekick, the duckling?</td>', 'Where''s his sidekick, the duckling?', '2002-06-05 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(70250, 2204, 637, '<td valign="top">Nothing striking in this image.</td>', 'Nothing striking in this image.', '2002-06-06 03:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70251, 2204, 1446, '<td valign="top">Seems kind of oof and grainy to me.  I do like the shadow.</td>', 'Seems kind of oof and grainy to me.  I do like the shadow.', '2002-06-07 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70252, 2204, 1, '<td valign="top">Shadow is distracting, too much dead space,.</td>', 'Shadow is distracting, too much dead space,.', '2002-06-08 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70253, 2204, 1078, '<td valign="top">Fun.  Really dig the shadow.  Since the shadow, and thus the background, are so important, the dirt and creases (not sure what the darker streak near the shadow or the lighter portions on the right really are) detract from the overall effect.</td>', 'Fun.  Really dig the shadow.  Since the shadow, and thus the background, are so important, the dirt and creases (not sure what the darker streak near the shadow or the lighter portions on the right really are) detract from the overall effect.', '2002-06-09 01:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70254, 2205, 409, '<td valign="top">creative composition <br/>interesting crop</td>', 'creative composition interesting crop', '2002-06-03 07:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70255, 2205, 472, '<td valign="top">so crisp, so clean. dinosaurs on the moon! : D~</td>', 'so crisp, so clean. dinosaurs on the moon! : D~', '2002-06-03 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70256, 2205, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool...</td>', 'Cool...', '2002-06-03 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70257, 2205, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat b&amp;w. Good job cool composition.</td>', 'Neat b&w. Good job cool composition.', '2002-06-03 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70258, 2205, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice contrast would have liked to seen the whole body(if possible)</td>', 'nice contrast would have liked to seen the whole body(if possible)', '2002-06-03 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70259, 2205, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, and nothing to indicate scale...</td>', 'Interesting angle, and nothing to indicate scale...', '2002-06-04 16:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70260, 2205, 811, '<td valign="top">If nothing else, you get the funniest picture this week!  This is hilarious and a perfect example of how breaking the "rules" of photography can be effective.  Maybe if you could have had a slower shutter speed and moved the camera just a touch, you could have gotten some motion trails as well. :-)  Then people could have talked about your focus AND your cropping.</td>', 'If nothing else, you get the funniest picture this week!  This is hilarious and a perfect example of how breaking the "rules" of photography can be effective.  Maybe if you could have had a slower shutter speed and moved the camera just a touch, you could have gotten some motion trails as well. :-)  Then people could have talked about your focus AND your cropping.', '2002-06-04 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70261, 2205, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''ll be curious to see the reaction this one gets.  I like it.  I wish that the skeleton was just a little lower in the frame or angled in such a way that the tail was a little closer to the corner.  However, I also recognize that this likely wasn''t an option given that you were shooting in a museum and had to work in the boundaries they gave you.</td>', 'I''ll be curious to see the reaction this one gets.  I like it.  I wish that the skeleton was just a little lower in the frame or angled in such a way that the tail was a little closer to the corner.  However, I also recognize that this likely wasn''t an option given that you were shooting in a museum and had to work in the boundaries they gave you.', '2002-06-04 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70262, 2205, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo!  I like everything about this shot with the exception of the lighting... the light seems farily hot in the lower portion of the frame... good job!</td>', 'Interesting photo!  I like everything about this shot with the exception of the lighting... the light seems farily hot in the lower portion of the frame... good job!', '2002-06-04 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70263, 2205, 139, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and definitely an appropriate subject for a black and white photo.  The flash casts some harsh shadows, unfortunately.  Also, I think the composition could be improved the feeling of the dino escaping if you could have backed away a bit to add more negative space to the right side.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and definitely an appropriate subject for a black and white photo.  The flash casts some harsh shadows, unfortunately.  Also, I think the composition could be improved the feeling of the dino escaping if you could have backed away a bit to add more negative space to the right side.', '2002-06-06 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70264, 2205, 543, '<td valign="top">That''s how my boss walks.  A bit clinical with the flash, but a great angle - looks like he''s skulking away.</td>', 'That''s how my boss walks.  A bit clinical with the flash, but a great angle - looks like he''s skulking away.', '2002-06-06 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70265, 2205, 1041, '<td valign="top">Caption goes well with photo - good sense of humor.  Nice, non-traditional composition, good contrast.  No real complaints.  Outside of this challenge, I would probably clone some of the shadow out of the photo, but since I assume this was taken in an exhibit somewhere, I''m sure they''d have frowned upon you moving the exhibit for your photo!  ;-)</td>', 'Caption goes well with photo - good sense of humor.  Nice, non-traditional composition, good contrast.  No real complaints.  Outside of this challenge, I would probably clone some of the shadow out of the photo, but since I assume this was taken in an exhibit somewhere, I''m sure they''d have frowned upon you moving the exhibit for your photo!  ;-)', '2002-06-06 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70266, 2205, 582, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and interesting photo, but I don''t understand the title?</td>', 'Nice texture and interesting photo, but I don''t understand the title?', '2002-06-08 00:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70267, 2205, 1, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, nicely done.  Flash may be a little harsh (or whatever lighting you used).</td>', 'Interesting idea, nicely done.  Flash may be a little harsh (or whatever lighting you used).', '2002-06-08 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70268, 2205, 2103, '<td valign="top">he ate his head next time include his noggin</td>', 'he ate his head next time include his noggin', '2002-06-09 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70269, 2206, 1716, '<td valign="top">ray...man..?</td>', 'ray...man..?', '2002-06-03 01:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70270, 2206, 1042, '<td valign="top">Perfection!!  This is truly art.</td>', 'Perfection!!  This is truly art.', '2002-06-03 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70271, 2206, 1226, '<td valign="top">Wow...</td>', 'Wow...', '2002-06-03 02:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70272, 2206, 92, '<td valign="top">The detail is superb ! This is a 10 all the way !</td>', 'The detail is superb ! This is a 10 all the way !', '2002-06-03 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70273, 2206, 1122, '<td valign="top">Marvellous!  I can''t say anything negative about this.<br/>It''s sharp. It''s eye-catching. It''s a great work!</td>', 'Marvellous!  I can''t say anything negative about this.It''s sharp. It''s eye-catching. It''s a great work!', '2002-06-03 06:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70274, 2206, 1908, '<td valign="top">WOW great shoot</td>', 'WOW great shoot', '2002-06-03 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70275, 2206, 1829, '<td valign="top">You are up there on creativity - a well deserved 10</td>', 'You are up there on creativity - a well deserved 10', '2002-06-03 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70276, 2206, 409, '<td valign="top">nice and abstract</td>', 'nice and abstract', '2002-06-03 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70277, 2206, 1540, '<td valign="top">very nice , tied for my top vote.. great work</td>', 'very nice , tied for my top vote.. great work', '2002-06-03 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70278, 2206, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Superb detail.  Only detraction being that this was submitted for a B&amp;W challenge, probably was better in color.  Only reason it is not a 10 in my book.</td>', 'Great shot.  Superb detail.  Only detraction being that this was submitted for a B&W challenge, probably was better in color.  Only reason it is not a 10 in my book.', '2002-06-03 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70279, 2206, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice texture, good tone and a good photo. Nice work.</td>', 'Nice texture, good tone and a good photo. Nice work.', '2002-06-03 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70280, 2206, 1009, '<td valign="top">Wow.</td>', 'Wow.', '2002-06-03 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70281, 2206, 455, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of image I aspire to take.</td>', 'This is the sort of image I aspire to take.', '2002-06-03 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70282, 2206, 368, '<td valign="top">the drops of water look like balls of glass ... nice and crisp ...</td>', 'the drops of water look like balls of glass ... nice and crisp ...', '2002-06-03 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70283, 2206, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice macro shot.  great detail - very sharp.</td>', 'nice macro shot.  great detail - very sharp.', '2002-06-04 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70284, 2206, 1882, '<td valign="top">i like it.</td>', 'i like it.', '2002-06-04 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70285, 2206, 1897, '<td valign="top">As Mr. Burns would say, "excellent"</td>', 'As Mr. Burns would say, "excellent"', '2002-06-04 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70286, 2206, 1078, '<td valign="top">I really like the photo a LOT.  If I had to find anything wrong, I''d point out the couple of water drops that are kind of "flat," but it''s so minor, it''s part of the easter egg hunt.</td>', 'I really like the photo a LOT.  If I had to find anything wrong, I''d point out the couple of water drops that are kind of "flat," but it''s so minor, it''s part of the easter egg hunt.', '2002-06-04 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70287, 2206, 885, '<td valign="top">Is that really a leaf?  It looks so flat.  Great composition, lighting on the waterdrops, background...it all goes together quite nicely.  Good job.</td>', 'Is that really a leaf?  It looks so flat.  Great composition, lighting on the waterdrops, background...it all goes together quite nicely.  Good job.', '2002-06-04 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70288, 2206, 811, '<td valign="top">Normally, leaves and water don''t inspire me, but this picture is awesom.  Great capture of the texture of the leaves, and the water droplets give it depth.  Very nice!</td>', 'Normally, leaves and water don''t inspire me, but this picture is awesom.  Great capture of the texture of the leaves, and the water droplets give it depth.  Very nice!', '2002-06-04 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70289, 2206, 1446, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent macro. Very good focus.  Interesting composition.  Cant see anything I would change.</td>', 'This is an excellent macro. Very good focus.  Interesting composition.  Cant see anything I would change.', '2002-06-04 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70290, 2206, 1944, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2002-06-04 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70291, 2206, 258, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2002-06-04 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70292, 2206, 587, '<td valign="top">WOW. I''d give my ''I'' teeth to beable to take a macro like this. fantastic. The only thing I would change would be to get the whole leaf in the shot. more! more! :) great job. A winner.</td>', 'WOW. I''d give my ''I'' teeth to beable to take a macro like this. fantastic. The only thing I would change would be to get the whole leaf in the shot. more! more! :) great job. A winner.', '2002-06-05 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70293, 2206, 543, '<td valign="top">Sure glad I didn''t submit my water drops this week.  This is just about perfect - the detail, tonal range, clarity and composition are all first rate.  Top 3, IMO.</td>', 'Sure glad I didn''t submit my water drops this week.  This is just about perfect - the detail, tonal range, clarity and composition are all first rate.  Top 3, IMO.', '2002-06-05 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70294, 2206, 641, '<td valign="top">wow.. great macro! Great lighting, sharp, good contrast.</td>', 'wow.. great macro! Great lighting, sharp, good contrast.', '2002-06-05 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70295, 2206, 472, '<td valign="top">this is easily one of my 5 top shots.  the lighting, the detail, and the refraction of the water droplets, elevate this pic head and shoulders above the majority.  the tip of the leaf where it curls is slightly oof, but that doesnt detract too much for me.  a 9.</td>', 'this is easily one of my 5 top shots.  the lighting, the detail, and the refraction of the water droplets, elevate this pic head and shoulders above the majority.  the tip of the leaf where it curls is slightly oof, but that doesnt detract too much for me.  a 9.', '2002-06-05 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70296, 2206, 2023, '<td valign="top">Very clear and sharp picture, i like the magnifying glass effect!</td>', 'Very clear and sharp picture, i like the magnifying glass effect!', '2002-06-05 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70297, 2206, 741, '<td valign="top">Love the lens effects of the droplets - catchlight from the flash looks good.  Did you try this in colour?</td>', 'Love the lens effects of the droplets - catchlight from the flash looks good.  Did you try this in colour?', '2002-06-05 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70298, 2206, 1357, '<td valign="top">I like taking photo of stuff with water on as drops of water always seem to stand out well.</td>', 'I like taking photo of stuff with water on as drops of water always seem to stand out well.', '2002-06-05 19:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70299, 2206, 661, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!</td>', 'Neat shot!', '2002-06-05 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
