(70301, 2206, 637, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve catpured the detail on the leaf.  Perhaps I''d like it better if I saw the whole leaf in the frame.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve catpured the detail on the leaf.  Perhaps I''d like it better if I saw the whole leaf in the frame.', '2002-06-06 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70302, 2206, 1707, '<td valign="top">The rain drops really bring out the texture of the leaf.  I''m glad to see a rain drop on the tip of the leaf too.</td>', 'The rain drops really bring out the texture of the leaf.  I''m glad to see a rain drop on the tip of the leaf too.', '2002-06-06 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70303, 2206, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! The leaf structure comes up beautifully, and the drops of water magnify parts of it just to drive the point home of its fractal complexity, and then tease you with their spherical simplicity. Nature is... well... read Wordsworth to see how I feel about this photo :) 10!</td>', 'Wonderful! The leaf structure comes up beautifully, and the drops of water magnify parts of it just to drive the point home of its fractal complexity, and then tease you with their spherical simplicity. Nature is... well... read Wordsworth to see how I feel about this photo :) 10!', '2002-06-06 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70304, 2206, 875, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting, great focus, stunning detail - an all around gorgeous photo. One of my top two.</td>', 'Perfect lighting, great focus, stunning detail - an all around gorgeous photo. One of my top two.', '2002-06-06 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70305, 2206, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Nice B&amp;W for contrast and texture.</td>', 'Nice macro. Nice B&W for contrast and texture.', '2002-06-06 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70306, 2206, 139, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this one will win.  I love the structures emphasized by the b&amp;w, I love the lighting, and I love the crispness.  I would really like to see it in color, but I''m guessing I like it better in b&amp;w (which is really saying something, considering I don''t generally like b&amp;w at all).</td>', 'I''m guessing this one will win.  I love the structures emphasized by the b&w, I love the lighting, and I love the crispness.  I would really like to see it in color, but I''m guessing I like it better in b&w (which is really saying something, considering I don''t generally like b&w at all).', '2002-06-06 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70307, 2206, 2060, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range, just lost the d.o.f at the bottom, I like this one.</td>', 'Great tonal range, just lost the d.o.f at the bottom, I like this one.', '2002-06-07 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
