(70361, 2209, 2, '<td valign="top">The photo seems washed out -- I''m not sure if it''s a misty day, or if that''s just your camera.  Either way, I''d try to push the levels apart a little further, so the image has higher contrast.  Great use of symmetry.</td>', 'The photo seems washed out -- I''m not sure if it''s a misty day, or if that''s just your camera.  Either way, I''d try to push the levels apart a little further, so the image has higher contrast.  Great use of symmetry.', '2002-06-04 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70362, 2209, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the way the buildings on the left and right form a "frame" and I like the way the middle building has upward motion about it.  I feel like it should have been taken from just a hair or two to the left, but I imagine that would have put you in the middle of a road (not a good thing).</td>', 'I like the way the buildings on the left and right form a "frame" and I like the way the middle building has upward motion about it.  I feel like it should have been taken from just a hair or two to the left, but I imagine that would have put you in the middle of a road (not a good thing).', '2002-06-04 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
