(70400, 2210, 1909, '<td valign="top">Good effect filling the whole frame. Was this taken like this or cropped afterwards?</td>', 'Good effect filling the whole frame. Was this taken like this or cropped afterwards?', '2002-06-05 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70401, 2210, 772, '<td valign="top">I can''t really think of a better subject for a black and white challenge... This is a really great photo.. these lines are dazzling to my eye and I am proud to give this photo a 10 this week... nice work!</td>', 'I can''t really think of a better subject for a black and white challenge... This is a really great photo.. these lines are dazzling to my eye and I am proud to give this photo a 10 this week... nice work!', '2002-06-05 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70402, 2210, 2023, '<td valign="top">Nice stripes</td>', 'Nice stripes', '2002-06-05 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70403, 2210, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph, almost an abstract.  Well done!</td>', 'This is a great photograph, almost an abstract.  Well done!', '2002-06-05 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70404, 2210, 885, '<td valign="top">neat composition, and great subject</td>', 'neat composition, and great subject', '2002-06-05 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70405, 2210, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really nice, you win.    Sorry, but I have no constructive remarks.  Strong black w/good contrast.  (Isn''t the subject already in b&amp;w?  Doesn''t that count?)  Photo 10 Creativity 10 B&amp;W 10 total (what else?) 10</td>', 'Really nice, you win.    Sorry, but I have no constructive remarks.  Strong black w/good contrast.  (Isn''t the subject already in b&w?  Doesn''t that count?)  Photo 10 Creativity 10 B&W 10 total (what else?) 10', '2002-06-05 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70406, 2210, 543, '<td valign="top">The all-time classic B/W pattern.  Looks like it''s been stretched vertically?</td>', 'The all-time classic B/W pattern.  Looks like it''s been stretched vertically?', '2002-06-06 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70407, 2210, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure . . . I think this one would look better in color!  J/k.  To be honest, I can''t make up my mind about this one.  It''s a great b&amp;w subject, an interesting composition, technically ok, but for some reason I can''t pinpoint why I''m not excited about it.  I think it''s just a tad too busy for me.  No points deducted for my indecision though.</td>', 'I''m not sure . . . I think this one would look better in color!  J/k.  To be honest, I can''t make up my mind about this one.  It''s a great b&w subject, an interesting composition, technically ok, but for some reason I can''t pinpoint why I''m not excited about it.  I think it''s just a tad too busy for me.  No points deducted for my indecision though.', '2002-06-07 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70408, 2210, 255, '<td valign="top">this is one of the best animal shots i have ever seen. nice nice nice!</td>', 'this is one of the best animal shots i have ever seen. nice nice nice!', '2002-06-07 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70409, 2210, 139, '<td valign="top">I was really hoping to see a zebra photo this challenge, but I never imagined it would be this good.  I absolutely love the composition of this photo.</td>', 'I was really hoping to see a zebra photo this challenge, but I never imagined it would be this good.  I absolutely love the composition of this photo.', '2002-06-08 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70410, 2210, 2077, '<td valign="top">Interesting !</td>', 'Interesting !', '2002-06-08 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70411, 2210, 875, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect subject for black and white.  I''m dizzy just looking at the photo.</td>', 'This is a perfect subject for black and white.  I''m dizzy just looking at the photo.', '2002-06-09 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70412, 2210, 2103, '<td valign="top">I love Ze bras</td>', 'I love Ze bras', '2002-06-09 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70413, 2210, 1078, '<td valign="top">For those who are interested, Grevy is the name for the kind of zebra pictured.  I wanted to use the zebra''s name, but couldn''t track down the information.</td>', 'For those who are interested, Grevy is the name for the kind of zebra pictured.  I wanted to use the zebra''s name, but couldn''t track down the information.', '2002-06-10 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(70414, 2210, 1897, '<td valign="top">I probably would have given this a ten, but the contrast seemed a little low.  it is definitely good.</td>', 'I probably would have given this a ten, but the contrast seemed a little low.  it is definitely good.', '2002-06-11 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(70415, 2211, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like using the ROT rule, too, however, IMO it works better (in most cases) if there''s something in the background.  Also would like to see just little more DOF.  Interesting angle though.  Could''ve used that for upside down as well!</td>', 'I like using the ROT rule, too, however, IMO it works better (in most cases) if there''s something in the background.  Also would like to see just little more DOF.  Interesting angle though.  Could''ve used that for upside down as well!', '2002-06-03 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70416, 2211, 327, '<td valign="top">&amp;lt;g&amp;gt; Your title is cute as a _bug_! Sorry had to say that. Creative idea. Nice job.</td>', '&lt;g&gt; Your title is cute as a _bug_! Sorry had to say that. Creative idea. Nice job.', '2002-06-03 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70417, 2211, 1211, '<td valign="top">The antennae seem out of focus.</td>', 'The antennae seem out of focus.', '2002-06-03 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70418, 2211, 1009, '<td valign="top">Hehe... nice idea. Maybe a tighter crop if possible. Good job...</td>', 'Hehe... nice idea. Maybe a tighter crop if possible. Good job...', '2002-06-03 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70419, 2211, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this photo! Insects can be such fascinating subjects, especially for black and white.</td>', 'I love this photo! Insects can be such fascinating subjects, especially for black and white.', '2002-06-04 04:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70420, 2211, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat photo... I''m not really sure how to go about commenting... I''m not sure what camera you use, but I would really love this shot as a vertical crop... good job!</td>', 'This is a neat photo... I''m not really sure how to go about commenting... I''m not sure what camera you use, but I would really love this shot as a vertical crop... good job!', '2002-06-04 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70421, 2211, 1446, '<td valign="top">This photograph appears to be out of focus to me.</td>', 'This photograph appears to be out of focus to me.', '2002-06-04 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70422, 2211, 587, '<td valign="top">Love the texture you captured on its wings, wish his face was crisper - nasty looking things though. good job.</td>', 'Love the texture you captured on its wings, wish his face was crisper - nasty looking things though. good job.', '2002-06-05 00:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70423, 2211, 543, '<td valign="top">I wonder if that''s his best side.  Don''t know if the space at right adds anything worthwhile.  Nice contrast, but sharpness could be better.</td>', 'I wonder if that''s his best side.  Don''t know if the space at right adds anything worthwhile.  Nice contrast, but sharpness could be better.', '2002-06-05 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70424, 2211, 1357, '<td valign="top">Would of got a lot more detail if you had turned the camera to take this shot. Seems as if half the picture was wasted though.</td>', 'Would of got a lot more detail if you had turned the camera to take this shot. Seems as if half the picture was wasted though.', '2002-06-05 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70425, 2211, 1031, '<td valign="top">At least it''s not TOO scary at this magnification...</td>', 'At least it''s not TOO scary at this magnification...', '2002-06-06 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70426, 2211, 806, '<td valign="top">Contrast good. Elicited personal emotion bad! ;) (I just happen to hate moths - but I will not let that influence my objectivity!)<br/></td>', 'Contrast good. Elicited personal emotion bad! ;) (I just happen to hate moths - but I will not let that influence my objectivity!)', '2002-06-06 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70427, 2211, 313, '<td valign="top">mike, the sheer creepiness of this bug astounds me.  the fact that bugs are, or appear to be, hairy is one of the sickest things i can imagine.  of course, sicker yet is the idea that that foul thing was hanging out on door like that.  at any rate, i wanted to comment that this isn''t your best work.  while interesting in it''s gruesome way, i don''t think it matches the standard you''ve set for yourself with your previous couple of challenges.</td>', 'mike, the sheer creepiness of this bug astounds me.  the fact that bugs are, or appear to be, hairy is one of the sickest things i can imagine.  of course, sicker yet is the idea that that foul thing was hanging out on door like that.  at any rate, i wanted to comment that this isn''t your best work.  while interesting in it''s gruesome way, i don''t think it matches the standard you''ve set for yourself with your previous couple of challenges.', '2002-06-07 03:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70428, 2211, 917, '<td valign="top">I always get problems with the antennae out of focus, or blurred if I use a longer exposure. Not much you can do about it.</td>', 'I always get problems with the antennae out of focus, or blurred if I use a longer exposure. Not much you can do about it.', '2002-06-07 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70429, 2211, 878, '<td valign="top">Where are the twins :)</td>', 'Where are the twins :)', '2002-06-07 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70430, 2211, 1043, '<td valign="top">this is such a cool pictire, well done</td>', 'this is such a cool pictire, well done', '2002-06-09 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70431, 2211, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, well done.  The lighter background makes for a nice contrast.</td>', 'Nice focus, well done.  The lighter background makes for a nice contrast.', '2002-06-10 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70432, 2212, 1829, '<td valign="top">I think the title is very appropriate!!</td>', 'I think the title is very appropriate!!', '2002-06-03 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70433, 2212, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice family shot.  Good capture, good b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice family shot.  Good capture, good b&w.', '2002-06-03 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70434, 2212, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I think that B&amp;W detracts instead of adding something.</td>', 'Great shot, but I think that B&W detracts instead of adding something.', '2002-06-03 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70435, 2212, 671, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition!  What''d you have to pay them to strike that pose? :)</td>', 'Excellent composition!  What''d you have to pay them to strike that pose? :)', '2002-06-03 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70436, 2212, 1031, '<td valign="top">Always, more kid pics! No, really, great grouping, good detail. If there was enough resolution, I''d have probably cropped a little tighter, maybe from the top-right or lower-left, ending up with the group off-center.</td>', 'Always, more kid pics! No, really, great grouping, good detail. If there was enough resolution, I''d have probably cropped a little tighter, maybe from the top-right or lower-left, ending up with the group off-center.', '2002-06-04 04:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70437, 2212, 1037, '<td valign="top">I tried to photograph some pelicans on a lake for this challenge, but they were too far away :(. Very nice shot, the ducklings are gorgeous, and the way they are grouped is very nicely caught and framed.</td>', 'I tried to photograph some pelicans on a lake for this challenge, but they were too far away :(. Very nice shot, the ducklings are gorgeous, and the way they are grouped is very nicely caught and framed.', '2002-06-04 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70438, 2212, 661, '<td valign="top">cute image.</td>', 'cute image.', '2002-06-04 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70439, 2212, 1597, '<td valign="top">nice shot good contrast</td>', 'nice shot good contrast', '2002-06-04 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70440, 2212, 772, '<td valign="top">nice shot!</td>', 'nice shot!', '2002-06-04 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70441, 2212, 2000, '<td valign="top">i like the composition.  say "Quack"</td>', 'i like the composition.  say "Quack"', '2002-06-05 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70442, 2212, 641, '<td valign="top">Hey you must have been vacationing where I was last weekend. I got tons of shots of these little guys. Good catch.</td>', 'Hey you must have been vacationing where I was last weekend. I got tons of shots of these little guys. Good catch.', '2002-06-05 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70443, 2212, 637, '<td valign="top">Got about 6 outtakes of this same scene.</td>', 'Got about 6 outtakes of this same scene.', '2002-06-06 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70444, 2212, 1, '<td valign="top">I think auto-leveling this photo could''ve made it more appealing.</td>', 'I think auto-leveling this photo could''ve made it more appealing.', '2002-06-10 00:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70445, 2212, 472, '<td valign="top">very very cute : ) <br/><br/>I agree with langdon''s suggestion.  give it a try!  i can show you how if you want .. message me.</td>', 'very very cute : ) I agree with langdon''s suggestion.  give it a try!  i can show you how if you want .. message me.', '2002-07-12 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(70446, 2213, 1122, '<td valign="top">Looks like the skin of zebra</td>', 'Looks like the skin of zebra', '2002-06-03 03:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70447, 2213, 1908, '<td valign="top">good shoot just needed to get in the top of the fence railings closest to you</td>', 'good shoot just needed to get in the top of the fence railings closest to you', '2002-06-03 06:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70448, 2213, 409, '<td valign="top">excelent <br/>love the lines.. geometry and shadows</td>', 'excelent love the lines.. geometry and shadows', '2002-06-03 08:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
