(70494, 2214, 1041, '<td valign="top">Now this is a shot that I would like to have taken.  Usually done (and done well) in color, it is very intriguing in b&amp;w.  Well executed! :)  I would probably have cropped just a tad more off the top (outside of this challenge of course) to emphasize the ROT.</td>', 'Now this is a shot that I would like to have taken.  Usually done (and done well) in color, it is very intriguing in b&w.  Well executed! :)  I would probably have cropped just a tad more off the top (outside of this challenge of course) to emphasize the ROT.', '2002-06-04 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
