(70552, 2217, 772, '<td valign="top">Lego ships are cool!  Good job with the backgorund and the lighting on this photo... the slight wrinkles in the background could possibly have been smoothed out a liltle for a minor improvement... good job!</td>', 'Lego ships are cool!  Good job with the backgorund and the lighting on this photo... the slight wrinkles in the background could possibly have been smoothed out a liltle for a minor improvement... good job!', '2002-06-03 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
