(70556, 2217, 1009, '<td valign="top">Hehe... original. I like it.</td>', 'Hehe... original. I like it.', '2002-06-03 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70557, 2217, 543, '<td valign="top">The different colored legos make nice, distinct blacks and whites, with a couple of gray shades between.  This could be a good subject, but I''d like to see it from an angle that''s more interesting.  Maybe turned toward the camera, but on a bit of an angle sot hat the pilot''s face showed.  You wouldn''t necessarily have to include all of the ship in the image - might make it look less toylike.  The composition, as it is, is very static and centered - not what you want for your starfighter.  Whites seem blown out, as well.</td>', 'The different colored legos make nice, distinct blacks and whites, with a couple of gray shades between.  This could be a good subject, but I''d like to see it from an angle that''s more interesting.  Maybe turned toward the camera, but on a bit of an angle sot hat the pilot''s face showed.  You wouldn''t necessarily have to include all of the ship in the image - might make it look less toylike.  The composition, as it is, is very static and centered - not what you want for your starfighter.  Whites seem blown out, as well.', '2002-06-04 03:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70558, 2217, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great focus and dof.  Contrast good.  The composition is somewhat boring to me. Doing something other than centering the subject in the center may have helped this shot to pull me in a little.</td>', 'Great focus and dof.  Contrast good.  The composition is somewhat boring to me. Doing something other than centering the subject in the center may have helped this shot to pull me in a little.', '2002-06-05 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70559, 2217, 1658, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast in the shot, but the subject matter didn''t do a lot for me in the black and white context.</td>', 'Nice contrast in the shot, but the subject matter didn''t do a lot for me in the black and white context.', '2002-06-05 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70560, 2217, 1031, '<td valign="top">Those look like Logos --good modelling job to contrast different structures. Has a look of being ready to move.</td>', 'Those look like Logos --good modelling job to contrast different structures. Has a look of being ready to move.', '2002-06-05 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70561, 2217, 1175, '<td valign="top">Flash is too harsh.  Try some indirect or diffused lighting.  Try not to light your background.  The wrinkles in the cloth make it appear cheap.  Try different angles on your subject, dead on from the left, right, top, bottom, front or back is never gonna look as good as a diagonal view.  Try not to stick your subject smack dab in the middle.  Look up "rule of thirds".</td>', 'Flash is too harsh.  Try some indirect or diffused lighting.  Try not to light your background.  The wrinkles in the cloth make it appear cheap.  Try different angles on your subject, dead on from the left, right, top, bottom, front or back is never gonna look as good as a diagonal view.  Try not to stick your subject smack dab in the middle.  Look up "rule of thirds".', '2002-06-05 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70562, 2217, 1908, '<td valign="top">should have turned the space craft around would have been more powerful shoot</td>', 'should have turned the space craft around would have been more powerful shoot', '2002-06-06 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70563, 2217, 387, '<td valign="top">Suspend the fighter from a tree with black thread and shoot at an angle so that you can see the stars. Get back far enough that you have to use the zoom so you get plenty of Depth of Field. Light it with a porch light or flashlight and do not use flash. Make sure there is no wind to avoid motion trails.</td>', 'Suspend the fighter from a tree with black thread and shoot at an angle so that you can see the stars. Get back far enough that you have to use the zoom so you get plenty of Depth of Field. Light it with a porch light or flashlight and do not use flash. Make sure there is no wind to avoid motion trails.', '2002-06-09 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(70564, 2217, 1, '<td valign="top">Eh.  Very plain, nothing enticing, try a different angle if anything.</td>', 'Eh.  Very plain, nothing enticing, try a different angle if anything.', '2002-06-10 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
